insert into `products` values('1','101 0514','417','3-ring Binder Vinyl CD Page (10 Pack)','4.66','5.06','0.00','Our binder disc pages are perfect for efficiently storing CDs or DVDs. Use your existing 3-ring binders to make your own media library. Each sheet features 2 pockets. 10 sheets per pack.','0.4','y','y','','','0','1','0','Our binder disc pages are perfect for efficiently storing CDs or DVDs. Use your existing 3-ring binders to make your own media library. Each sheet features 2 pockets. 10 sheets per pack.','','cd binder,disk storage,disk holders,pages,storage,folder,cd binder,dvd binder','Media>Media Storage Solutions','P1798.jpg','P1798a.jpg','P1798a.jpg','0.00','0','0','0','0','0','1','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
 ('2','101 0516','417','Self-adhesive CD Security Envelope (10 Pack)','4.46','5.06','0.00','','0.4','y','y','n','y','0','2','0','holders,envelope,sleeve,sleeves','Use our self adhesive security envelopes to package CDs with books, training manuals or products. The adhesive back sticks to nearly any surface and the security seal lets you know if the product has','Use our self adhesive security envelopes to package CDs with books, training manuals or products. The adhesive back sticks to nearly any surface and the security seal lets you know if the product has been used.','Media>Media Storage Solutions','thumb_2_P1799.jpg','detail_2_P1799a.jpg','large_2_P1799a.jpg','0.00','0','0','0','0','0','1','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
 ('3','101 0529','374','Thermaltake Ibox 5.25in Drive Bay Storage Box, Blk','9.58','10.41','0.00','Convert an unused 5.25 expansion bay on your PC into a useful storage drawer. Keep your CD-ROMs, business cards, flash media, office supplies or other goodies tucked away neatly. Includes mounting sc','0.75','y','y','','','0','3','0','Convert an unused 5.25 expansion bay on your PC into a useful storage drawer. Keep your CD-ROMs, business cards, flash media, office supplies or other goodies tucked away neatly. Includes mounting screws.','','black,ibox,5.25,drive,bay,storage,box,black','Computer Components>Cases &amp; Components>Case Accessories','P25438.jpg','P25438a.jpg','P25438a.jpg','0.00','0','0','0','0','0','1','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
 ('3233','245 0771','325',' IOGEAR Bluetooth 2.0 USB Micro Adapter GBU421','21.38','23.24','0.00','About the size of a grape, the IOGEAR Bluetooth 2.0 USB Micro Adapter connects your computer to Bluetooth devices like cell phones, PDAs, mice and keyboards. Because it&#39;s so small, it can fit in your','0.2','y','y','','','0','170','1','About the size of a grape, the IOGEAR Bluetooth 2.0 USB Micro Adapter connects your computer to Bluetooth devices like cell phones, PDAs, mice and keyboards. Because it&#39;s so small, it can fit in your computer without blocking any adjacent USB ports. Its Bluetooth 2.0 + EDR technology provides for transfer rates up to 3 times faster than Bluetooth 1.1 and 1.2 adapters. Supports the following services: generic access (GAP), serial port (SPP), FAX, network access (LAP), dial-up networking (DUN), object push (OPP) headset (HSP), remote control (AVRCP), file transfer (FTP), audio gateway (A2DP), human input devices (HID) and synchronization. Includes software on CD-ROM. Requires Microsoft Windows 2000+ or Mac OS v10.3.9+.','','usb,blue,tooth,adapter','Networking>Wireless Networking (WiFi)>Bluetooth Adapters','P25640.jpg','P25640a.jpg','P25640a.jpg','0.00','-1','1','0','0','0','1','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
 ('4','101 0527','0','5.25in Storage Drawer, Black','10.00','0.00','0.00','Convert an unused 5.25 expansion bay on your PC into a useful storage drawer. Keep your CD-ROMs, business cards, flash media, office supplies or other goodies tucked away neatly.','0.9','','','n','n','0','117','1','Convert an unused 5.25 expansion bay on your PC into a useful storage drawer. Keep your CD-ROMs, business cards, flash media, office supplies or other goodies tucked away neatly.','5.25in Storage Drawer, Black','computer drawer. drive bay drawer,drawer,drive drawer','Convert an unused 5.25 expansion bay on your PC into a useful storage drawer. Keep your CD-ROMs, business cards, flash media, office supplies or other goodies tucked away neatly.','P10960.jpg','P10960a.jpg','P10960a.jpg','0.00','0','0','0','0','0','0','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
 ('3230','900 0002','1','KeyJack','19.95','24.95','0.00','A Macintosh application for the Ergodex DX1. A universal binary program, the KeyJack application supports both 10.4.x and 10.5.x operating system releases. ','0','y','y','y','y','0','403','2','Keyjack permits the user to assign individual keystrokes, multiple keystrokes, modifer keys, menu items and more to individual DX1 keys. In addition, users can start applications, send Applescripts and events to other applications. Each application can have its own set of key events stored in application profiles and profiles are switched automatically as you move between applications.','','','','thumb_3230_adminindex.php.png','detail_3230_kjApp.png','large_3230_kjApp.png','0.00','83','18','0','0','0','1','n','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
 ('6','101 0760','417','One Touch CD Box, Holds 80 CDs, Dk Silver','16.68','18.13','0.00','The One Touch Storage Box features a space-saving design and huge disk storage capacity. At touch of a button, the loaded drawer smoothly glides out for easy access so you can efficiently organize and','4.7','y','y','','','0','254','1','The One Touch Storage Box features a space-saving design and huge disk storage capacity. At touch of a button, the loaded drawer smoothly glides out for easy access so you can efficiently organize and store your CDs/DVDs. Includes easy-to read labels and clear hanging pockets for as many as 80 disks and the boxes are designed to stack securely together, ensuring this storage solution grows with your disk collection!','','DVD,dvd storage,movie storage,disk holder,cd holder,dvd holder,disc holder','Media>Media Storage Solutions','P5936.jpg','P5936a.jpg','P5936a.jpg','0.00','1','0','0','0','0','0','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
 ('7','101 0761','417','One Touch CD Box, Holds 80 CDs, Black','16.36','17.79','0.00','The One Touch Storage Box features a space-saving design and huge disc storage capacity. At touch of a button, the loaded drawer smoothly glides out for easy access so you can efficiently organize and','4.7','y','y','','','0','254','1','The One Touch Storage Box features a space-saving design and huge disc storage capacity. At touch of a button, the loaded drawer smoothly glides out for easy access so you can efficiently organize and store your CDs/DVDs. Includes easy-to read labels and clear hanging pockets for as many as 80 discs and the boxes are designed to stack securely together, ensuring this storage solution grows with your disc collection!','','cd holder, cd box, cd storage','Media>Media Storage Solutions','P12108.jpg','P12108a.jpg','P12108a.jpg','0.00','1','0','0','0','0','0','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
 ('8','101 0765','417','Hipce Filing Box, Holds 100 Discs, Faux Leather','20.84','22.65','0.00','These indexed disc files manage your growing disc media collection with a touch of style. With a durable faux leather covering, the padded box features a sliding drawer that holds 50 double-sided hang','5.8','y','y','','','0','254','1','These indexed disc files manage your growing disc media collection with a touch of style. With a durable faux leather covering, the padded box features a sliding drawer that holds 50 double-sided hanging disc files. Fill out the drawer&#39;s index card to help you efficiently locate your discs. Discs not included.','','HIPCE, faux leather,disc filling,disk storage,cd storage,dvd storage','Media>Media Storage Solutions','P15824.jpg','P15824a.jpg','P15824a.jpg','0.00','1','0','0','0','0','0','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
 ('3513','148 0056','157','Case Fan, 80x80x25mm, Hydro-wave, 3450rpm, 3-pin','8.18','8.89','0.00','Panasonic&#39;s HydroWave bearing addresses the traditional weakness of sleeve bearings... axial friction. The thrust plate floats on a circulating film of oil, which reduces the axial friction and prol','0.3','y','y','','y','0','286','0','Panasonic&#39;s HydroWave bearing addresses the traditional weakness of sleeve bearings... axial friction. The thrust plate floats on a circulating film of oil, which reduces the axial friction and prolongs bearing life. The HydroWave pattern on the bearing almost eliminates thrust plate contact.','',' ','Computer Components>Cases &amp; Components>Case Fans','P29698.jpg','P29698a.jpg','P29698a.jpg','0.00','0','0','0','0','0','1','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
 ('9','101 0766','417','Hipce Filing Box, Holds 200 Discs, Faux Leather','39.12','42.53','0.00','Have more discs than you can keep track of? Use the HIPCE indexed filing boxes to stylishly manage your collection. Padded with an elegant faux leather covering, the box features two sliding drawers t','10.6','y','y','','','0','254','1','Have more discs than you can keep track of? Use the HIPCE indexed filing boxes to stylishly manage your collection. Padded with an elegant faux leather covering, the box features two sliding drawers that hold 50 double-sided hanging disc files each. Fill out the drawer&#39;s index card to enable easy disc searching. Discs not included.','','HIPCE, faux leather,disc filling,disk storage,cd storage,dvd storage','Media>Media Storage Solutions','P15825.jpg','P15825a.jpg','P15825a.jpg','0.00','1','0','0','0','0','0','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
 ('10','103 0111','399','Heat And Cold Therapy Wrist Rest','15.47','16.81','0.00','Give your wrists some soothing heat/cold therapy while you work. This unique keyboard wrist rest has a hot/cold pack built right in. Simply place the pack in the microwave or freezer to set its temper','1','y','y','','','0','14','1','Give your wrists some soothing heat/cold therapy while you work. This unique keyboard wrist rest has a hot/cold pack built right in. Simply place the pack in the microwave or freezer to set its temperature. The heat from a warm pack will increase the blood circulation to your hands or or use the pack cold to relieve aggravated joints.','','hot,cold,pack,heat,and cold,therapy,wrist,rest','Ergonomic Products>Ergonomic Wrist Support','P19873.jpg','P19873a.jpg','P19873a.jpg','0.00','1','0','0','0','0','0','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
 ('11','103 0123','0','Memory Foam Bendable Wrist Rest, Black','13.74','0.00','0.00','This wrist rest uses memory foam that naturally cushions tension points on your wrist, but what really makes it unique is its bendable design. It bends to fit the shape of your keyboard and then holds','0.5','','','n','n','0','150','1','This wrist rest uses memory foam that naturally cushions tension points on your wrist, but what really makes it unique is its bendable design. It bends to fit the shape of your keyboard and then holds that shape for customized wrist support.','Memory Foam Bendable Wrist Rest, Black','wrist rest,memory foam,foam rest,rest','This wrist rest uses memory foam that naturally cushions tension points on your wrist, but what really makes it unique is its bendable design. It bends to fit the shape of your keyboard and then holds','P14677.jpg','P14677a.jpg','P14677a.jpg','0.00','1','0','0','0','0','0','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
 ('12','103 0178','399','Ergobeads Smartglove Wrist Support, Small','15.33','16.66','0.00','The SmartGlove is designed to help relieve hand fatigue and repetitive stress injuries while you&#39;re keyboarding and mousing. Smooth ergoBeads fill its under-palm wrist cushion, providing ergonomic sup','0.15','y','y','','','0','115','1','The SmartGlove is designed to help relieve hand fatigue and repetitive stress injuries while you&#39;re keyboarding and mousing. Smooth ergoBeads fill its under-palm wrist cushion, providing ergonomic support and a gentle massage for better circulation. A firm removable stiffener in the upper pocket encourages you to keep your wrist in a neutral position. Turn the glove inside out to reverse it for left-handed use.','','ergo,beads,smartglove,wrist,support','Ergonomic Products>Ergonomic Wrist Support','P20322.jpg','P20322a.jpg','P20322a.jpg','0.00','1','0','0','0','0','0','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
