nt applications;Buzzer;SNMP Traps. OS Support Windows,Mac,Sun,Linux,Unix,AIX,DOS 6.2+. Code Set Support ISO646-US(US ASCII),ISO8859-15(Latin-9). General Rack mountable in 1U system rack.','','rack kvm,kvm rack,iu rack kvm,kvm,altusen,serial over net,wireless serial ,serial over wireless','Networking>KVM Switches','P13175.jpg','P13175a.jpg','P13175a.jpg','0.00','0','0','0','0','0','0','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
