 ('107','104 1135','0','Iogear 2-port Dvi Video Splitter','232.80','0.00','0.00','Duplicate and boost signals from a single DVI video source to up to 2 DVI displays. Capable of supporting both DVI-A (analog) and DVI-D (digital) video, these splitters also support audio through 3.5m','3.2','','','n','n','0','170','1','Duplicate and boost signals from a single DVI video source to up to 2 DVI displays. Capable of supporting both DVI-A (analog) and DVI-D (digital) video, these splitters also support audio through 3.5mm stereo jacks. Daisy-chain multiple splitters for even greater display duplication. Includes 6-foot combo audio/DVI-D (dual link) cables, 2 RCA-to-3.5mm audio cables and AC adapter. Requires DVI and audio cables for all outgoing ports.','Iogear 2-port Dvi Video Splitter','2 port dvi,2 port dvi splitter,2 port video splitter,dvi video,video splitter,dvi splitter,splitter','Duplicate and boost signals from a single DVI video source to up to 2 DVI displays. Capable of supporting both DVI-A (analog) and DVI-D (digital) video, these splitters also support audio through 3.5m','P16082.jpg','P16082a.jpg','P16082a.jpg','0.00','1','0','0','0','0','0','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
