 ('109','104 1141','211','Matrox Dualhead2go Analog Video Extender','182.85','198.75','0.00','The Matrox DualHead2Go doubles your laptop&#39;s existing video out capabilities, providing independent output to two adjacent monitors simultaneously. DualHead2Go tricks your laptop into thinking that','1.55','y','y','','','0','225','1','The Matrox DualHead2Go doubles your laptop&#39;s existing video out capabilities, providing independent output to two adjacent monitors simultaneously. DualHead2Go tricks your laptop into thinking that you&#39;ve attached a single double-wide monitor, then digitally splits the VGA signal and sends it to 2 additional monitors. Includes Includes 24 VGA cable, 24 DVI-to-VGA cable, AC adapter and software on CD-ROM. Requires Windows 2000/XP, VGA output port and compatible nVIDIA or ATI chipset.','','vga, vga notbook extender,notebook vga','Digital/Multimedia Products>Digital A/V Solutions>Video Splitters','P11175.jpg','P11175a.jpg','P11175a.jpg','0.00','0','0','0','0','0','0','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
 ('110','104 1142','211','Matrox Triplehead2go Analog Video Extender','320.85','348.75','0.00','Forget widescreen... the Matrox TripleHead2Go VGA extender outputs to 2 or 3 monitors independently to create a triple-widescreen display! One little box harnesses the power of your system&#39;s graphics','1.55','y','y','','','0','225','1','Forget widescreen... the Matrox TripleHead2Go VGA extender outputs to 2 or 3 monitors independently to create a triple-widescreen display! One little box harnesses the power of your system&#39;s graphics power to render 2D, 3D and video across multiple screens with a combined resolution up to 3840x1024. Expand your desktop across three screens, or play games in surround video! TripleHead2Go appears to your system as an ultra-ultra-widescreen monitor. Using standard EDID reporting mechanisms, the TripleHead2Go will cause the graphics device already present in your system to generate the ultra-ultra-widescreen image, which is sent to TripleHead2Go. TripleHead2Go then splits this ultra-ultra-widescreen image into a left section, a center section and a right section and sends the normal size images to regular monitors. If your laptop or computer is already equipped with a DVD player, you will be able to watch a DVD or video content on any of the monitors of your multi-display environment. Playback will be as smooth as it would have been on your laptop. TripleHead2Go can be hooked up to any analog monitor, including flat panel monitors. To take full advantage of TripleHead2Go, we recommend you use three identical monitors (that is, monitors that support the same monitor settings such as display resolution and refresh rate). The TripleHead2Go works with all regular Windows applications, workstation applications and productivity applications. Whether the application is a high end 3D design package, Microsoft Office or just notepad, all of these should just work in conjunction with TripleHead2Go. The only type of application which may experience certain compatibility issues with TripleHead2Go are full-screen DirectX applications (ie. video games). For games that run in fullscreen mode, all games will work with TripleHead2Go on at least a single screen. Additionally, over 150 titles are currently supported in Surround Gaming mode. Includes Includes 24 VGA cable, 24 DVI-to-VGA cable, AC adapter and software on CD-ROM. Requires Windows 2000/XP, VGA output port and compatible nVIDIA or ATI chipset.','','matrox,VGA extender,VGA splitter','Digital/Multimedia Products>Digital A/V Solutions>Video Splitters','P12610.jpg','P12610a.jpg','P12610a.jpg','0.00','1','0','0','0','0','0','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
 ('111','104 1143','0','Matrox Dualhead2go Digital Video Extender','256.03','0.00','0.00','The Matrox DualHead2Go doubles your computer\'s existing video out capabilities, providing independent output to two adjacent monitors simultaneously. DualHead2Go tricks your computer into thinking t','1.6','','','n','n','0','225','1','The Matrox DualHead2Go doubles your computer\'s existing video out capabilities, providing independent output to two adjacent monitors simultaneously. DualHead2Go tricks your computer into thinking that you\'ve attached a single ultra-wide monitor, then digitally splits the VGA signal and sends it to 2 DVI monitors. The multi-display configuration permits working with multiple full-screen documents or applications simultaneously... eliminating the need to constantly open, close or minimize applications. Includes 24 VGA cable and USB power cable. Requires Microsoft Windows 2000/XP/Vista or Mac OS 10.4+, VGA output port and compatible system. ','Matrox Dualhead2go Digital Video Extender','video extender,dvi extender,dual head,extender','The Matrox DualHead2Go doubles your computer\'s existing video out capabilities, providing independent output to two adjacent monitors simultaneously. DualHead2Go tricks your computer into thinking t','P15561.jpg','P15561a.jpg','P15561a.jpg','0.00','0','0','0','0','0','0','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
