 ('279','112 0121','256','Smart Strip 10-outlet Surge, Lcg4','34.85','37.88','0.00','The Smart Strip surge protector lowers your energy costs by managing the flow of energy to your PC and its peripherals. Simply plug your PC into the Control Outlet and your peripherals into the Aut','2.25','y','y','','','0','38','1','The Smart Strip surge protector lowers your energy costs by managing the flow of energy to your PC and its peripherals. Simply plug your PC into the Control Outlet and your peripherals into the Automatically Switched Outlets. Then when your PC is shutdown, the Smart Strip suspends power to the switched outlets too, making shutdown fast, easy and complete. Three additional Constantly Hot Outlets maintain an idle current to devices, that require it.','','smart strip,surge protector,10 outlet,power strip','Office Products>Surge Protectors','P11310.jpg','P11310a.jpg','P11310a.jpg','0.00','0','0','0','0','0','0','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
