 ('492','114 0636','308','Drive Erazer Data Eraser, 3.5in IDE Drives','114.99','124.99','0.00','When you throw a computer file into the recycle bin, Windows marks it as deleted... but the file remains on the disk, hidden in magnetic ones and zeros that a reasonably skilled hacker can easily re','1.45','y','y','','','0','387','1','When you throw a computer file into the recycle bin, Windows marks it as deleted... but the file remains on the disk, hidden in magnetic ones and zeros that a reasonably skilled hacker can easily recover. Even formatting a drive can leave readable information. Wiebetech&#39;s Drive Erazers fill every sector--in every partition--with nothing but zeroes, leaving nothing left to recover. Your completely clean disk can be reused or sold, data- and worry-free. Works with all 3.5 ATA/ATAPI (IDE) hard drives, regardless of format or OS type. Includes AC adapter and ribbon cable.','','drive,eraser,data,eraser,hdd,eraser','Tools &amp; Testers>PC Troubleshooting','P20458.jpg','P20458a.jpg','P20458a.jpg','0.00','0','0','0','0','0','0','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
