 ('569','115 3126','0','Test-um Tone Generator Latch-test W/ Pouch','59.86','0.00','0.00','The Latch Test is both an advanced tone generator and a continuity tester for sensors, switches and circuits. It was designed specifically with security and alarm systems in mind. It provides 2 tone a','0.5','','','n','n','0','356','1','The Latch Test is both an advanced tone generator and a continuity tester for sensors, switches and circuits. It was designed specifically with security and alarm systems in mind. It provides 2 tone amplitude levels and 3 distinct tones. Audible and visual indicators and 6 continuity modes show the true condition of a circuit\'s operability. Includes 7 1/2 RJ-25 extension, lanyard and Cordura(R) belt pouch. Requires 9V battery, not included. ','Test-um Tone Generator Latch-test W/ Pouch','tone generator','The Latch Test is both an advanced tone generator and a continuity tester for sensors, switches and circuits. It was designed specifically with security and alarm systems in mind. It provides 2 tone a','P13832.jpg','P13832a.jpg','P13832a.jpg','0.00','1','0','0','0','0','0','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
 ('570','115 3127','307','Power Panel Cat5/6 Dvm And Network/poe Tester','156.40','170.00','0.00','Ethernet cables aren&#39;t just for data anymore... Power-over-Ethernet (PoE) sends up to 48 volts of power through CAT5/6 patch cables. Test cables for PoE voltage with the Power Panel before you connect','0.55','y','y','','','0','50','1','Ethernet cables aren&#39;t just for data anymore... Power-over-Ethernet (PoE) sends up to 48 volts of power through CAT5/6 patch cables. Test cables for PoE voltage with the Power Panel before you connect network devices. The tester reports any discovery voltage and can test a PoE injector for full power. In addition, the Power Panel gives you information about what type of devices are connected, speed of data connections, and Ethernet pair wiring. Includes 9V battery.','','PoE tester,cable tester,network tester','Tools &amp; Testers>Network Testers','P18338.jpg','P18338a.jpg','P18338a.jpg','0.00','1','0','0','0','0','0','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
 ('571','115 3128','307','Inline Power Panel Cat5/6 Dvm And Network/poe Tester','194.35','211.25','0.00','Ethernet cables aren&#39;t just for data anymore... Power-over-Ethernet (PoE) sends up to 48 volts of power through CAT5/6 patch cables. Test cables for PoE voltage with the Power Panel before you connect','0.6','y','y','','','0','50','1','Ethernet cables aren&#39;t just for data anymore... Power-over-Ethernet (PoE) sends up to 48 volts of power through CAT5/6 patch cables. Test cables for PoE voltage with the Power Panel before you connect network devices. The tester reports any discovery voltage and can test a PoE injector for full power. In addition, the Power Panel gives you information about what type of devices are connected, speed of data connections, and Ethernet pair wiring. The inline version of the Power Panel can do all of the above, plus gather additional information that is only possible to discover when it is connected in-between 2 network devices. Instead of just seeing individual device speeds, it shows see what the 2 devices the negotiated data rate. If PoE is involved, the inline Power Panel passes through the power to the PoE device so it is on while being monitored. It also can display the power consumed by the PoE device (in watts).','','PoE tester,cable tester,network tester','Tools &amp; Testers>Network Testers','P18358.jpg','P18358a.jpg','P18358a.jpg','0.00','1','0','0','0','0','0','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
