 ('599','115 3621','460','Wet Noodle Magnetic In-wall Retrieval System','23.10','25.11','0.00','The Wet Noodle cable retrieval system is a must have tool for retrofit installers. The system is composed of three components: a 24 flexible insulated retriever with an ultra strong earth magnet at o','0.2','y','y','','','0','218','1','The Wet Noodle cable retrieval system is a must have tool for retrofit installers. The system is composed of three components: a 24 flexible insulated retriever with an ultra strong earth magnet at one end; 10ft. of lightweight ball chain with a stop-ring; and a 20 telescoping pocket hook retriever. This system provides a fast and easy solution for blindly (without vision tools) connecting an in-wall entry point to an exit point to pull wire.','','wet,noodle,magnetic,wire,cable,retrieval,telescoping,wire,pole,wire,pulling,wire,pushing,installing,tools','Tools &amp; Testers>Cable &amp; Wire Pulling, Fish Tape','P16212.jpg','P16212a.jpg','P16212a.jpg','0.00','1','0','0','0','0','0','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
 ('600','115 3622','299','Wall-eye In-wall Viewer W/ Light','30.68','33.35','0.00','This hand-held viewer allows you to see inside dark and confined wall cavities, pipes or ceilings through any 2 access hole. The Wall-Eye incorporates a mirror and bright LED light that provides a fi','0.25','y','y','','','0','218','1','This hand-held viewer allows you to see inside dark and confined wall cavities, pipes or ceilings through any 2 access hole. The Wall-Eye incorporates a mirror and bright LED light that provides a field of view 90 degrees from your eye. Use this tool to spot obstacles inside walls such as conduit, plumbing or studs before you commit to drilling. Requires 2 AAA batteries, included.','','viewer,wall eye viewer,90 degree viewer,led viewer,led flashlight','Tools &amp; Testers>LED Flashlights','P16213.jpg','P16213a.jpg','P16213a.jpg','0.00','1','0','0','0','0','0','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
