 ('606','115 3630','307','Lanroamer Pro Tester W/ 1 Remote, Tp600','197.80','215.00','0.00','The LanRoamerPRO Tester/Analyzer is a high performance length measurement CAT 5 tester that identifies multiple faults clearly without interpretation, has one-ended testing with pre-test for fast resu','0.32','y','y','','','0','356','1','The LanRoamerPRO Tester/Analyzer is a high performance length measurement CAT 5 tester that identifies multiple faults clearly without interpretation, has one-ended testing with pre-test for fast results and clear wiremapping displayed on 2-line, 16 character LCD. The LanRoamerPRO includes features such as auto-on /auto-off, a tone generator mode for use with tone tracers and a low battery indicator. It tests for shorts, opens, miswires, reversals and split pairs. Requires 1 9V battery, not included.','','analyzer,tester,test-um,testum,tone,generator,test,lanrover,tp600','Tools &amp; Testers>Network Testers','P3813.jpg','P3813a.jpg','P3813a.jpg','0.00','1','0','0','0','0','0','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
 ('607','115 3648','0','Test-um Master Adapter Kit, Kp421','70.87','0.00','0.00','The Test-Um Master Adapter Kit is great for multiple tests of virtually any type of cable! These adapters and cable assemblies make it easy to interconnect many cable types for a wide range of telepho','1.6','','','n','n','0','356','1','The Test-Um Master Adapter Kit is great for multiple tests of virtually any type of cable! These adapters and cable assemblies make it easy to interconnect many cable types for a wide range of telephone and networking tests. Designed for use with most Test-Um Testers.','Test-um Master Adapter Kit, Kp421','tester,adapter tester kit','The Test-Um Master Adapter Kit is great for multiple tests of virtually any type of cable! These adapters and cable assemblies make it easy to interconnect many cable types for a wide range of telepho','P6694.jpg','P6694a.jpg','P6694a.jpg','0.00','1','0','0','0','0','0','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
 ('608','115 3663','307','Test-um Validator Network/cabling Tester','1454.75','1581.25','0.00','Certify your network installations with your own Validator Network/Cabling Certifier, from Test-Um, Validator can maximize your voice/data/video installationís efficiency by identifying cable inadequa','8.1','y','y','','','0','356','1','Certify your network installations with your own Validator Network/Cabling Certifier, from Test-Um, Validator can maximize your voice/data/video installationís efficiency by identifying cable inadequacies such as installation problems, kinks, loops, terminations, dry shorts or miswires. Using the included Plan-Um software, you can layout your networkís requirements in a matter of minutes, then define cable types and runs. Once the cables are in place, test each run, and print the results in an easy-to-read report.','','tester,adapter tester kit','Tools &amp; Testers>Network Testers','P8901.jpg','P8901a.jpg','P8901a.jpg','0.00','0','0','0','0','0','0','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
 ('609','115 3664','307','Test-um Validator-nt, Active Network Tester','1865.30','2027.50','0.00','Certify your network installations with your own Validator Network/Cabling Certifier, from Test-Um, Validator can maximize your voice/data/video installations efficiency by identifying cable inadequac','8','y','y','','','0','356','1','Certify your network installations with your own Validator Network/Cabling Certifier, from Test-Um, Validator can maximize your voice/data/video installations efficiency by identifying cable inadequacies such as installation problems, kinks, loops, terminations, dry shorts or miswires. Using the included Plan-Um software, you can layout your networks requirements in a matter of minutes, then define cable types and runs. Once the cables are in place, test each run, and print the results in an easy-to-read report. The new Validator-NT has all the testing and certifying capabilities of the Validator, but also includes new active network tests for diagnosing problems on live networks. Use it to identify network devices such as hubs, switches, NICs and routers on your network and verify connectivity (manual IP or via DHCP) to the Internet by pinging up to seven different IP addresses simultaneously. In addition, the kit includes a set of 8 wiremap remotes. Requires PC running Windows 2000/XP with 512MB RAM.','','tester,adapter tester kit','Tools &amp; Testers>Network Testers','P11912.jpg','P11912a.jpg','P11912a.jpg','0.00','0','0','0','0','0','0','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
 ('3451','138 0431','398','Kinesis Freestyle Incline Accessory Kit, Black','41.40','45.00','0.00','The Incline accessory kit works with the Kinesis Freestyle keyboard to add a 10 degree fixed tenting angle. The two halves of the keyboard (sold separately) attach to pivot points on the rear and can','2.15','y','y','','y','0','190','0','The Incline accessory kit works with the Kinesis Freestyle keyboard to add a 10 degree fixed tenting angle. The two halves of the keyboard (sold separately) attach to pivot points on the rear and can be adjusted as needed to meet your preferred wrist angle. Rubber feet keep the Incline stand from sliding around. Also included are two padded palm rests.','',' ','Ergonomic Products>Ergonomic Keyboards','P26640.jpg','P26640a.jpg','P26640a.jpg','0.00','0','0','0','0','0','1','y','n','y','n','y','y','n');
insert into `products` values('610','115 3665','462','Test-um Coax Mapper, Cx200','51.74','56.24','0.00','This handy tester is designed for CATV and security camera connection and installation. It tests multi-run coax cables terminated with F-connectors from a central source. It has the ability to put a t','0.5','y','y','','','0','356','1','This handy tester is designed for CATV and security camera connection and installation. It tests multi-run coax cables terminated with F-connectors from a central source. It has the ability to put a tone signal on a coax cable, as well as find and identify multiple coax cables connected to a coax splitter. With individually-identified test terminators, you can trace up to 4 connections at a time from the main cable box.','','test-um,security,bnc,field,tester,kit,test,set,catv,cable,tv,testum,coax,mapper,telephony','Tools &amp; Testers>Coax &amp; Satellite Testers','P4212.jpg','P4212a.jpg','P4212a.jpg','0.00','1','0','0','0','0','0','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
 ('611','115 3666','295','Coax Cable Tester And Identifier','34.13','37.10','0.00','Connect the powered portion of this compact tester to one end of a coax cable and the identifier cap will light up when attached to the other end of the cable. The pocket tester can check cable integr','0.15','y','y','','','0','218','1','Connect the powered portion of this compact tester to one end of a coax cable and the identifier cap will light up when attached to the other end of the cable. The pocket tester can check cable integrity too; the bandit unit lights up when it detects a split (short) in the cable. The three pieces conveniently fit together for storage. Requires 2 AAA batteries, included.','','coax,pocket,cable,identifier,tester','Tools &amp; Testers>Cable Tracing/Tone Generators','P17561.jpg','P17561a.jpg','P17561a.jpg','0.00','1','0','0','0','0','0','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
 ('612','115 3667','307','Test-um Wi-net Window, Wireless Net Tester','323.15','351.25','0.00','Wi-Net Window detects key parameters of the wireless equipment broadcasting in its vicinity. In addition to identifying networks, it also shows signal strengths, encryption conditions, channel transmi','0.85','y','y','','','0','356','1','Wi-Net Window detects key parameters of the wireless equipment broadcasting in its vicinity. In addition to identifying networks, it also shows signal strengths, encryption conditions, channel transmissions and more. It can access the DHCP of a network to capture component IDs, confirm IP addresses or to process up to 4 simultaneous ping requests. Wi-Net Window can log all received wireless transmissions in the area for inspection with constant scanning. Requires 4 AA batteries, not included.','','tester,adapter tester kit','Tools &amp; Testers>Network Testers','P12656.jpg','P12656a.jpg','P12656a.jpg','0.00','0','0','0','0','0','0','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
 ('613','115 3668','306','Test-um Tri-porter All-in-one Digital Tester','918.85','998.75','0.00','The Tri-Porter is the first network installation tester that provides a full range of physical wiring tests for IP-based voice, data and video services. It can replace up to 6 traditional testing tool','5.25','y','y','','','0','356','1','The Tri-Porter is the first network installation tester that provides a full range of physical wiring tests for IP-based voice, data and video services. It can replace up to 6 traditional testing tools, combining a telephone test set, a network tester, a tone generator, a tone detector, a cable verifier and a coax mapper. Tri-Porter will make your job of testing and configuring cables easier, faster and more accurate... not to mention more economical. Requires 9V battery&amp;6 AA batteries, not included.','','testum,tri port tester,digital tester','Tools &amp; Testers>Multimeters','P14154.jpg','P14154a.jpg','P14154a.jpg','0.00','0','0','0','0','0','0','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
 ('614','115 3674','295','Test-um Deluxe Resi Kit, Kp312','546.25','593.75','0.00','This 4-in-1 kit includes everything needed to find, fix and verify network, telephone, audio and coaxial cables in residential installations.  Resi-Tester: can test, locate and identify CATV, t','3.36','y','y','','','0','356','1','This 4-in-1 kit includes everything needed to find, fix and verify network, telephone, audio and coaxial cables in residential installations.  Resi-Tester: can test, locate and identify CATV, telephone, audio, security/alarm and network wiring. The large easy-to-read LCD provides concise information showing all the faults connected. The included #1 terminator neatly stores into the body of the tester. Resi-Toner: is a full-function tone generator designed to test connections on telephone systems and speaker installations. It powers-up the installed telephone lines under actual load conditions with a simulated dial tone to check connectivity and proper wiring configurations without a service connection. Resi-Talker: can perform basic telephone system testing with continuous line polarity indication, amplified line monitoring for volume levels comparable to off hook operation and a modular cord set attachment. Resi-Tracer: is a multi-function signal detector that locates standard generated tone signals as well as dial tone and speaker popping signals. Resi-Tracer trace tones over both live and dark coax cable systems and can be used for a number of special field applications.','','net testing,cable testing,telco testing,catv testing','Tools &amp; Testers>Cable Tracing/Tone Generators','P10310.jpg','P10310a.jpg','P10310a.jpg','0.00','1','0','0','0','0','0','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
 ('615','115 3675','316','Ranger Telephone Test Kit, Lb255','305.90','332.50','0.00','The top-of-the-line Lil Buttie Ranger is a professional-quality, self-contained, self-powered, portable telephone test set. Compact (7.5in. length), lightweight (less than 8 oz) and hands free; it can','0.6','y','y','','','0','356','1','The top-of-the-line Lil Buttie Ranger is a professional-quality, self-contained, self-powered, portable telephone test set. Compact (7.5in. length), lightweight (less than 8 oz) and hands free; it can be worn on your belt or easily carried in your pocket. The Ranger comes in a tough, padded belt pack with d-ring and hook and loop closure and includes an over-the-ear mini headset and bed of nails piercing alligator clips.','','dsl,field,tester,kit,test,phone,telephone,test-um,testum,buttie,ranger,voltage','Tools &amp; Testers>Telephone (RJ-11) Testers','P3806.jpg','P3806a.jpg','P3806a.jpg','0.00','1','0','0','0','0','0','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
