 ('616','115 3676','295','Test-um Alligator Clip Wiremapping Kit','150.65','163.75','0.00','The Speaker Seeker is a fast, inexpensive way to wiremap unterminated cables in installed speaker, security/alarm and coax systems. Up to 20 cables can be simultaneously located with the included remo','1.25','y','y','','','0','356','1','The Speaker Seeker is a fast, inexpensive way to wiremap unterminated cables in installed speaker, security/alarm and coax systems. Up to 20 cables can be simultaneously located with the included remotes. Each remote is wired with alligator clips to attach to unterminated paired cable ends. Includes 20 unique wiremap remote identifiers and unterminated coax adapter. Requires 9V battery, not included.','','speaker seaker,test_um,wiremapping,wire mapping,wire tracing','Tools &amp; Testers>Cable Tracing/Tone Generators','P13833.jpg','P13833a.jpg','P13833a.jpg','0.00','1','0','0','0','0','0','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
