 ('687','115 7884','460','Creep-zit Fiberglass Wire Running Kit, 30ft','81.01','88.05','0.00','Creep-Zit is a modern solution to conventional fish tape for every wire/cable installation, residential or commercial. It consists of five 6&#39;green fiberglass rods .159 in diameter which can be conne','4','y','y','','','0','218','1','Creep-Zit is a modern solution to conventional fish tape for every wire/cable installation, residential or commercial. It consists of five 6&#39;green fiberglass rods .159 in diameter which can be connected together into one 30&#39;piece. The Creep Zit has a bullet shaped head with a cross hole (bullnose) for attaching a wire or the included ball chain at the other end. An eggbeater (whisk) shaped head prevents the rods from getting stuck on obstacles and to provide a wheel to creep the rod through walls. Includes a heavy duty PVC carrying case. Kit includes: 4 FiberFuse 6ft. push/pull rods with male and female threaded connector ends, 1 FiberFuse 6ft. push/pull rod with a fixed bull nose end and a female threaded connector end, whisk threaded connector tip, 12 ball chain lanyard and heavy-duty carry tube.','','fiberglass wire fish,fish tape,fish wire,wire guide','Tools &amp; Testers>Cable &amp; Wire Pulling, Fish Tape','P16215.jpg','P16215a.jpg','P16215a.jpg','0.00','0','0','0','0','0','0','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
