 ('1804','142 0438','299','Mini Dynamo Triple LED Wind-up Flashlight','8.58','9.33','0.00','This lightweight flashlight fits easily in one hand and never needs batteries! Just crank the dynamo generator for a minute or two and you&#39;ve got light. Great for emergencies.','0.15','y','y','','','0','374','1','This lightweight flashlight fits easily in one hand and never needs batteries! Just crank the dynamo generator for a minute or two and you&#39;ve got light. Great for emergencies.','','flashlight,flashlite,windup flashlight,wind-up flashlight','Tools &amp; Testers>LED Flashlights','P14501.jpg','P14501a.jpg','P14501a.jpg','0.00','1','0','0','0','0','0','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
 ('1805','142 0439','0','6 LED Dual Color Flashlight','28.37','0.00','0.00','The industrial-strength V2 flashlight from Coast LED Lenser illuminates the darkness with 5 bright white LEDs... or a single red LED that can help you preserve your night vision. The cloverleaf 6-refl','0.5','','','n','n','0','66','1','The industrial-strength V2 flashlight from Coast LED Lenser illuminates the darkness with 5 bright white LEDs... or a single red LED that can help you preserve your night vision. The cloverleaf 6-reflector system produces a broad spectrum beam for general illumination. Includes wrist strap and batteries. Fun Facts In biological night vision, molecules of rhodopsin in the rods of the eye undergo a change in shape as light is absorbed by them. Rhodopsin is the chemical that allows night-vision, and is extremely sensitive to light. Exposed to white light, the pigment immediately bleaches, and it takes about 30 minutes to regenerate fully, but most of the adaptation occurs within the first five or ten minutes in the dark. Rhodopsin in the human rods is insensitive to the longer red wavelengths of light, so many people use red light to preserve night vision as it will not deplete the eye\'s rhodopsin stores in the rods and instead is viewed by the cones.','6 LED Dual Color Flashlight','dual color flashlight,led flashlight,6 led flashlight','The industrial-strength V2 flashlight from Coast LED Lenser illuminates the darkness with 5 bright white LEDs... or a single red LED that can help you preserve your night vision. The cloverleaf 6-refl','P15602.jpg','P15602a.jpg','P15602a.jpg','0.00','1','0','0','0','0','0','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
