 ('1807','142 0442','299','Petzl E+lite LED Headlamp','34.44','37.44','0.00','Make nighttime a safe time with the powerful and lightweight Petzl(R) LED headlamps. Each lamp, ruggedly designed for extreme activities, emits a powerful beam of light to cut through the darkness. Th','0.15','y','y','','','0','272','1','Make nighttime a safe time with the powerful and lightweight Petzl(R) LED headlamps. Each lamp, ruggedly designed for extreme activities, emits a powerful beam of light to cut through the darkness. The e+LITE is a flexible, lightweight and powerful lamp with no less than 5 operating modes. Clip it to a hat, hang it from your neck, or strap it around your head. The 3 bright white LEDs can help illuminate items 60 feet away. Powered by 2 coin cell batteries, it&#39;s very portable and includes a watertight belt loop container box for travel.','','zipka headlamp,led lamp,led headlamp','Tools &amp; Testers>LED Flashlights','P16203.jpg','P16203a.jpg','P16203a.jpg','0.00','1','0','0','0','0','0','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
