 ('1814','142 0753','0','Cellstik Cell Phone Backup Drive, Samsung Set 2','13.79','0.00','0.00','Your cell phone is tough, but one bad drop can still kill it. Spare yourself the disaster of losing all your phonebook contacts forever with the CellStik contact backup device. It connects to your mob','0.1','','','n','n','0','329','1','Your cell phone is tough, but one bad drop can still kill it. Spare yourself the disaster of losing all your phonebook contacts forever with the CellStik contact backup device. It connects to your mobile phone through the data port and makes a perfect copy of your contact list. You can even use your PC to save, edit and add to your contact list, making it much easier to enter in a list of new numbers. Includes CellStik Central software on MiniCD. Requires Microsoft Windows 98SE/Me/2000/XP. Compatible with Samsung models A600, A620 (VGA1000), A650, A660 (VI660), A670, A740, A760; also compatible with Samsung models A570, A680, A700, A800, A840, A880 and N330 with a firmware download from www.sparktech.com. May be compatible with other models; please visit www.sparktech.com for any recent additions.','Cellstik Cell Phone Backup Drive, Samsung Set 2','flashdrive,cell phone backup,phone backup,cellstick,cell stick,cell stik','Your cell phone is tough, but one bad drop can still kill it. Spare yourself the disaster of losing all your phonebook contacts forever with the CellStik contact backup device. It connects to your mob','P13519.jpg','P13519a.jpg','P13519a.jpg','0.00','1','0','0','0','0','0','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
