 ('2687','190 0572','31','Behringer USB Audio Input/output Adapter','40.24','43.74','0.00','The Behringer USB audio adapter can send analog signals from audio equipment and instruments to your computer for recording... or it can play digital files from your computer to your stereo system, mi','0.55','y','y','','','0','35','1','The Behringer USB audio adapter can send analog signals from audio equipment and instruments to your computer for recording... or it can play digital files from your computer to your stereo system, mixer board or other audio output device. It digitizes audio received over the RCA jacks from nearly any audio source. Then use the analog or SPDIF optical digital output jacks to send audio from your computer to a speaker system or recording deck. Requires 1GHz CPU, 512MB RAM and either Microsoft Windows XP SP2/Vista or Mac OS 10.3.9+. Audio recording and editing software is available for free download at behringer.com. Audio devices shown not included.','','audio adapter,usb audio adapter','Digital/Multimedia Products>Digital A/V Solutions>Audio Processors','P13836.jpg','P13836a.jpg','P13836a.jpg','0.00','1','0','0','0','0','0','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
 ('3267','111 0244','402','Gas Spring LCD Keyboard Combo Mount, Desk And Wall','308.53','335.36','0.00','Control the height and tilt of both your keyboard and monitor with this gas-spring assisted LCD arm. It can be clamped to a tabletop or, to really save desk space, affixed to a wall. With 45 degrees o','35','y','y','','y','0','2','0','Control the height and tilt of both your keyboard and monitor with this gas-spring assisted LCD arm. It can be clamped to a tabletop or, to really save desk space, affixed to a wall. With 45 degrees of vertical travel, the gas-spring arm easily raises both the monitor and the keyboard up to about 10. Three hinges allow for significant adjustment in the horizontal plane. Includes desk clamp, wall mount and mounting hardware. Assembly required. Monitor, keyboard, mouse and cables not included.','',' ','Ergonomic Products>LCD Monitor Mounts &amp; Stands>LCD Desk Stands &amp; Arms','P25838.jpg','P25838a.jpg','P25838a.jpg','0.00','0','0','0','0','0','1','y','n','y','n','y','y','n');
insert into `products` values('2688','190 0634','392','Ipod FM Transmitter And 12v Charger','35.08','38.13','0.00','Listen to your iPod through your car stereo! Powered by your car&#39;s 12V cigarette lighter socket, the iPod transmitter uses FM frequencies from 88.1MHz to 107.9MHz. Simply select an open frequency on y','0.18','y','y','','','0','396','1','Listen to your iPod through your car stereo! Powered by your car&#39;s 12V cigarette lighter socket, the iPod transmitter uses FM frequencies from 88.1MHz to 107.9MHz. Simply select an open frequency on your car radio, match that frequency on the transmitter and listen to your iPod playlist right through your car stereo with no headphones. Not compatible with Apple iPhone.','','ipod,fm,fm transmitter','Digital/Multimedia Products>iPod Chargers &amp; Gadgets','P8382.jpg','P8382a.jpg','P8382a.jpg','0.00','1','0','0','0','0','0','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
 ('2689','190 0652','40','2.5mm Mobile Headset To PC Converter','1.67','1.81','0.00','Now you can use your mobile headset and its hands-free lapel or boom mic on your PC with this 2.5mm headset to dual 3.5mm minijack adapter. The adapter plugs into the 3.5mm microphone and headphones j','0.04','y','y','','','0','122','1','Now you can use your mobile headset and its hands-free lapel or boom mic on your PC with this 2.5mm headset to dual 3.5mm minijack adapter. The adapter plugs into the 3.5mm microphone and headphones jacks on your soundcard or PC case.','','mobile to pc, headset adapter','Cables &amp; Adapters>Adapters &amp; Couplers>Audio/Video Adapters','P10510.jpg','P10510a.jpg','P10510a.jpg','0.00','0','1','0','0','0','0','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
 ('2690','190 0656','40','Smartshare Headphone Splitter W/ Volume Control','13.81','15.01','0.00','With the SmartShare headphone splitter two people can listen to one audio source...iPod, MP3 player, CD/DVD player...and each listener can independently control the volume they hear.','0.15','y','y','','','0','144','1','With the SmartShare headphone splitter two people can listen to one audio source...iPod, MP3 player, CD/DVD player...and each listener can independently control the volume they hear.','','splitter,headphone splitter','Cables &amp; Adapters>Adapters &amp; Couplers>Audio/Video Adapters','P12409.jpg','P12409a.jpg','P12409a.jpg','0.00','1','0','0','0','0','0','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
 ('2691','190 0800','324','Rf Link 5.8 Ghz Audio/video Transmitter/receiver','133.22','144.80','0.00','The RF-Link wireless transmitter sends audio/video from one room in your house to another... without running wires! You can connect the transmitter to your cable box, DVD player, television or any oth','3.3','y','y','','','0','75','1','The RF-Link wireless transmitter sends audio/video from one room in your house to another... without running wires! You can connect the transmitter to your cable box, DVD player, television or any other A/V source that outputs an A/V signal and then watch that transmission on a TV somewhere else in your home. Most other A/V transmitters use the crowded 2.4GHz band and suffer from interference caused by cordless phones, microwave ovens and Wi-Fi or Bluetooth RF signals. By utilizing the 5.8GHz range, your transmitted TV and audio signals will be clearer and cleaner. The system includes an additional IR receiver/transmitter so you can control the A/V source you&#39;re watching from your remote location with your regular remote control.','','5.8G,5.8GHz','Digital/Multimedia Products>Digital A/V Solutions>Video Converters','P9764.jpg','P9764a.jpg','P9764a.jpg','0.00','1','0','0','0','0','0','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
 ('2692','202 0111','0','Intellinet Mimo Wireless G 4 Port Router','98.52','0.00','0.00','Use MIMO (multiple-in/multiple-out) technology to extend the range and performance of your 802.11g wireless network. When used with other Intellinet MIMO wireless products, the Turbo G MIMO router can','2.2','','','n','n','0','169','1','Use MIMO (multiple-in/multiple-out) technology to extend the range and performance of your 802.11g wireless network. When used with other Intellinet MIMO wireless products, the Turbo G MIMO router can up typical throughput from 20Mbps to 35Mbps. The three 5dBi antennas work together to establish the strongest connections, automatically adjusting for interference and physical barriers. With a full complement of security features and bandwidth controls, the Turbo G MIMO router can substantially increase your wireless network\'s power. Includes AC adapter &amp; rubber feet. Requires 100Mbps Ethernet connection to wired network. Enhanced MIMO performance requires Intellinet MIMO Turbo G client adapters, not included.','Intellinet Mimo Wireless G 4 Port Router','wireless router,4 port router,802.11g,wireless network','Use MIMO (multiple-in/multiple-out) technology to extend the range and performance of your 802.11g wireless network. When used with other Intellinet MIMO wireless products, the Turbo G MIMO router can','P14755.jpg','P14755a.jpg','P14755a.jpg','0.00','1','0','0','0','0','0','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
 ('2693','202 0112','0','Intellinet 802.11g 4 Port Broadband Router','64.51','0.00','0.00','Connect any 802.11b/g product to your network with Intellinet\'s wireless broadband router and you\'ll get outstanding security as well. This router includes tough security protocols (including WPA TKIP','2.3','','','n','n','0','169','1','Connect any 802.11b/g product to your network with Intellinet\'s wireless broadband router and you\'ll get outstanding security as well. This router includes tough security protocols (including WPA TKIP and AES), efficiency features (like QoS bandwidth control) and a 4-port 10/100 Ethernet switch. Installation on your home or office network is easy with the included connection wizard tool. Includes CAT5e cable and AC adapter. Requires 100Mbps Ethernet connection to wired network.','Intellinet 802.11g 4 Port Broadband Router','wireless router,4 port router,802.11g,wireless network','Connect any 802.11b/g product to your network with Intellinet\'s wireless broadband router and you\'ll get outstanding security as well. This router includes tough security protocols (including WPA TKIP','P14754.jpg','P14754a.jpg','P14754a.jpg','0.00','0','0','0','0','0','0','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
 ('2694','202 0113','194','Intellinet 802.11g Access Point, Poe Support','99.97','108.66','0.00','Intellinet&#39;s high-powered 802.11b/g wireless access point provides stronger connections for optimum network performance. It also has a built-in power extractor on an Ethernet port, allowing you to use','1.9','y','y','','','0','169','1','Intellinet&#39;s high-powered 802.11b/g wireless access point provides stronger connections for optimum network performance. It also has a built-in power extractor on an Ethernet port, allowing you to use a single CAT5 cable (and a PoE injector) to deliver both a data connection and electrical power. Includes antenna, CAT5 cable, stand, wall-mounting kit, AC adapter and software on CD-ROM. PoE use requires 802.3af-compliant power injector at the router end, not included.','','wireless router,4 port router,802.11g,wireless network,access point','Networking>Wireless Networking (WiFi)>Wireless Routers','P14757.jpg','P14757a.jpg','P14757a.jpg','0.00','1','0','0','0','0','0','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
 ('2695','202 0114','0','Intellinet 802.11g 6 DBi Wireless Range Adapter','80.86','0.00','0.00','Increase the range of your wireless connection using the directional antenna built into this 802.11b/g client adapter. Connect it to your desktop or laptop PC through a USB port and then aim its 6dBi','0.7','','','n','n','0','169','1','Increase the range of your wireless connection using the directional antenna built into this 802.11b/g client adapter. Connect it to your desktop or laptop PC through a USB port and then aim its 6dBi high-gain antenna at wireless access points that might be too remote to pick up with typical antennas. Includes 24 USB cable, wall-mounting kit and drivers on CD-ROM. Requires Microsoft Windows 98SE/2000/XP. ','Intellinet 802.11g 6 DBi Wireless Range Adapter','wireless router,4 port router,802.11g,wireless network,directional antenna,wireless antenna','Increase the range of your wireless connection using the directional antenna built into this 802.11b/g client adapter. Connect it to your desktop or laptop PC through a USB port and then aim its 6dBi','P14756.jpg','P14756a.jpg','P14756a.jpg','0.00','-1','2','0','0','0','0','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
 ('2696','202 0115','194','Cradlepoint Phs Wireless Personal Hotspot Router','205.85','223.75','0.00','Cradlepoint&#39;s battery-powered Personal Hotspot lets you set up a Wi-Fi router anywhere you can use a 3G cellular modem... you don&#39;t even need a power outlet! The router can keep multiple 802.11b/g com','1','y','y','','','0','80','1','Cradlepoint&#39;s battery-powered Personal Hotspot lets you set up a Wi-Fi router anywhere you can use a 3G cellular modem... you don&#39;t even need a power outlet! The router can keep multiple 802.11b/g computers connected to the Internet using a single EVDO device. With full security features and access controls, the Wi-Fi router can be used for field meetings, emergency situations, convention blogging, picnics, camping and more. Includes AC adapter. Requires compatible USB 3G cellular modem, or compatible ExpressCard modem and USB adapter. See the following compatibility list. Verizon Data Devices:  USB720, USB727, AC595U, UM150, V640, V740, KPC680 Verizon Cellular Phones: LG VX7200, VX8000, Motorola V3c RAZR, RIM Blackberry 8703e/8830 Sprint Data Devices: U720, U727, AC595U, EX720, Franklin CDU680 Sprint Cellular Phones: Samsung A920&amp;i830, Sanyo M1&amp;Katana 2, Motorola V3c RAZR, RIM Blackberry 8703e&amp;8830, LG Musiq Alltel Data Devices: KPC680 Some devices will require a firmware update. ExpressCard modems will require a USB adapter. Please note, does not support AC597E ExpressCards.','','router,cradlepoint,phs,wireless,personal,hotspot,wifi,router','Networking>Wireless Networking (WiFi)>Wireless Routers','P20098.jpg','P20098a.jpg','P20098a.jpg','0.00','1','0','0','0','0','0','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
