 ('2706','202 0131','194','Netgear Wireless-g Router, 4-port','52.85','57.45','0.00','NETGEAR&#39;s Wireless-G Router (WGR614) delivers a simple secure way to add wireless connection to your network at a great value. It makes sharing your cable/DSL connection with other PCs a snap. The WGR','1.55','y','y','','','0','242','1','NETGEAR&#39;s Wireless-G Router (WGR614) delivers a simple secure way to add wireless connection to your network at a great value. It makes sharing your cable/DSL connection with other PCs a snap. The WGR614 features double firewall protection to help shield the network from intrusions with two security methods. And, NETGEAR&#39;s Smart Wizard installation software makes setup easy.','','netgear,wireless,router,wireless-g,router,4port,4-port,router','Networking>Wireless Networking (WiFi)>Wireless Routers','P18801.jpg','P18801a.jpg','P18801a.jpg','0.00','1','0','0','0','0','0','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
 ('2707','202 0132','0','Netgear Rangemax Next Wireless-n Router, 4-port','153.60','0.00','0.00','Get high-performance wireless and wired speeds with NETGEAR\'s Gigabit Edition draft-N router. Equipped with four 10/100/1000 Ethernet ports, it provides extremely fast wired-to-wireless data tr','2.8','','','n','n','0','242','1','Get high-performance wireless and wired speeds with NETGEAR\'s Gigabit Edition draft-N router. Equipped with four 10/100/1000 Ethernet ports, it provides extremely fast wired-to-wireless data transfer rates. This router provides a bevy of security features, including a double firewall, DoS &amp; IDS protection and WPA2-PSK authentication. Completely compatible with existing 802.11b/g networks, it works best when used with other NETGEAR RangeMax NEXT products. NETGEAR introduces the next generation of wireless networking with the RangeMax Next products based on the proposed 802.11n amendment. While not officially ratified, the current draft permits network transmission speeds up to 300Mbps... about 6 times faster than 802.11g. This throughput allows for multiple HD video streams, video conferencing, and heavy multiplayer gaming. Draft 802.11n also increases the range of wireless network products, using multiple antennas to reach twice the distance of the previous generation. Requires broadband (Cable/DSL) modem and','Netgear Rangemax Next Wireless-n Router, 4-port','netgear,rangemax,wireless,router,802.11n,cable,dsl,wireless,router','Get high-performance wireless and wired speeds with NETGEAR\'s Gigabit Edition draft-N router. Equipped with four 10/100/1000 Ethernet ports, it provides extremely fast wired-to-wireless data tr','P18800.jpg','P18800a.jpg','P18800a.jpg','0.00','1','0','0','0','0','0','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
 ('2708','202 0133','250','Netgear Rangemax Next Wireless-n PCI Adapter','90.26','98.11','0.00','Get your desktop PC up to 802.11n speeds with NETGEAR&#39;s RangeMax NEXT PCI adapter. Providing up to 6 times the speed of 802.11g devices, this Wi-Fi-certified adapter delivers tomorrow&#39;s performance to','1','y','y','','','0','242','1','Get your desktop PC up to 802.11n speeds with NETGEAR&#39;s RangeMax NEXT PCI adapter. Providing up to 6 times the speed of 802.11g devices, this Wi-Fi-certified adapter delivers tomorrow&#39;s performance today. Completely compatible with existing 802.11b/g networks, it works best when used with other NETGEAR RangeMax NEXT products. NETGEAR introduces the next generation of wireless networking with the RangeMax Next products based on the proposed 802.11n amendment. While not officially ratified, the current draft permits network transmission speeds up to 300Mbps... about 6 times faster than 802.11g. This throughput allows for multiple HD video streams, video conferencing, and heavy multiplayer gaming. Draft 802.11n also increases the range of wireless network products, using multiple antennas to reach twice the distance of the previous generation. Requires Microsoft Windows 2000 SP4/XP/Vista and available PCI slot.','','wireless-n,rangemax,wireless,pci,adapter,802.11n','Computer Components>I/O &amp; Video Cards>Network I/O Cards (NIC)','P18799.jpg','P18799a.jpg','P18799a.jpg','0.00','1','0','0','0','0','0','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
 ('2709','202 0134','194','Netgear Rangemax Wireless Router','90.26','98.11','0.00','The RangeMax router constantly adjusts signals to maximize your Wi-Fi connections. When connected to a broadband modem, the router can turn your entire house into an Internet hot spot. The RangeMax ro','1','y','y','','','0','242','1','The RangeMax router constantly adjusts signals to maximize your Wi-Fi connections. When connected to a broadband modem, the router can turn your entire house into an Internet hot spot. The RangeMax router includes multiple security features to protect from snoopers and also features parental controls such as Web filtering and use limits. It also can manage your wired Ethernet network with a 4-port 10/100 switch. NETGEAR&#39;s RangeMax MIMO (Multiple-In, Multiple-Out) technology provides Wi-Fi transfer rates up to 108Mbps at 10 times the range over 802.11g. The base access points actively use 7 internal antennas to overcome interference and physical barriers in your home. The RangeMax router and access point work best when used with corresponding RangeMax adapters, but are compatible with--even able to boost the performance of--standard 802.11b/g devices.','','netgear,rangemax,range max,wireless,router,wifi,wi fi,router','Networking>Wireless Networking (WiFi)>Wireless Routers','P18802.jpg','P18802a.jpg','P18802a.jpg','0.00','1','0','0','0','0','0','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
 ('2710','202 0135','434','Netgear Dsl/cable 4-port 10/100 Router','47.61','51.75','0.00','The Web Safe Router is perfect for sharing one broadband connection to several computers on your home network. The router features double firewall protection that helps shield the network with two sec','1.35','y','y','','','0','242','1','The Web Safe Router is perfect for sharing one broadband connection to several computers on your home network. The router features double firewall protection that helps shield the network with two security methods, Network Address Translation (NAT) and Stateful Packet Inspection (SPI). Installation is a snap, thanks to a unique setup CD that automatically detects and configures all necessary settings. Requires broadband (cable, DSL) Internet service and modem, not included.','','netgear,net gear,network,web,safe,router,dsl,cable,4port,4-port,4 port,router','Networking>Network Switches','P18798.jpg','P18798a.jpg','P18798a.jpg','0.00','1','0','0','0','0','0','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
 ('2711','202 0136','433','Silex 10/100 Ethernet Serial Device Server','147.37','160.19','0.00','Connect serial devices--such as barcode printers, scales, medical instrumentation--to your network with a silex serial device server. Access and manage the connected device over an 10/100Mbps Ethernet','1.95','y','y','','','0','316','1','Connect serial devices--such as barcode printers, scales, medical instrumentation--to your network with a silex serial device server. Access and manage the connected device over an 10/100Mbps Ethernet network. The included software emulates a standard Windows COM port, allowing existing applications to run without modification. Comprehensive TCP/IP protocol stacks and extensive management tools make it easy to connect multiple serial device servers to your network. Includes AC adapter and software on CD-ROM. Requires Microsoft Windows 98SE/Me/2000/XP.','','ethernet,network,10/100mbit,serial,device,server','Networking>Network Print/Device Servers','P20358.jpg','P20358a.jpg','P20358a.jpg','0.00','1','0','0','0','0','0','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
 ('2712','202 0137','433','Silex Pocketpro 100s, 10/100 Parallel Print Server','177.72','193.18','0.00','The silex PocketPro 100S is a high-performance compact print server that plugs directly into the parallel port of any parallel printer. It supports and senses both 10 and 100Mbps network connections.','1.3','y','y','','','0','316','1','The silex PocketPro 100S is a high-performance compact print server that plugs directly into the parallel port of any parallel printer. It supports and senses both 10 and 100Mbps network connections. Easy-to-use, the PocketPro is suitable for all popular computer and network operating systems. While ready to use right out of the box, the PocketPro includes extensive utility software and on-board diagnostics for advanced configuration.  The PocketPro is easy to manage with comprehensive management utilities, and it is also compatible with industry standards like HP JetAdmin. Its Open Management Architecture provides the ability to monitor printers at any management level with ease and versatility, no matter what your network. The PocketPro management capabilities includes Silex ExtendView Utilities--Utilities for extensive and easy-to-use configuration and management capabilities. An advantage of ExtendView is its ability to configure and upgrade multiple print servers simultaneously. ExtendView also displays system, network and printer status information via SNMP traps. Designed for TCP/IP, NDS (snaps into Novell NWAdmin), NetWare and UNIX (Linux 2.0.34, Solaris 2.6, SunOS 4.1.3, HPUX 10.20) NetworkAlert Utilities assist in managing network printers by alerting you of printer problems via SNMP traps. Integrates into ExtendView for advanced diagnostic and configuration information. Compatibility with any SNMP-based network management software (for example, HP OpenView, IBM NetView and Sun SunNet Manager) Private MIB LAN Administration Tool support XAdmin32 and XAdmin compatible with legacy silex print server administration utilities WebXAdmin server configuration and management.HP JetAdmin and Web JetAdmin. Novell ManageWise command line interface accessible via TELNET and NetWare If you require high levels of security, the PocketPro is one of the best solutions for secure network printing. It is one of the few print servers that supports the 802.1X authentication protocol, including EAP-TLS, EAP-TTLS, EAP-FAST, PEAP, and LEAP. It also lets you encrypt your printing jobs using Triple DES, AES, or Twofish via a Windows-compatible port monitor. In addition, the SX-2933 provides IP access control list security, which allows you to restrict access to the printer based on the IP address of the sending computer. The PocketPro can increase productivity by shortening print waiting times. IT managers can avoid buying a faster printer by fully utilizing their existing printer speeds. When it comes to printing graphics documents, with a throughput of nearly one megabyte per second, the PocketPro 100S can handle the toughest jobs in the shortest amount of time. The SX-2933 also supports numerous features for configuration flexibility, ease of use, and diagnostic LEDs to indicate power-on, link, activity. Text-to-PostScript conversion on a per-service basis Programmable character string conversion and Communications Protocol or can be forced into binary mode).On-line HELP with sophisticated diagnostics, including protocol trace capability and crash dump. Flash memory allows for easy upgrades via TCP/IP Windows Update Utility, XAdmin, tftp master or slave mode, BOOTP, NetWare, and DEC MOP.','','print server,mini,server,parallel,print,server','Networking>Network Print/Device Servers','P20359.jpg','P20359a.jpg','P20359a.jpg','0.00','1','0','0','0','0','0','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
 ('2713','202 0138','0','Silex 802.11a/b/g Parallel And USB 2.0 Print Server','227.46','0.00','0.00','Share printers with USB or parallel ports on a wired or wireless network with the SX-200 print server. With 10/100Mbps network support, and the ability to connect to 802.11a/b/g Wi-Fi networks, the SX','1.4','','','n','n','0','316','1','Share printers with USB or parallel ports on a wired or wireless network with the SX-200 print server. With 10/100Mbps network support, and the ability to connect to 802.11a/b/g Wi-Fi networks, the SX-200 supports all major operating systems and printing protocols. Send print jobs simultaneously from multiple network protocols, including Windows, Unix and MacOS drivers. Includes antenna, USB cable, AC adapter and software on CD-ROM. Parallel printer use will require a cable with a DB25 male connector, not included. High Performance Wireless Capabilities The SX-200 wireless capabilities provide flexibility to allow the printer to be located in places where cabling is difficult or too expensive, or in situations where the printer must be frequently moved. The SX-200 features a dual-band tri-mode 802.11a/b/g radio. Unparalleled Versatility The SX-200 is printer independent, allowing you to connect any parallel and any networkable USB printer to the network. This gives you the flexibility to implement printers th','Silex 802.11a/b/g Parallel And USB 2.0 Print Server','Share, printer,print server,minin server,usb,print,server','Share printers with USB or parallel ports on a wired or wireless network with the SX-200 print server. With 10/100Mbps network support, and the ability to connect to 802.11a/b/g Wi-Fi networks, the SX','P20378.jpg','P20378a.jpg','P20378a.jpg','0.00','1','0','0','0','0','0','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
