 ('2750','202 0491','0','Kworld TV Capture + FM PCI Card W/ Remote','51.42','0.00','0.00','Capture and digitize video and audio from TV, FM radio or any analog A/V source right to your PC. The included recording software lets you use your PC like a DVR: record your favorite shows, play them','0.7','','','n','n','0','195','1','Capture and digitize video and audio from TV, FM radio or any analog A/V source right to your PC. The included recording software lets you use your PC like a DVR: record your favorite shows, play them back at your leisure, even time-shift to pause a live viewing. Program recordings for any time... even when your PC is powered off. It\'s also designed for worldwide use with NTSC, PAL and SECAM decoders. Includes remote control with remote sensor, FM antenna, A/V in adapter and software on CD-ROM. Requires 800+MHz Pentium 3, DirectX 8.1-compatible video card and Windows 2000/XP. Remote requires 2 AAA batteries, not included.','Kworld TV Capture + FM PCI Card W/ Remote','tv capture, capture,video capture, pci capture card, pci capture','Capture and digitize video and audio from TV, FM radio or any analog A/V source right to your PC. The included recording software lets you use your PC like a DVR: record your favorite shows, play them','P11250.jpg','P11250a.jpg','P11250a.jpg','0.00','1','0','0','0','0','0','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
 ('2751','202 0501','0','TV Wonder Hd600 USB 2.0 TV Tuner Stick','115.19','0.00','0.00','Watch or record over-the-air television stations on your laptop with the AMD TV Wonder 600. Plug in this USB device to access both NTSC (analog) and ATSC (digital) TV stations, plus get video from a v','0.9','','','n','n','0','32','1','Watch or record over-the-air television stations on your laptop with the AMD TV Wonder 600. Plug in this USB device to access both NTSC (analog) and ATSC (digital) TV stations, plus get video from a variety of other sources, including camcorders and cable boxes. With the included PVR software, you can program show recordings and watch them later. You can even convert the recordings to fill your portable media player. Includes remote, antenna, S-video and composite adapters, USB cable and software on CD-ROM. Requires PC with 1GB RAM, DirectX 9+ graphics card and Microsoft Windows XP/Vista. Note: Depending on your location, an amplified antenna may be required for optimal reception.','TV Wonder Hd600 USB 2.0 TV Tuner Stick','tv,wonder,tuner,stick,usb,tv,tuner,stick','Watch or record over-the-air television stations on your laptop with the AMD TV Wonder 600. Plug in this USB device to access both NTSC (analog) and ATSC (digital) TV stations, plus get video from a v','P19818.jpg','P19818a.jpg','P19818a.jpg','0.00','1','0','0','0','0','0','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
 ('2752','202 0502','0','TV Wonder Hd650 USB 2.0 TV Combo Tuner','165.25','0.00','0.00','The AMD TV Wonder HD 650 includes separate digital and analog TV tuners, so you can watch one channel while recording another. This USB device can access the new digital ATSC TV stations, plus get vid','1.8','','','n','n','0','32','1','The AMD TV Wonder HD 650 includes separate digital and analog TV tuners, so you can watch one channel while recording another. This USB device can access the new digital ATSC TV stations, plus get video from a variety of other sources, including camcorders and cable boxes. The included PVR software records shows for later playback and can even convert recordings into common media player formats. Includes remote, remote receiver, antenna, USB cable, AC adapter and software on CD-ROM. Requires PC with 1GB RAM, DirectX 9+ graphics card and Microsoft Windows XP/Vista. Note: Depending on your location, an amplified antenna may be required for optimal reception.','TV Wonder Hd650 USB 2.0 TV Combo Tuner','tv,wonder,usb,tv,combo,tuner','The AMD TV Wonder HD 650 includes separate digital and analog TV tuners, so you can watch one channel while recording another. This USB device can access the new digital ATSC TV stations, plus get vid','P19838.jpg','P19838a.jpg','P19838a.jpg','0.00','1','0','0','0','0','0','y','n','y','n','y','y','n');
