 ('2805','202 5609','0','Netgear Rangemax Wireless USB 2.0 Adapter, Wpn111','99.74','0.00','0.00','Connect your laptop or desktop PC to your 802.11b/g wireless network with this easy-to-use USB adapter. When used with a RangeMax router or access point, this adapter provides significantly improved o','0.6','','','n','n','0','242','1','Connect your laptop or desktop PC to your 802.11b/g wireless network with this easy-to-use USB adapter. When used with a RangeMax router or access point, this adapter provides significantly improved operating distance and transfer rates up to 108Mbps. Requires USB 2.0 port and Windows 98SE/Me/2000/XP. Includes an optional cradle and USB cable and resource software on CD-ROM.  NETGEAR\'s RangeMax MIMO (Multiple-In, Multiple-Out) technology provides Wi-Fi transfer rates up to 108Mbps with as much as 10 times the range of standard 802.11g. The base access points actively use 7 internal antennas to overcome interference and physical barriers in your home. The RangeMax router and access point work best when used with corresponding RangeMax adapters, but are compatible with--even able to boost the performance of--standard 802.11b/g devices.','Netgear Rangemax Wireless USB 2.0 Adapter, Wpn111','wireless adapter,netgear,usb wireless adapter','Connect your laptop or desktop PC to your 802.11b/g wireless network with this easy-to-use USB adapter. When used with a RangeMax router or access point, this adapter provides significantly improved o','P10432.jpg','P10432a.jpg','P10432a.jpg','0.00','1','0','0','0','0','0','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
 ('2806','202 5641','435','Hawking Hi-gain Wireless-g PC Card','60.36','65.61','0.00','Featuring an advanced directional 6 dBi high-gain antenna that delivers a strong concentrated signal in a directed beam, the Hawking Technology PC Card can extend your laptop&#39;s wireless operating dist','0.69','y','y','','','0','151','1','Featuring an advanced directional 6 dBi high-gain antenna that delivers a strong concentrated signal in a directed beam, the Hawking Technology PC Card can extend your laptop&#39;s wireless operating distance by as much as 200%. Unlike standard omni-directional Cardbus cards, the directional antenna reduces interference from metal components inside the laptop itself, helping to establish a stronger, more reliable Wi-Fi link. When not in use, the antenna flips down for compact transport.','',' ','Networking>Notebook Networking','P9762.jpg','P9762a.jpg','P9762a.jpg','0.00','1','0','0','0','0','0','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
