 ('2808','202 5658','436','D-link Power Over Ethernet Adapter, Dwl-p200','42.63','46.34','0.00','The power-over-Ethernet (PoE) adapter uses a single Ethernet cable to deliver both data and power to remote network devices like Wi-Fi access points and Internet cameras. Sending DC power over the sam','1.72','y','y','','','0','85','1','The power-over-Ethernet (PoE) adapter uses a single Ethernet cable to deliver both data and power to remote network devices like Wi-Fi access points and Internet cameras. Sending DC power over the same CAT5 cable as your data, eliminates the need to locate your Ethernet-enabled devices near an electrical outlet or to run long, expensive power extension cords to them. Includes: DWL-P200 Base Unit, DWL-P200 Terminal Unit, 24 CAT5 cable, 2 power cords and AC adapter.','','dlink,d-link,power over net,power net,power adapter','Networking>POE &amp; Transceivers','P10322.jpg','P10322a.jpg','P10322a.jpg','0.00','0','0','0','0','0','0','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
