 ('2949','204 0796','0','Sandisk Memory Stick Pro, 512mb','28.58','0.00','0.00','The Memory Stick is Sony\'s proprietary standard for portable memory storage. This media is designed for a wide range of audio and visual applications (including Sony Ericsson cellular phones). A wide','0.1','','','n','n','0','308','1','The Memory Stick is Sony\'s proprietary standard for portable memory storage. This media is designed for a wide range of audio and visual applications (including Sony Ericsson cellular phones). A wide variety of digital content, including photos, computer data music and moving images, can all be stored on a single stick. Copyright protection of contents and application specifications are defined to enable a variety of contents and data to fit in a single medium, allowing you to record, playback, and exchange data with many related products. The Memory Stick is new type of recording media that provides combined features of manageable shape, robust structure, low consumption power for use with portable products, and others.','Sandisk Memory Stick Pro, 512mb','memory stick,512mb memory stick','The Memory Stick is Sony\'s proprietary standard for portable memory storage. This media is designed for a wide range of audio and visual applications (including Sony Ericsson cellular phones). A wide','P9505.jpg','P9505a.jpg','P9505a.jpg','0.00','0','0','0','0','0','0','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
