 ('2951','204 0808','0','Sandisk Micro SD Flash Memory, 256mb','7.79','0.00','0.00','MicroSD (micro SD) cards were originally called T-Flash and then TransFlash before being standardized as microSD by the SD Card Association (SDA). Like its name, the microSD card (or TransFlash) is es','0.1','','','n','n','0','308','1','MicroSD (micro SD) cards were originally called T-Flash and then TransFlash before being standardized as microSD by the SD Card Association (SDA). Like its name, the microSD card (or TransFlash) is essentially an SD card, but in a smaller package (the size of a fingernail). It is one of the smallest removable flash memory card formats designed specifically for mobile phones and other small devices. Like any flash memory card, it can be used to store various types of files, including photos, videos, music, or software.','Sandisk Micro SD Flash Memory, 256mb','sandisk,flash memory,sanddisk transflash,256mb flash,trans flash,microsd,micro sd,memory card,flash card','MicroSD (micro SD) cards were originally called T-Flash and then TransFlash before being standardized as microSD by the SD Card Association (SDA). Like its name, the microSD card (or TransFlash) is es','P10653.jpg','P10653a.jpg','P10653a.jpg','0.00','0','0','0','0','0','0','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
