 ('3128','245 0733','0','Pqi Micro SD Flash Memory, 1gb','9.05','0.00','0.00','MicroSD (micro SD) cards were originally called T-Flash and then TransFlash before being standardized as microSD by the SD Card Association (SDA). Like its name, the microSD card is essentially an SD','0.1','','','n','n','0','280','1','MicroSD (micro SD) cards were originally called T-Flash and then TransFlash before being standardized as microSD by the SD Card Association (SDA). Like its name, the microSD card is essentially an SD card, but in a smaller package (the size of a fingernail). It is one of the smallest removable flash memory card formats designed specifically for mobile phones and other small devices. Like any flash memory card, it can be used to store various types of files, including photos, videos, music, or software.','Pqi Micro SD Flash Memory, 1gb','PQI,micro sd flash,flash memory,1gb,1gb flash','MicroSD (micro SD) cards were originally called T-Flash and then TransFlash before being standardized as microSD by the SD Card Association (SDA). Like its name, the microSD card is essentially an SD','P14259.jpg','P14259a.jpg','P14259a.jpg','0.00','1','0','0','0','0','0','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
