 ('3533','163 0139','381','Vantec 2.5/3.5in Sata HDD Dock To USB 2.0/esata','40.50','44.03','0.00','The NexStar Hard Drive Dock makes it utterly simple to connect a bare SATA drive to your computer! Just take a 2.5 or 3.5 drive and drop it into the dock like bread in a toaster. The drive mounts on','2.15','y','y','','y','0','13','0','The NexStar Hard Drive Dock makes it utterly simple to connect a bare SATA drive to your computer! Just take a 2.5 or 3.5 drive and drop it into the dock like bread in a toaster. The drive mounts on your computer using either USB 2.0 or eSATA. Exchange files between the drive and your PC at up to 3.0Gbps. When you&#39;re done, just press the eject button! Includes USB cable, eSATA cable, external to internal SATA converter, AC adapter, and drivers on a MiniCD. SATA hard drives not included. Requires computer equipped with USB 2.0 or SATA, and Microsoft Windows 98SE+ or Mac OS 8.6+. Not compatible with ATA/ATAPI (IDE) drives.','','hard drive enclosure,hdd,3.5hdd,hdd dock,usb hdd','Computer Components>Drives &amp; Storage>Hard Drive Accessories','P22660.jpg','P22660a.jpg','P22660a.jpg','0.00','0','0','0','0','0','1','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
 ('3534','163 0209','194','Cradlepoint Mobile Broadband Router','286.35','311.25','0.00','The Cradlepoint mobile broadband router connects multiple computers to the Internet, utilizing only a single broadband EV-DO or HSDPA device. It functions as an access point, communicating with local','2.2','y','y','','y','0','324','0','The Cradlepoint mobile broadband router connects multiple computers to the Internet, utilizing only a single broadband EV-DO or HSDPA device. It functions as an access point, communicating with local computers over 802.11b/g/n* wireless and to the Internet via your cellular 3G handset or ExpressCard. It allows your desktop PCs to use your cellular device, or it can create a Wi-Fi hot spot where fixed broadband connections are unavailable. Cellular data coverage varies by area; consult your carrier for availability. Includes Ethernet adapter and AC adapter. Requires active EV-DO or HSDPA ExpressCard or USB-connecting handset. *802.11n draft speeds','','broadband,mobile,portable,wifi,wireless,router','Networking>Wireless Networking (WiFi)>Wireless Routers','P23898.jpg','P23898a.jpg','P23898a.jpg','0.00','0','0','0','0','0','1','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
 ('3535','163 0219','379','Vantec Nexstar 3i External 3.5in Sata HDD Encl','46.92','51.00','0.00','Vantec&#39;s NexStar 3i enclosure is designed to self-regulate its power consumption, improving efficiency and potentially extending the life of the installed hard drive. Three power management modes--idl','2.3','y','y','','y','0','13','0','Vantec&#39;s NexStar 3i enclosure is designed to self-regulate its power consumption, improving efficiency and potentially extending the life of the installed hard drive. Three power management modes--idle, standby, and power down--can be custom set to balance between data needs and power savings. In addition, the NexStar&#39;s aluminum casing helps cool your drive. Includes power management software on CD-ROM. Requires 3.5 SATA hard drive, not included.','','nexstar,3I,external,sata,hard,drive,hdd,enclosure','Computer Components>Drives &amp; Storage>External Enclosures','P24098.jpg','P24098a.jpg','P24098a.jpg','0.00','0','0','0','0','0','1','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
 ('3536','163 0228','380','Fire-safe Waterproof Hard Drive, 160gb','312.80','340.00','0.00','Encased in the patented SentrySafe concrete-based shell, this hard drive is designed to survive for 30 minutes at 1,550 degrees Fahrenheit. It also can be completely submerged with no threat of drive','9.9','y','y','','y','0','180','0','Encased in the patented SentrySafe concrete-based shell, this hard drive is designed to survive for 30 minutes at 1,550 degrees Fahrenheit. It also can be completely submerged with no threat of drive damage. Fires and floods do happen, so it&#39;s important that your most valuable data are protected. In addition to the physical protection, Sentry provides free data recovery services and will replace a fire- or water-damaged SentrySafe drive. Includes USB cable and software on CD-ROM. Requires 2 USB ports and Microsoft Windows XP+ or Mac OS 10.4.7+.','',' ','Computer Components>Drives &amp; Storage>External Hard Drives','P25558.jpg','P25558a.jpg','P25558a.jpg','0.00','0','0','0','0','0','1','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
 ('3537','163 0229','380','Fire-safe Waterproof Hard Drive, 250gb','378.35','411.25','0.00','Encased in the patented SentrySafe concrete-based shell, this hard drive is designed to survive for 30 minutes at 1,550 degrees Fahrenheit. It also can be completely submerged with no threat of drive','9.9','y','y','','y','0','180','0','Encased in the patented SentrySafe concrete-based shell, this hard drive is designed to survive for 30 minutes at 1,550 degrees Fahrenheit. It also can be completely submerged with no threat of drive damage. Fires and floods do happen, so it&#39;s important that your most valuable data are protected. In addition to the physical protection, Sentry provides free data recovery services and will replace a fire- or water-damaged SentrySafe drive. Includes USB cable and software on CD-ROM. Requires 2 USB ports and Microsoft Windows XP+ or Mac OS 10.4.7+.','',' ','Computer Components>Drives &amp; Storage>External Hard Drives','P25579.jpg','P25579a.jpg','P25579a.jpg','0.00','0','0','0','0','0','1','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
 ('3538','163 0230','379','Fire-safe Waterproof Data Storage Chest, USB 2.0','159.85','173.75','0.00','Protect an external USB hard drive in a lockable safe that&#39;s both fire- and water-proof... while still retaining access to the drive&#39;s data. The SentrySafe Data Storage Chest includes a pass-through U','20.15','y','y','','y','0','180','0','Protect an external USB hard drive in a lockable safe that&#39;s both fire- and water-proof... while still retaining access to the drive&#39;s data. The SentrySafe Data Storage Chest includes a pass-through USB port so that you can keep a protected drive connected to your computer. The safe&#39;s concrete-based lining is ETL-verified to protect contents against total submersion or against 30 minutes at 1,550 degrees Fahrenheit. Ten double-sided hanging pockets for CDs and DVDs are also included. Usable with USB 2.0 powered devices only; does not support externally powered devices.','',' ','Computer Components>Drives &amp; Storage>External Enclosures','P25658.jpg','P25658a.jpg','P25658a.jpg','0.00','0','0','0','0','0','1','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
 ('3539','163 0258','379','Ams 5 Bay 3.5in Sata To Esata Ext HDD Encl','217.35','236.25','0.00','Combine up to five 3.5 SATA drives in one enclosure... then configure them to meet your storage needs. You can choose from several RAID schemes for varying degrees of speed, redundancy and capacity.','11.1','y','y','','y','0','43','0','Combine up to five 3.5 SATA drives in one enclosure... then configure them to meet your storage needs. You can choose from several RAID schemes for varying degrees of speed, redundancy and capacity. The enclosure can handle 5 SATA drives up to 1 terabyte each, yielding a maximum capacity of 5TB. The included Silicon Image PCI Express RAID controller card provides data transfers up to 3.0GBps. Includes PCI Express 2-port eSATA card, eSATA cord and software on CD-ROM.','',' ','Computer Components>Drives &amp; Storage>External Enclosures','P28759.jpg','P28759a.jpg','P28759a.jpg','0.00','0','0','0','0','0','1','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
 ('3540','163 0259','379','Ams 2 Bay 3.5in Sata To USB 2.0/esata Ext HDD Encl','106.15','115.38','0.00','Keep your important data secure in a dual drive enclosure that uses onboard RAID to continuously backup your files. With fast USB access or super-fast eSATA access, the Venus eS2 works well with data-','5.75','y','y','','y','0','43','0','Keep your important data secure in a dual drive enclosure that uses onboard RAID to continuously backup your files. With fast USB access or super-fast eSATA access, the Venus eS2 works well with data-heavy operations like 3D animation, video editing, audio streaming or system backup. Easy to set up, the eS2 can handle drives up to a terabyte in capacity. Includes eSATA cable, USB 2.0 cable and AC adapter. Requires Microsoft Windows 2000/XP/Vista or Mac OS 10.4+ and two 3.5 SATA drives of equal capacity, not included.','',' ','Computer Components>Drives &amp; Storage>External Enclosures','P28758.jpg','P28758a.jpg','P28758a.jpg','0.00','0','0','0','0','0','1','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
 ('3541','163 0271','383','Seagate Savvio 15k 36gb 2.5in Sas HDD, Oem','309.35','336.25','0.00','The Savvio 15K 2.5-inch drive provides amazing performance and reliability while ensuring ultra-low power consumption. The Savvio 15K drive ranks amongst the world&#39;s best for performance per U, perfor','0.6','y','y','','y','0','318','0','The Savvio 15K 2.5-inch drive provides amazing performance and reliability while ensuring ultra-low power consumption. The Savvio 15K drive ranks amongst the world&#39;s best for performance per U, performance per gigabyte, and performance per watt. The Savvio 15K drive offers the advanced SAS interface. Chosen by HP for their record-breaking performance benchmarks, the Savvio drive outperforms 3.5-inch 15,000rpm drives and consumes around 30 percent less power.','','savvio,36gb,15k,2.5,hdd,hard,drive','Computer Components>Drives &amp; Storage>Laptop Hard Drives','P24299.jpg','P24299a.jpg','P24299a.jpg','0.00','0','0','0','0','0','1','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
 ('3542','163 0292','382','Seagate Es.2, 500gb 3.5in Sas HDD, Oem','200.10','217.50','0.00','The Barracuda(R) ES2 Serial Attached SCSI (SAS) drives are perfect for high-capacity, 7200rpm enterprise storage applications where GB cost and watts per GB are primary considerations. They offers ene','1.5','y','y','','y','0','318','0','The Barracuda(R) ES2 Serial Attached SCSI (SAS) drives are perfect for high-capacity, 7200rpm enterprise storage applications where GB cost and watts per GB are primary considerations. They offers energy-saving PowerTrim features, internal data integrity protection, superior rotational vibration tolerance and a SATA 3.0Gbps interface. The Seagate(R) Barracuda(R) ES.2 drive uses second-generation Seagate perpendicular recording technology to provide up to one terabyte of storage in a single, 4-platter hard drive. This 7200rpm drive with best-in-class reliability and rotational vibration tolerance was developed for 24x7 availability in high-density, Tier 2 storage applications. The drives integrated workload management feature aids in drive cooling during periods of prolonged activity. The integrated PowerTrim technology optimizes power consumption during operation and idle without any host interaction or performance loss. The Barracuda ES.2 drive comes with in-drive data integrity protection guaranteed through Seagate IOEDC/IOECC technology.','','2.5,2.5in,500,500gb,momentus,7200rpm,500 gig,500gig,internal,sata,hd,hdd,hard drive,harddrive,internal hard drive','Computer Components>Drives &amp; Storage>Internal Hard Drives','P24292.jpg','P24292a.jpg','P24292a.jpg','0.00','0','0','0','0','0','1','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
