 ('3552','163 0352','381','Dual 2.5in Sata HDD Int Enclosure For 3.5in Bay','39.94','43.41','0.00','Fitting into a single 3.5 bay, this enclosure gives you 2 docks for 2.5 SATA drives. Just pop a drive into either slot to immediately access it from your computer... without tools, adapters, cables','1.1','y','y','','y','0','101','0','Fitting into a single 3.5 bay, this enclosure gives you 2 docks for 2.5 SATA drives. Just pop a drive into either slot to immediately access it from your computer... without tools, adapters, cables or losses in data speed. Push the lock button to eject the drive. Includes 2 SATA data cables, 2 Molex-to-SATA power adapters and drive screws. Requires SATA controller with 2 available data ports and two 4-pin Molex power connectors.','','dual,2.5,mobile,rack,pc,bay,rack','Computer Components>Drives &amp; Storage>Hard Drive Accessories','P25439.jpg','P25439a.jpg','P25439a.jpg','0.00','0','0','0','0','0','1','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
