 ('3614','202 0303','273','Sound Blaster 7.1ch X-fi PCI-e Sound Card','159.85','173.75','0.00','Upgrade your PC to 7.1 surround sound with the professional X-Fi Titanium Fatal1ty PCI-Express card. With realistic EAX 5.0 sound effects, 3D positional audio and accelerated signal processing, it del','1.25','y','y','','y','0','360','0','Upgrade your PC to 7.1 surround sound with the professional X-Fi Titanium Fatal1ty PCI-Express card. With realistic EAX 5.0 sound effects, 3D positional audio and accelerated signal processing, it delivers the ultimate PC gaming audio experience. Locate opponents by sound, enjoy clear voice chats and get bowled over by earth-shattering explosions. It supports X-Fi CMSS-3D sound for realistic surround sound... even over headphones! Includes software on CD-ROM. Requires P4, AMD Athlon or equivalent 1GHz CPU with PCI-e slot, and Microsoft Windows XP SP2/Vista.','',' ','Computer Components>I/O &amp; Video Cards>Sound Cards','P28978.jpg','P28978a.jpg','P28978a.jpg','0.00','0','0','0','0','0','1','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
 ('3615','202 5271','442','Connectgear 24 Port 10/100 Fast Ethernet Switch','97.84','106.35','0.00','ConnectGear&#39;s 24-port 100BASET-TX Ethernet switch is thin enough to mount in just a single unit on a 19-inch rack. It supports auto negotiation and MDI/MDI-X on all ports to allow both 10Mbps and 100M','5.7','y','y','','y','0','9','0','ConnectGear&#39;s 24-port 100BASET-TX Ethernet switch is thin enough to mount in just a single unit on a 19-inch rack. It supports auto negotiation and MDI/MDI-X on all ports to allow both 10Mbps and 100Mbps devices to co-exist on the same network without the need for special cables. Includes mounting hardware and power cord. Requires Ethernet cables, not included.','','rack,mount,24,port,network,10/100,switch','Networking>Rack Mount Products>Rack Mount Switches','P25021.jpg','P25021a.jpg','P25021a.jpg','0.00','0','0','0','0','0','1','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
 ('3616','202 5346','434','Intellinet 16 Port 10/100 Metal Soho Switch','69.39','75.43','0.00','Get more computers online with this 16-port Ethernet switch. Connect up to 15 workstations to your network at either 10Mbps (10BASE-T) or 100Mbps (100BASE-TX) speeds. Each port is auto-sensing and wil','2.25','y','y','','y','0','116','0','Get more computers online with this 16-port Ethernet switch. Connect up to 15 workstations to your network at either 10Mbps (10BASE-T) or 100Mbps (100BASE-TX) speeds. Each port is auto-sensing and will negotiate the best protocol for optimal data transfer speeds. Includes rubber feet and AC adapter. Requires upstream Ethernet router and patch cables.','','16 port,network,ethernet,10/100 switch, 16port, SOHO','Networking>Network Switches','P6799.jpg','P6799a.jpg','P6799a.jpg','0.00','0','0','0','0','0','1','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
