 ('3618','202 5761','434','Intellinet 8 Port Gigabit Switch, Metal Chassis','124.26','135.06','0.00','Upgrade your existing network to Gigabit speeds without installing expensive fiber optics! Designed for fast, flexible and affordable networking, this Gigabit-over-copper switch enables users to inexp','1.45','y','y','','y','0','116','0','Upgrade your existing network to Gigabit speeds without installing expensive fiber optics! Designed for fast, flexible and affordable networking, this Gigabit-over-copper switch enables users to inexpensively migrate 10/100 SOHO networks to a faster, 10/100/1000 Ethernet network. Includes attachable foot pads and AC adapter. Requires Ethernet cables, not included.','','8,port,gigbit,network,switch','Networking>Network Switches','P24778.jpg','P24778a.jpg','P24778a.jpg','0.00','0','0','0','0','0','1','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
 ('3619','202 5764','442','24-port Gigabit 10/100/1000 Smart Switch W/ 4 Sfp','378.35','411.25','0.00','This Web-smart switch meets all IEEE 802.3/u/ab/z Gigabit, Fast Ethernet specifications. It is equipped with twenty 10/100/1000Base-T ports and 4 dual-media ports that accommodate optional 10/100/1000','6.85','y','y','','y','0','9','0','This Web-smart switch meets all IEEE 802.3/u/ab/z Gigabit, Fast Ethernet specifications. It is equipped with twenty 10/100/1000Base-T ports and 4 dual-media ports that accommodate optional 10/100/1000Base-T or SFP modules. The switch can be managed through an Ethernet port using a Web browser, as the network administrator can log into the switch to monitor, configure and control each port&#39;s activity. In addition, the switch implements QoS (Quality of Service), Port Mirror, VLAN, LACP, LAN security, multicasting video stream protocol, and SNMP v2c. It is suitable for SMB applications. Includes rack mount hardware and 6-foot NEMA 5-15 to IEC C13 power cord. SFP modules not included.','',' ','Networking>Rack Mount Products>Rack Mount Switches','P26458.jpg','P26458a.jpg','P26458a.jpg','0.00','0','0','0','0','0','1','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
 ('3620','202 5772','434','Intellinet 5 Port Gigabit Switch, Metal Chassis','86.51','94.04','0.00','Upgrade your existing network to Gigabit speeds without installing expensive fiber optics! Designed for fast, flexible and affordable networking, this Gigabit over copper switch enables you to inexp','1.55','y','y','','y','0','116','0','Upgrade your existing network to Gigabit speeds without installing expensive fiber optics! Designed for fast, flexible and affordable networking, this Gigabit over copper switch enables you to inexpensively migrate 10/100 SOHO networks to a faster, 10/100/1000 Ethernet network.','',' ','Networking>Network Switches','P27418.jpg','P27418a.jpg','P27418a.jpg','0.00','0','0','0','0','0','1','y','n','y','n','y','y','n');
insert into `products` values('3621','202 5785','194','D-link Xtreme N Gigabit Router','143.75','156.25','0.00','One of the fastest routers made to date, D-Link&#39;s Xtreme N Gigabit Router supports wireless transfers up to 14 times faster than 802.11g. Although still in draft, the 802.11n standard significantly in','2.1','y','y','','y','0','317','0','One of the fastest routers made to date, D-Link&#39;s Xtreme N Gigabit Router supports wireless transfers up to 14 times faster than 802.11g. Although still in draft, the 802.11n standard significantly increases wireless speeds, distance and power. You&#39;ll even experience faster transfers when you use this router with your existing 802.11g equipment. This router also includes a 4-port 10/100/1000 gigabit switch for extra-fast wired transfers to PCs or upstream routers. A USB port allows you to connect USB printers or hard drives for sharing across the network. A full host of web-managed security and firewall features make it one of the most secure routers too. Includes 3 antennas, CAT5 cable, AC adapter and CD-ROM with software. Requires ADSL/cable modem, not included. Administration requires Microsoft Windows XP/Vista or Mac OS 10.4+. For optimal performance, use with D-Link Xtreme N wireless adapters.','',' ','Networking>Wireless Networking (WiFi)>Wireless Routers','P29458.jpg','P29458a.jpg','P29458a.jpg','0.00','0','0','0','0','0','1','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
 ('3622','202 5786','250','D-link Xtreme N PCI-e Desktop Adapter','90.79','98.69','0.00','Take advantage of future 802.11n capabilities today with D-Link&#39;s Xtreme N PCI-e Adapter, based on the current draft of the new amendment. By utilizing multiple micro-antennas, it provides greater spe','0.7','y','y','','y','0','317','0','Take advantage of future 802.11n capabilities today with D-Link&#39;s Xtreme N PCI-e Adapter, based on the current draft of the new amendment. By utilizing multiple micro-antennas, it provides greater speed and range over current 802.11g. Certified to be completely compatible with existing 802.11g products, the adapter works best when used with other D-Link Extreme N products.','',' ','Computer Components>I/O &amp; Video Cards>Network I/O Cards (NIC)','P29459.jpg','P29459a.jpg','P29459a.jpg','0.00','0','0','0','0','0','1','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
 ('3623','202 5788','194','D-link Xtreme N Dual Band USB Adapter','90.79','98.69','0.00','Take advantage of future 802.11n capabilities today with D-Link&#39;s Xtreme N USB Adapter, based on the current draft of the new amendment. By utilizing multiple micro-antennas, it provides greater speed','0.65','y','y','','y','0','317','0','Take advantage of future 802.11n capabilities today with D-Link&#39;s Xtreme N USB Adapter, based on the current draft of the new amendment. By utilizing multiple micro-antennas, it provides greater speed and range over current 802.11g. Certified to be completely compatible with existing 802.11g products, the adapter works best when used with other D-Link Extreme N products.','',' ','Networking>Wireless Networking (WiFi)>Wireless Routers','P29461.jpg','P29461a.jpg','P29461a.jpg','0.00','0','0','0','0','0','1','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
 ('3624','204 0108','388','Modosteady, 3-in-1 Camcorder Stabilizer','157.04','170.70','0.00','As a counterbalance stabilizer the Modosteady will make your camcorder seem to float as you move along to follow the action you&#39;re shooting. It makes your camcorder react slowly to your motion so your','1.32','y','y','','y','0','386','0','As a counterbalance stabilizer the Modosteady will make your camcorder seem to float as you move along to follow the action you&#39;re shooting. It makes your camcorder react slowly to your motion so your video recording is steady and smooth. As the action speeds up, switch to the shoulder brace and take aim. You&#39;ll get great support, but its easy to follow fast paced action. Finally pull the cap off the end of the handle, the handle splits to become the three legs of a table-top tripod.The bottom rubber foot adjusts to counterbalance the precise center gravity of your camcorder','','3in1,camcorder,stabilizer,stand','Digital/Multimedia Products>Camera &amp; Photo Accessories','P20040.jpg','P20040a.jpg','P20040a.jpg','0.00','0','0','0','0','0','1','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
 ('3625','204 0115','388','The Puffer Pop Up Flash Diffuser For Dslr Cameras','22.99','24.99','0.00','The Puffer flash diffuser can make your photographs look better by reducing the harsh contrast often caused by on-camera pop-up flashes. It fits into the hot shoe of many popular digital SLR cameras a','0.1','y','y','','y','0','389','0','The Puffer flash diffuser can make your photographs look better by reducing the harsh contrast often caused by on-camera pop-up flashes. It fits into the hot shoe of many popular digital SLR cameras and separates into 2 parts for ease of storage. With its 8 mounting positions, you can adjust the balance of direct and diffuse light.','','camera flash','Digital/Multimedia Products>Camera &amp; Photo Accessories','P23998.jpg','P23998a.jpg','P23998a.jpg','0.00','0','0','0','0','0','1','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
 ('3626','204 0116','385','PCI USB 2.0, Esata And Power Combo Card','15.63','16.99','0.00','Give your PC an additional 2 USB ports with this PCI-based expansion card. It includes an onboard 4-pin header for connecting another USB port (like from the front case panel) and an eSATA port on the','0.5','y','y','','y','0','101','0','Give your PC an additional 2 USB ports with this PCI-based expansion card. It includes an onboard 4-pin header for connecting another USB port (like from the front case panel) and an eSATA port on the back for external SATA drives. It also provides 2 amps of power (at 5 volts) for external devices through a 6-pin mini-DIN port. You can customize your power cable or use the included 6-foot extension cable with 5mm DC plug. Includes drivers on MiniCD. Requires PCI slot, FDD power feed from power supply, and Microsoft Windows 98SE/Me/2000/XP/Vista.','','esata,sata,pci,expansion,card','Computer Components>I/O &amp; Video Cards>Hard Drive Controllers/Raid Cards','P24840.jpg','P24840a.jpg','P24840a.jpg','0.00','0','0','0','0','0','1','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
 ('3627','204 0117','272','PCI Controller Card, 2x Serial And 1x Parallel','19.14','20.80','0.00','Connect multiple serial and parallel devices to your PCI slot-equipped desktop PC with this I/O controller card. It adds two configurable DE9 RS-232 serial ports and one DB25 parallel port to your com','0.4','y','y','','y','0','101','0','Connect multiple serial and parallel devices to your PCI slot-equipped desktop PC with this I/O controller card. It adds two configurable DE9 RS-232 serial ports and one DB25 parallel port to your computer. You can add multiple I/O cards to your system and share IRQs to save resources. Requires 1 PCI slot and an additional slot. Compatible with DOS, Microsoft Windows and Linux.','','serial,parallel,pci,controller,card','Computer Components>I/O &amp; Video Cards>Serial Port Cards','P24878.jpg','P24878a.jpg','P24878a.jpg','0.00','0','0','0','0','0','1','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
 ('3628','204 0124','408','USB 2.0 19-in-1 Compact Card Reader, Black','14.62','15.89','0.00','This ultra-compact and portable flash card reader supports large capacity, high-speed memory cards and uses LEDs to indicate which of its slots are in use. It is designed to accept 19 popular memory c','0.5','y','y','','y','0','13','0','This ultra-compact and portable flash card reader supports large capacity, high-speed memory cards and uses LEDs to indicate which of its slots are in use. It is designed to accept 19 popular memory cards without an adapter and has a hidden USB plug. Does not require a USB cable. Requires Microsoft Windows 98SE+ or Mac OS 10.1+.','',' ','Input Devices>Memory Card Readers','P29139.jpg','P29139a.jpg','P29139a.jpg','0.00','0','0','0','0','0','1','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
 ('3629','204 0125','388','Quickpod Extendable Handheld Monopod Camera Kit','23.38','25.41','0.00','You&#39;ve traveled the world, seen the sights, met interesting people and you have the pictures to prove it. Unfortunately, your grotesquely distorted arm is in each shot, stretching out to hold your cam','0.55','y','y','','y','0','390','0','You&#39;ve traveled the world, seen the sights, met interesting people and you have the pictures to prove it. Unfortunately, your grotesquely distorted arm is in each shot, stretching out to hold your camera in front of you. Next time, try the Compod Slim camera extender instead! Set your camera, reach out with the Compod Slim and click!... you&#39;re in the shot and your arm isn&#39;t. You can also use it to shoot in difficult to reach places, under, over and behind things. Fits cameras with universal 1/4 tripod mount. Includes carrying bag, wrist strap, hiking clip and extendable mini tripod legs. Camera not included. Colors vary.','',' ','Digital/Multimedia Products>Camera &amp; Photo Accessories','P29440.jpg','P29440a.jpg','P29440a.jpg','0.00','0','0','0','0','0','1','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
