 ('3644','204 0753','11','SD/ To IDE Adapter','14.35','15.60','0.00','The SD to IDE Adapter is designed to enable Secure Digital (or MultiMediaCard) media to be used as a direct replacement for an ATA/ATAPI hard drive. With a low-powered and shock-resistant SD card, you','0.2','y','y','','y','0','101','0','The SD to IDE Adapter is designed to enable Secure Digital (or MultiMediaCard) media to be used as a direct replacement for an ATA/ATAPI hard drive. With a low-powered and shock-resistant SD card, you can use it in any device that accepts an IDE drive. Once installed, the flash card appears like an ordinary hard drive to any operating system and can even be configured as a boot device. Flash media card not included.','','sd,mmc,ide,adapter','Media>Flash Memory Cards','P24839.jpg','P24839a.jpg','P24839a.jpg','0.00','0','0','0','0','0','1','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
