 ('3699','250 1036','454','Koncept Mini Z LED Lamp, 40 Leds, Silver','109.19','118.69','0.00','Energy and space-efficient, this attractive desk lamp from Koncept is a great replacement for those old, hot halogen lamps. It features 40 super-bright, cool-running LEDs in a single 11 strip and its','5.05','y','y','','y','0','456','0','Energy and space-efficient, this attractive desk lamp from Koncept is a great replacement for those old, hot halogen lamps. It features 40 super-bright, cool-running LEDs in a single 11 strip and its easy-to-adjust arm is perfect for cramped desktops. The Mini-Z comes with both desk clamp and a weighted free-standing round base. Includes AC adapter.','','led lamp,mini led lamp','Office Products>LED Bulbs &amp; Lamps','P14948.jpg','P14948a.jpg','P14948a.jpg','0.00','0','0','0','0','0','1','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
 ('3700','250 1052','451','Jumbo Digital Atomic Clock','35.33','38.40','0.00','These digital clocks set themselves automatically by tapping into the time signal broadcast from a cesium fountain atomic clock located in Boulder, Colorado. Accurate to 1 second every 60 million year','1.54','y','y','','y','0','498','0','These digital clocks set themselves automatically by tapping into the time signal broadcast from a cesium fountain atomic clock located in Boulder, Colorado. Accurate to 1 second every 60 million years, the atomic clock signal is broadcast all over North America by the National Institute of Standards and Technology. With a built-in weather station, large-sized numbers and atomic clock-based precision, this elegant LCD alarm clock can be mounted to a wall or set on a desk. The easy-to-read display indicates not only the time, but also the day of the week, the temperature and the humidity. Requires 2 AA batteries, not included.','','clock,desk clock,cube clock,atomic,atomic clock','Office Products>Desk &amp; Wall Clocks','P11611.jpg','P11611a.jpg','P11611a.jpg','0.00','0','0','0','0','0','1','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
 ('3701','250 1134','451','Dayclock, 9.5in Mahogany Frame','35.08','38.13','0.00','If you&#39;re lucky enough to measure life by the day, this is the clock for you. It&#39;s a perfect novelty gift for recent retirees to let them know their ties to the clock are easing and it&#39;s great for vac','1.4','y','y','','y','0','458','0','If you&#39;re lucky enough to measure life by the day, this is the clock for you. It&#39;s a perfect novelty gift for recent retirees to let them know their ties to the clock are easing and it&#39;s great for vacation homes and RVs. We should all aspire to needing a clock like this. Requires AA battery, not included.','','dayclock,clock','Office Products>Desk &amp; Wall Clocks','P13711.jpg','P13711a.jpg','P13711a.jpg','0.00','0','0','0','0','0','1','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
