 ('3709','250 1525','421','Call-starz Cell Phone Charm For CDma Phones, Panda','8.38','9.11','0.00','The Call-Starz fob guys go bananas when your cell phone rings! Colorful lights flash and the lil&#39;animal characters dance around madly! The Call-Starz don&#39;t require any wiring, they just hang out on--','0.05','y','y','','y','0','464','0','The Call-Starz fob guys go bananas when your cell phone rings! Colorful lights flash and the lil&#39;animal characters dance around madly! The Call-Starz don&#39;t require any wiring, they just hang out on--or near--your cell. You can even use one as a silent ringer, as it&#39;ll light up whenever you receive a call or message! CDMA Call-Starz require cell phones on the CDMA standard, including phones from Alltel, Sprint, US Cellular, Verizon and Virgin Mobile. Includes two L1154 batteries.','',' ','Mobile Computing &amp; Travel Products>Cell/PDA Products>Cell/PDA  Accessories','P27645.jpg','P27645a.jpg','P27645a.jpg','0.00','0','0','0','0','0','1','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
 ('3710','255 0160','165','Mini Liquid Dispenser, White Or Beige','12.93','14.05','0.00','Combat workplace dehydration with your own personal desktop water dispenser! A slimmed-down version of the standard office gathering spot, this dispenser serves up 8 glasses (the recommended daily req','1.66','y','y','','y','0','439','0','Combat workplace dehydration with your own personal desktop water dispenser! A slimmed-down version of the standard office gathering spot, this dispenser serves up 8 glasses (the recommended daily requirement) of water or your favorite beverage. Fill it using the included reusable bottle or with the bottled water of your choice. (May be white or beige.)','','water,bottle,','Office Products>Desk Accessories','P9088.jpg','P9088a.jpg','P9088a.jpg','0.00','0','0','0','0','0','1','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
 ('3711','255 0185','455','Play N Freeze Ice Cream Ball, Color May Vary','23.87','25.95','0.00','Make homemade ice cream the fun way! This unique ice cream maker utilizes human power to mix and freeze delicious ice cream. Add ingredients to one end, ice and rock salt to the other, then shake, rat','2.3','y','y','','y','0','501','0','Make homemade ice cream the fun way! This unique ice cream maker utilizes human power to mix and freeze delicious ice cream. Add ingredients to one end, ice and rock salt to the other, then shake, rattle and roll your way to a sweet, frozen ice cream treat... perfect after a hard day&#39;s play. It takes about 20 minutes of mixing to whip up a pint.','','maker,ice cream maker,ice cream,cream ball','Office Products>Miscellaneous Home &amp; Office','P9995.jpg','P9995a.jpg','P9995a.jpg','0.00','0','0','0','0','0','1','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
 ('3712','255 0254','325','Drone Plug And Play Voip/stereo Bluetooth Adapter','29.16','31.70','0.00','The Callpod Drone is a USB Bluetooth adapter for PC and Mac computers, specially designed for use as an audio gateway to Bluetooth devices. With a built-in stereo AD2P profile and eSCO technology to i','0.1','y','y','','y','0','221','0','The Callpod Drone is a USB Bluetooth adapter for PC and Mac computers, specially designed for use as an audio gateway to Bluetooth devices. With a built-in stereo AD2P profile and eSCO technology to improve sound quality, it&#39;s perfect for combining voice-over-IP applications (VoIP) on your computer with your favorite Bluetooth headset. Class I power gives you extended range, up to 320 ft. with other Class I Bluetooth devices. Requires Microsoft Windows XP/Vista or Mac OS 10.4+.','',' ','Networking>Wireless Networking (WiFi)>Bluetooth Adapters','P29058.jpg','P29058a.jpg','P29058a.jpg','0.00','0','0','0','0','0','1','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
 ('3713','255 0307','222','Carchip Pro, W/ Alarm','95.55','103.86','0.00','The CarChip Pro plugs into the OBD II connector found on most newer vehicles and records and stores up to 300 hours of performance data including time&amp;date for each trip, distance traveled, speed, b','0.34','y','y','','y','0','469','0','The CarChip Pro plugs into the OBD II connector found on most newer vehicles and records and stores up to 300 hours of performance data including time&amp;date for each trip, distance traveled, speed, braking and acceleration. Additionally, the car-chip can sound an alarm for excess speed, hard braking or quick acceleration. It records trouble codes and freeze frame sensor readings to aid in engine troubleshooting. Performance logs can be downloaded to your PC. Includes USB cable and software on CD-ROM. Requires Microsoft Windows 98SE/Me/2000/XP/Vista. The OBD II system is installed in most foreign&amp;domestic vehicles built since 1996. For a list of known exceptions, please consult the compatibility chart.','','carchip,car chip pro,car chip','Mobile Computing &amp; Travel Products>Auto Travel Aids','P15962.jpg','P15962a.jpg','P15962a.jpg','0.00','0','0','0','0','0','1','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
 ('3714','255 0309','222','Scangauge, Compact 3 In 1 Automotive Computer','182.85','198.75','0.00','Plug the ScanGauge II into your car&#39;s OBDII connector to get real time information on the vitals of your engine, as well as retrieve problem codes when the check engine light goes on. You can also u','0.7','y','y','','y','0','470','0','Plug the ScanGauge II into your car&#39;s OBDII connector to get real time information on the vitals of your engine, as well as retrieve problem codes when the check engine light goes on. You can also use ScanGauge II to determine your vehicle&#39;s fuel use and fuel economy. Use it to monitor engine temperatures, battery voltages, fuel consumption and more. The trip data can report the average and maximum speeds reached in the last four trips, plus much more. The OBDII connector is in almost all vehicles made after 1996. Not all vehicles provide all the data ScanGauge II can track. Includes OBDII cable and mounting tape.','',' ','Mobile Computing &amp; Travel Products>Auto Travel Aids','P32018.jpg','P32018a.jpg','P32018a.jpg','0.00','0','0','0','0','0','1','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
 ('3715','255 0314','428','Lightwedge Soft Case, Original','7.46','8.11','0.00','The Lightwedge neoprene Soft Case is made with microfiber liners. Keeps your LightWedge lens safe and protected from scratches.','0.1','y','y','','y','0','257','0','The Lightwedge neoprene Soft Case is made with microfiber liners. Keeps your LightWedge lens safe and protected from scratches.','','lightwedge softcase,softcase, soft case, book reading,travel aid','Mobile Computing &amp; Travel Products>Travel &amp; Reading Lights','P7888.jpg','P7888a.jpg','P7888a.jpg','0.00','0','0','0','0','0','1','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
 ('3716','255 0319','222','Scangaugeii Replacement Cable','19.78','21.50','0.00','Use this cable with your ScanGauge II 3-in-1 car computer (sold separately).','0.25','y','y','','y','0','470','0','Use this cable with your ScanGauge II 3-in-1 car computer (sold separately).','',' ','Mobile Computing &amp; Travel Products>Auto Travel Aids','P32019.jpg','P32019a.jpg','P32019a.jpg','0.00','0','0','0','0','0','1','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
 ('3717','255 0338','227','Picopad Wallet Notes W/ Pens And Refill Notes, 3 Pack','10.35','11.25','0.00','The PicoPad is a credit card-sized writing pad that includes its own pen. Jot down your thoughts on the included sticky notes and then fold up the PicoPad and slip it into your wallet. The wings on th','0.15','y','y','','y','0','474','0','The PicoPad is a credit card-sized writing pad that includes its own pen. Jot down your thoughts on the included sticky notes and then fold up the PicoPad and slip it into your wallet. The wings on the pen make it easy to hold and handle. Set includes 3 PicoPad holders, 3 pens and 9 sets of compatible 15-sheet self-stick notes.','','wallet notepad,notepad','Mobile Computing &amp; Travel Products>Travel Accessories','P14958.jpg','P14958a.jpg','P14958a.jpg','0.00','0','0','0','0','0','1','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
 ('3718','255 0342','227','Picopad Tacky Note Refills, 6 Pack','2.70','2.94','0.00','Use these 3L x 1 3/4W sticky notes with the PicoPad Wallet Note system. Includes 6 pads, 15 sheets each.','0.05','y','y','','y','0','474','0','Use these 3L x 1 3/4W sticky notes with the PicoPad Wallet Note system. Includes 6 pads, 15 sheets each.','','6,pack,picopad,tacky,note,note,refills','Mobile Computing &amp; Travel Products>Travel Accessories','P17301.jpg','P17301a.jpg','P17301a.jpg','0.00','0','0','0','0','0','1','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
 ('3719','134 1464','415','Ziotek Media Carousel PowerDrive, Black ZT1341464','289.00','299.00','0.00','The USB Media Carousel PowerDrive can hold up to 100 CDs or DVDs... and also read from or write to any of them! ','0','y','y','y','y','0','396','1','The USB Media Carousel PowerDrive can hold up to 100 CDs or DVDs... and also read from or write to any of them! Hook it up to your PC to access multimedia CDs, installation discs, backup DVDs, audio CDs and more. The built-in reader/writer allows direct access to any stored disc... and there\'s no need to touch a disc to load it! Use the included software to search through your discs; then select one to load into the drive. Using USB hubs, up to 127 units can be connected to a single computer, and you can combine this version with previous versions of the Media Carousel. Includes AC adapter, USB cable, and library management and access software. Requires Microsoft Windows 2000+. Disc burning and DVD playback software included in bundle only.\r\nExecutable program discs\r\nData archive discs\r\nInstallation CDs\r\nAudio CDs\r\nMP3 and multimedia discs\r\nBlank CD-Rs & DVD-Rs\r\nGame CDs\r\nPhoto archive discs','','','','thumb_3719_p33618a.jpg','detail_3719_p33618a.jpg','large_3719_p33618a.jpg','0.00','0','0','0','0','0','1','y','n','y','n','y','y','n'),
 ('3720','134 1458','415','Ziotek Media Carousel PowerDrive ZT1341458, Refurbished','279.00','289.00','0.00','The USB Media Carousel PowerDrive can hold up to 100 CDs or DVDs... and also read from or write to any of them! ','10.06','y','y','y','y','0','396','1','The USB Media Carousel PowerDrive can hold up to 100 CDs or DVDs... and also read from or write to any of them! Hook it up to your PC to access multimedia CDs, installation discs, backup DVDs, audio CDs and more. The built-in reader/writer allows direct access to any stored disc... and there\'s no need to touch a disc to load it! Use the included software to search through your discs; then select one to load into the drive. Using USB hubs, up to 127 units can be connected to a single computer, and you can combine this version with previous versions of the Media Carousel. Includes AC adapter, USB cable, and library management and access software. Requires Microsoft Windows 2000+. Disc burning and DVD playback software included in bundle only.\r\nExecutable program discs\r\nData archive discs\r\nInstallation CDs\r\nAudio CDs\r\nMP3 and multimedia discs\r\nBlank CD-Rs & DVD-Rs\r\nGame CDs\r\nPhoto archive discs','','','','thumb_3720_p39179a.jpg','detail_3720_p39179a.jpg','large_3720_p39179a.jpg','0.00','0','0','0','0','0','1','y','n','y','n','y','y','n');
