insert into `z_products` values('1','417','101 0514','3-ring Binder Vinyl CD Page (10 Pack)','Media>Media Storage Solutions','y','0','1','0','','cd binder,disk storage,disk holders,pages,storage,folder,cd binder,dvd binder','Our binder disc pages are perfect for efficiently storing CDs or DVDs. Use your existing 3-ring binders to make your own media library. Each sheet features 2 pockets. 10 sheets per pack.','Our binder disc pages are perfect for efficiently storing CDs or DVDs. Use your existing 3-ring binders to make your own media library. Each sheet features 2 pockets. 10 sheets per pack.','P1798.jpg','P1798a.jpg','P1798a.jpg','0.00','4.05','0.00','0.00','0','0','0.4','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('2','374','101 0529','Thermaltake Ibox 5.25in Drive Bay Storage Box, Blk','Computer Components>Cases &amp; Components>Case Accessories','y','0','3','0','','black,ibox,5.25,drive,bay,storage,box,black','Convert an unused 5.25 expansion bay on your PC into a useful storage drawer. Keep your CD-ROMs, business cards, flash media, office supplies or other goodies tucked away neatly. Includes mounting sc','Convert an unused 5.25 expansion bay on your PC into a useful storage drawer. Keep your CD-ROMs, business cards, flash media, office supplies or other goodies tucked away neatly. Includes mounting screws.','P25438.jpg','P25438a.jpg','P25438a.jpg','0.00','8.33','0.00','0.00','0','0','0.75','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('3','417','101 0760','One Touch CD Box, Holds 80 CDs, Dk Silver','Media>Media Storage Solutions','y','0','4','0','','DVD,dvd storage,movie storage,disk holder,cd holder,dvd holder,disc holder','The One Touch Storage Box features a space-saving design and huge disk storage capacity. At touch of a button, the loaded drawer smoothly glides out for easy access so you can efficiently organize and','The One Touch Storage Box features a space-saving design and huge disk storage capacity. At touch of a button, the loaded drawer smoothly glides out for easy access so you can efficiently organize and store your CDs/DVDs. Includes easy-to read labels and clear hanging pockets for as many as 80 disks and the boxes are designed to stack securely together, ensuring this storage solution grows with your disk collection!','P5936.jpg','P5936a.jpg','P5936a.jpg','0.00','14.50','0.00','0.00','0','0','4.7','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('4','417','101 0761','One Touch CD Box, Holds 80 CDs, Black','Media>Media Storage Solutions','y','0','4','0','','cd holder, cd box, cd storage','The One Touch Storage Box features a space-saving design and huge disc storage capacity. At touch of a button, the loaded drawer smoothly glides out for easy access so you can efficiently organize and','The One Touch Storage Box features a space-saving design and huge disc storage capacity. At touch of a button, the loaded drawer smoothly glides out for easy access so you can efficiently organize and store your CDs/DVDs. Includes easy-to read labels and clear hanging pockets for as many as 80 discs and the boxes are designed to stack securely together, ensuring this storage solution grows with your disc collection!','P12108.jpg','P12108a.jpg','P12108a.jpg','0.00','14.23','0.00','0.00','0','0','4.7','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('5','417','101 0765','Hipce Filing Box, Holds 100 Discs, Faux Leather','Media>Media Storage Solutions','y','0','4','0','','HIPCE, faux leather,disc filling,disk storage,cd storage,dvd storage','These indexed disc files manage your growing disc media collection with a touch of style. With a durable faux leather covering, the padded box features a sliding drawer that holds 50 double-sided hang','These indexed disc files manage your growing disc media collection with a touch of style. With a durable faux leather covering, the padded box features a sliding drawer that holds 50 double-sided hanging disc files. Fill out the drawer&#39;s index card to help you efficiently locate your discs. Discs not included.','P15824.jpg','P15824a.jpg','P15824a.jpg','0.00','18.12','0.00','0.00','0','0','5.8','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('6','417','101 0766','Hipce Filing Box, Holds 200 Discs, Faux Leather','Media>Media Storage Solutions','y','0','4','0','','HIPCE, faux leather,disc filling,disk storage,cd storage,dvd storage','Have more discs than you can keep track of? Use the HIPCE indexed filing boxes to stylishly manage your collection. Padded with an elegant faux leather covering, the box features two sliding drawers t','Have more discs than you can keep track of? Use the HIPCE indexed filing boxes to stylishly manage your collection. Padded with an elegant faux leather covering, the box features two sliding drawers that hold 50 double-sided hanging disc files each. Fill out the drawer&#39;s index card to enable easy disc searching. Discs not included.','P15825.jpg','P15825a.jpg','P15825a.jpg','0.00','34.02','0.00','0.00','0','0','10.6','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('7','399','103 0111','Heat And Cold Therapy Wrist Rest','Ergonomic Products>Ergonomic Wrist Support','y','0','5','0','','hot,cold,pack,heat,and cold,therapy,wrist,rest','Give your wrists some soothing heat/cold therapy while you work. This unique keyboard wrist rest has a hot/cold pack built right in. Simply place the pack in the microwave or freezer to set its temper','Give your wrists some soothing heat/cold therapy while you work. This unique keyboard wrist rest has a hot/cold pack built right in. Simply place the pack in the microwave or freezer to set its temperature. The heat from a warm pack will increase the blood circulation to your hands or or use the pack cold to relieve aggravated joints.','P19873.jpg','P19873a.jpg','P19873a.jpg','0.00','13.45','0.00','0.00','0','0','1','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('8','399','103 0112','Armamazing Memory Foam Armrest Pads, 2 Pk, Black','Ergonomic Products>Ergonomic Wrist Support','y','0','27','0','',' ','Give your forearms and elbows total comfort and support with the ARMazing memory-foam arm pads. The pads install easily on many kinds of chairs with arm rests between 6 to 11 inches in length. When yo','Give your forearms and elbows total comfort and support with the ARMazing memory-foam arm pads. The pads install easily on many kinds of chairs with arm rests between 6 to 11 inches in length. When you rest your arm on them they help reduce pressure points and increase circulation. In the home or at the office, these pads can help maximize the comfort of your desk chair.','P29218.jpg','P29218a.jpg','P29218a.jpg','0.00','28.28','0.00','0.00','0','0','1.2','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('9','399','103 0178','Ergobeads Smartglove Wrist Cushion Small','Ergonomic Products>Ergonomic Wrist Support','y','0','7','0','','ergo,beads,smartglove,wrist,support','The SmartGlove is designed to help relieve hand fatigue and repetitive stress injuries while you&#39;re keyboarding and mousing. Smooth ergoBeads fill its under-palm wrist cushion, providing ergonomic sup','The SmartGlove is designed to help relieve hand fatigue and repetitive stress injuries while you&#39;re keyboarding and mousing. Smooth ergoBeads fill its under-palm wrist cushion, providing ergonomic support and a gentle massage for better circulation. A firm removable stiffener in the upper pocket encourages you to keep your wrist in a neutral position. Turn the glove inside out to reverse it for left-handed use.','P20322.jpg','P20322a.jpg','P20322a.jpg','0.00','13.33','0.00','0.00','0','0','0.15','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('10','399','103 0179','Ergobeads Smartglove Wrist Cushion Medium','Ergonomic Products>Ergonomic Wrist Support','y','0','7','0','','ergo,beads,smart,glove,wrist,support','The SmartGlove can help relieve hand fatigue and repetitive stress injuries while keyboarding and mousing. Smooth massaging ergoBeads fill the under-palm cushion to act as an ergonomic wrist cushion a','The SmartGlove can help relieve hand fatigue and repetitive stress injuries while keyboarding and mousing. Smooth massaging ergoBeads fill the under-palm cushion to act as an ergonomic wrist cushion and help increase blood circulation. A firm removable splint in the upper pocket encourages you to keep your wrist in a neutral position. Reverse the glove for left handed use. Available in multiple sizes.','P20323.jpg','P20323a.jpg','P20323a.jpg','0.00','13.33','0.00','0.00','0','0','0.15','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('11','399','103 0180','Ergobeads Smartglove Wrist Cushion Large','Ergonomic Products>Ergonomic Wrist Support','y','0','7','0','','ergo,beads,smart,glove,wrist,support','The SmartGlove can help relieve hand fatigue and repetitive stress injuries while keyboarding and mousing. Smooth massaging ergoBeads fill the under-palm cushion to act as an ergonomic wrist cushion a','The SmartGlove can help relieve hand fatigue and repetitive stress injuries while keyboarding and mousing. Smooth massaging ergoBeads fill the under-palm cushion to act as an ergonomic wrist cushion and help increase blood circulation. A firm removable splint in the upper pocket encourages you to keep your wrist in a neutral position. Reverse the glove for left handed use. Available in multiple sizes.','P20324.jpg','P20324a.jpg','P20324a.jpg','0.00','13.33','0.00','0.00','0','0','0.15','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('12','399','103 0181','Ergobeads Wrist Cushion Computer Glove, 1 Size','Ergonomic Products>Ergonomic Wrist Support','y','0','7','0','','ergo,beads,smart,glove,wrist,support','Smooth beads in the ergoBeads computer glove conform to your wrist and palm, cushioning the nerves and tendons in your hand and wrist as you use your keyboard or mouse. The glove helps you maintain a','Smooth beads in the ergoBeads computer glove conform to your wrist and palm, cushioning the nerves and tendons in your hand and wrist as you use your keyboard or mouse. The glove helps you maintain a neutral wrist position and may help prevent the development of inflamed cysts or other repetitive stress injuries. Glove fits left or right hand.','P20338.jpg','P20338a.jpg','P20338a.jpg','0.00','10.22','0.00','0.00','0','0','0.1','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('13','399','103 0260','Ergobeads Keyboard Wrist Cushion, Gray','Ergonomic Products>Ergonomic Wrist Support','y','0','7','0','','black,ergobeads,keyboard,wrist,rest,support,black','The smooth plastic beads filling this cotton wrist cushion will gently support and massage your hands and wrists while you use your keyboard. Designed by an orthopedic surgeon for ergonomic comfort, t','The smooth plastic beads filling this cotton wrist cushion will gently support and massage your hands and wrists while you use your keyboard. Designed by an orthopedic surgeon for ergonomic comfort, the squeezable ergoBeads wrist cushion is easily reshaped to conform to any keyboard. Hand washable.','P5387.jpg','P5387a.jpg','P5387a.jpg','0.00','11.50','0.00','0.00','0','0','1.45','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('14','399','103 0261','Ergobeads Keyboard Wrist Cushion, Black','Ergonomic Products>Ergonomic Wrist Support','y','0','7','0','',' ','The smooth plastic beads filling this cotton wrist cushion will gently support and massage your hands and wrists while you use your keyboard. Designed by an orthopedic surgeon for ergonomic comfort, t','The smooth plastic beads filling this cotton wrist cushion will gently support and massage your hands and wrists while you use your keyboard. Designed by an orthopedic surgeon for ergonomic comfort, the squeezable ergoBeads wrist cushion is easily reshaped to conform to any keyboard. Hand washable.','P32478.jpg','P32478a.jpg','P32478a.jpg','0.00','11.24','0.00','0.00','0','0','1.05','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('15','325','104 0104','Iogear Serial To Bluetooth Adapter, Class 1','Networking>Wireless Networking (WiFi)>Bluetooth Adapters','y','0','8','0','','bluetooth receiver,receiver,serial adapter,wireless serial adapter','Connect to a serial device wirelessly by attaching this Bluetooth receiver to the device&#39;s RS-232 port. With the receiver in place, you&#39;ll be able to connect serial peripherals--like barcode scanners-','Connect to a serial device wirelessly by attaching this Bluetooth receiver to the device&#39;s RS-232 port. With the receiver in place, you&#39;ll be able to connect serial peripherals--like barcode scanners--to your Bluetooth-enabled computer, or access router settings remotely. Use 2 together as virtual null modems connecting two computers. Includes DE9 null modem adapter and AC adapter. Requires Bluetooth 1.1 device with Serial Port Profile (SPP) and RS-232 serial device with DB9 (DE9) port. Note: May not work with RS-232 modems, mice, keyboards, cell phones and devices using proprietary communication protocols.','P14526.jpg','P14526a.jpg','P14526a.jpg','0.00','62.95','0.00','0.00','0','0','0.85','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('16','431','104 0105','Iogear 2-port Dual View USB KVMp Switch','Networking>KVM Switches','y','0','8','0','','Dual-View,kvmp,kvmp switch,monitor switch,monitor switcher','Use two monitors with your CPUs with IOGEAR&#39;s advanced Dual-View KVMP switch. Independent peripheral switching allows you to switch CPU focus without interrupting USB or audio operations. Equally comp','Use two monitors with your CPUs with IOGEAR&#39;s advanced Dual-View KVMP switch. Independent peripheral switching allows you to switch CPU focus without interrupting USB or audio operations. Equally compatible with Sun workstations and Macintosh computers, the Dual-View switch is easy to install and operate. Includes 2 KVM cables, 2 video/audio cables, firmware upgrade cable and AC adapter. Requires analog monitor with DE15 (HD15) connector, and PCs or Macs with Microsoft Windows 98SE/Me/2000/XP/Vista, Sun Solaris, Linux or Mac OS 8.6+.','P14539.jpg','P14539a.jpg','P14539a.jpg','0.00','165.00','0.00','0.00','0','0','4.65','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('17','431','104 0106','Iogear 4-port Dual View USB KVMp Switch','Networking>KVM Switches','y','0','8','0','','Dual-View,kvmp,kvmp switch,monitor switch,monitor switcher','Use two monitors with your CPUs with IOGEAR&#39;s advanced Dual-View KVMP switch. Independent peripheral switching allows you to switch CPU focus without interrupting USB or audio operations. Equally comp','Use two monitors with your CPUs with IOGEAR&#39;s advanced Dual-View KVMP switch. Independent peripheral switching allows you to switch CPU focus without interrupting USB or audio operations. Equally compatible with Sun workstations and Macintosh computers, the Dual-View switch is easy to install and operate. Includes 4 KVM cables, 4 video/audio cables, firmware upgrade cable and AC adapter. Requires analog monitor with DE15 (HD15) connector, and PCs or Macs with Microsoft Windows 98SE/Me/2000/XP/Vista, Sun Solaris, Linux or Mac OS 8.6+.','P14538.jpg','P14538a.jpg','P14538a.jpg','0.00','234.00','0.00','0.00','0','0','6.9','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('18','431','104 0107','Iogear 2-port Multifunction USB 2.0 KVM Switch','Networking>KVM Switches','y','0','8','0','','kvm,kvm switch,usb kvm switcher,hot key kvm','When you have 2 CPUs but only one network connection, this KVM is the solution. With its 3-port 10/100Mbps Ethernet switch, it provides continuous net connections for both CPUs, in addition to a 2-por','When you have 2 CPUs but only one network connection, this KVM is the solution. With its 3-port 10/100Mbps Ethernet switch, it provides continuous net connections for both CPUs, in addition to a 2-port USB hub and audio jacks for both mic and speaker. Includes two 6&#39;USB/VGA cables, firmware upgrade cable and AC adapter. Requires analog monitor with DE15 (HD15) connector, and PCs or Macs with Microsoft Windows 98SE/Me/2000/XP/Vista, Sun Solaris, Linux or Mac OS 8.6+.','P14535.jpg','P14535a.jpg','P14535a.jpg','0.00','172.59','0.00','0.00','0','0','4.3','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('19','431','104 0108','Iogear 4-port USB KVM Switch W/ Built In Cables','Networking>KVM Switches','y','0','8','0','','kvm,kvm switch,usb kvm switcher,hot key kvm','Control 4 USB computers from a single USB keyboard, mouse and monitor... and add audio support for speakers, too. IOGEAR&#39;s hot key-switched USB KVM switch has 2 cable sets built-in and includes additi','Control 4 USB computers from a single USB keyboard, mouse and monitor... and add audio support for speakers, too. IOGEAR&#39;s hot key-switched USB KVM switch has 2 cable sets built-in and includes additional sets for expansion up to 4 units. Requires analog monitor with DE15 (HD15) connector, and PCs or Macs with Microsoft Windows 98SE/Me/2000/XP/Vista, Sun Solaris, USB Linux or Mac OS 8.6+.','P14528.jpg','P14528a.jpg','P14528a.jpg','0.00','96.14','0.00','0.00','0','0','3.4','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('20','385','104 0109','External Sata Hub, 1 Esata To 5 Sata','Computer Components>I/O &amp; Video Cards>Hard Drive Controllers/Raid Cards','y','0','319','0','','external,sata,hub,sada,hdd,hub','Access multiple SATA drives through one SATA port using the 5-to-1 SATA hub. With full support for SATA 3.0Gbps data transfers, it provides instant auto-negotiation for rapid data transfers to and fro','Access multiple SATA drives through one SATA port using the 5-to-1 SATA hub. With full support for SATA 3.0Gbps data transfers, it provides instant auto-negotiation for rapid data transfers to and from all connected drives. It uses 2 USB ports for power without the need for an AC adapter. Includes power cable. Requires port multiplyer-supporting SATA controller, SATA (L-shaped connectors) cables for each drive and an eSATA (I-shaped connector) cable to connect to your PC. Drives not included.','P17618.jpg','P17618a.jpg','P17618a.jpg','0.00','115.84','0.00','0.00','0','0','0.6','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('21','431','104 0110','Connectgear 2 Port USB KVM Switch','Networking>KVM Switches','y','0','9','0','','usb,2port,2-port,kvm,switch,usb,analog,switch','Connect 2 USB-equipped computers to a single set of peripherals using ConnectGear&#39;s USB KVM switch. Use the additional USB port to connect a hub, printer, card reader or other device to the selected c','Connect 2 USB-equipped computers to a single set of peripherals using ConnectGear&#39;s USB KVM switch. Use the additional USB port to connect a hub, printer, card reader or other device to the selected computer. Includes 2 sets of USB/VGA combo connection cables. Requires USB mouse&amp;keyboard for console.','P24218.jpg','P24218a.jpg','P24218a.jpg','0.00','33.79','0.00','0.00','0','0','1.35','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('22','431','104 0111','Connectgear 4 Port USB KVM Switch','Networking>KVM Switches','y','0','9','0','','audio,usb,4port,4-port,kvm,switch,usb,analog,switch','Connect 4 USB-equipped computers to a single set of peripherals using ConnectGear&#39;s USB KVM switch. Use the additional USB port to connect a hub, printer, card reader or other device to the selected c','Connect 4 USB-equipped computers to a single set of peripherals using ConnectGear&#39;s USB KVM switch. Use the additional USB port to connect a hub, printer, card reader or other device to the selected computer. Includes AC adapter and 4 sets of USB/VGA combo connection cables. Requires USB mouse&amp;keyboard for console.','P24219.jpg','P24219a.jpg','P24219a.jpg','0.00','52.82','0.00','0.00','0','0','2.85','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('23','431','104 0112','Iogear 2-port USB KVM Switch','Networking>KVM Switches','y','0','8','0','',' ','Share a VGA monitor, USB mouse and USB keyboard between two computers with IOGEAR&#39;s straightforward 2-port KVM switch. It supports multiple operating systems including Microsoft Windows, Sun/Solaris,','Share a VGA monitor, USB mouse and USB keyboard between two computers with IOGEAR&#39;s straightforward 2-port KVM switch. It supports multiple operating systems including Microsoft Windows, Sun/Solaris, and Mac OS. A single press on the pushbutton located on the top of the KVM unit is all it takes to switch between computers. With cables built right into the unit, no additional hardware or cabling is required. The USB KVM switch is entirely Plug&#39;n&#39;Play and requires no software or AC adapter to run. Requires VGA (analog) monitor and USB keyboard and mouse.','P25639.jpg','P25639a.jpg','P25639a.jpg','0.00','18.69','0.00','0.00','0','0','1.1','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('24','431','104 0113','Iogear 2 Port USB Laptop KVM Wtih File Transfer','Networking>KVM Switches','y','0','8','0','',' ','The USB Laptop KVM with File Transfer allows the user to seamlessly control a second computer using your laptop as the console. It is ideal for people who own a laptop and a desktop PC because it com','The USB Laptop KVM with File Transfer allows the user to seamlessly control a second computer using your laptop as the console. It is ideal for people who own a laptop and a desktop PC because it combines easy switching and convenient file transfers between the two computers. The KVM features an on-screen toolbar with multiple functions such as file transfer, desktop image scaling and others. The laptop KVM is a complete, easy to install, Plug&amp;Play solution with no additional cables needed. Desktop Scaling auto resizes the desktop image onto your laptop screen with the click of a button. A built-in file transfer utility lets the user transfer files, presentations, business information and create backup copies between both computers or from external USB storage devices. Includes a USB port to connect a USB peripheral device, such as an external hard drive to the laptop. Requires Windows 2000+','P29059.jpg','P29059a.jpg','P29059a.jpg','0.00','38.72','0.00','0.00','0','0','0.45','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
