 ('29','441','104 0183','Altusen Guardian Over The Net, Gn0116','Networking>Rack Mount Products>Rack Mount Power Distribution (PDU)','y','0','12','0','','guardian,net gaurdian','Take control of your server room environment with the Guardian over the Net. In addition to providing remote over-the-Web control over 8 AC outlets, it is programmable to respond to critical temperatu','Take control of your server room environment with the Guardian over the Net. In addition to providing remote over-the-Web control over 8 AC outlets, it is programmable to respond to critical temperature readings or other environmental conditions. The Guardian over the Net can respond to humidity or over-voltage problems and activate alarms fans through third-party accessories. Includes AC adapter, RS-232 to RJ-45 cable, RJ-45 cable, 2 temperature sensor sets and rack mounting kit. Individual control of each port - users can set the environment settings (Temperature, humidity, voltage and current) to allow equipment to be monitored for irregularity. Provides two configuration/management methods: Browser; or ssConsole*. * ssConsole (Serial Server Console) is an application program provided with the GN0116 (for Windows environment only).','P13173.jpg','P13173a.jpg','P13173a.jpg','0.00','1339.00','0.00','0.00','0','0','9.2','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
