 ('38','431','104 0411','Altusen KVM Over Wireless, Kw1000','Networking>KVM Switches','y','0','12','0','','kvm,altusen,kvm over net,wireless kvm,kvm over wireless','Control a single PC--or an entire KVM array--using 802.11b wireless networking. The KVM over Wireless allows a remote computer to exchange keyboard, mouse and video signals with the attached server or','Control a single PC--or an entire KVM array--using 802.11b wireless networking. The KVM over Wireless allows a remote computer to exchange keyboard, mouse and video signals with the attached server or KVM switch as if it physically connected to the equipment. Now you can move around the facility with a laptop and still access all of the attached CPUs wirelessly. Includes all-in-one cable set, mounting plate, antenna and AC adapter.  Requires Pentium III 1GHz processor or higher with a resolution of 1024x768 and either Microsoft DirectX 7.0 or Sun Java 2 JRE 1.4 or higher. Wireless remote access of KVM switches or servers (IEEE 802.11b WLAN) Advanced security features: password protection; advanced encryption technologies High video resolution: up to 1600 x 1200 DDC2B Windows GUI and Java based Client software; Java client works with all operating systems Firmware upgradeable via WLAN Ethernet connection Multiple user accounts','P13172.jpg','P13172a.jpg','P13172a.jpg','0.00','827.00','0.00','0.00','0','0','4.25','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
