ware flow control. Real COM port support;Raw TCP Mode support. Alarms and Alerts Client applications;Buzzer;SNMP Traps. OS Support Windows,Mac,Sun,Linux,Unix,AIX,DOS 6.2+. Code Set Support ISO646-US(US ASCII),ISO8859-15(Latin-9). General Rack mountable in 1U system rack.','P13175.jpg','P13175a.jpg','P13175a.jpg','0.00','589.00','0.00','0.00','0','0','10.7','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
