 ('498','307','115 3116','Netfinder Pro, W/ 18 Remotes','Tools &amp; Testers>Network Testers','y','0','52','0','','network,net finder,network tester,tester','The NETfinder Pro is a convenient cable tester, port finder and low emission frequency tone generator. In addition to locating and verifying standard voice/data cables, the NETfinder also includes a','The NETfinder Pro is a convenient cable tester, port finder and low emission frequency tone generator. In addition to locating and verifying standard voice/data cables, the NETfinder also includes a cable organizer function to identify hub/switch ports at the closet level to match cables in up to 18 different locations (18 remotes included). Includes accessories for testing Video (F connector) and telephone cables included. Requires one 9V battery, not included.','P6263.jpg','P6263a.jpg','P6263a.jpg','0.00','123.53','0.00','0.00','0','0','2','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
