 ('502','307','115 3127','Power Panel Cat5/6 Dvm And Network/poe Tester','Tools &amp; Testers>Network Testers','y','0','120','0','','PoE tester,cable tester,network tester','Ethernet cables aren&#39;t just for data anymore... Power-over-Ethernet (PoE) sends up to 48 volts of power through CAT5/6 patch cables. Test cables for PoE voltage with the Power Panel before you connect','Ethernet cables aren&#39;t just for data anymore... Power-over-Ethernet (PoE) sends up to 48 volts of power through CAT5/6 patch cables. Test cables for PoE voltage with the Power Panel before you connect network devices. The tester reports any discovery voltage and can test a PoE injector for full power. In addition, the Power Panel gives you information about what type of devices are connected, speed of data connections, and Ethernet pair wiring. Includes 9V battery.','P18338.jpg','P18338a.jpg','P18338a.jpg','0.00','136.00','0.00','0.00','0','0','0.55','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('503','307','115 3128','Inline Power Panel Cat5/6 Dvm And Network/poe Tester','Tools &amp; Testers>Network Testers','y','0','120','0','','PoE tester,cable tester,network tester','Ethernet cables aren&#39;t just for data anymore... Power-over-Ethernet (PoE) sends up to 48 volts of power through CAT5/6 patch cables. Test cables for PoE voltage with the Power Panel before you connect','Ethernet cables aren&#39;t just for data anymore... Power-over-Ethernet (PoE) sends up to 48 volts of power through CAT5/6 patch cables. Test cables for PoE voltage with the Power Panel before you connect network devices. The tester reports any discovery voltage and can test a PoE injector for full power. In addition, the Power Panel gives you information about what type of devices are connected, speed of data connections, and Ethernet pair wiring. The inline version of the Power Panel can do all of the above, plus gather additional information that is only possible to discover when it is connected in-between 2 network devices. Instead of just seeing individual device speeds, it shows see what the 2 devices the negotiated data rate. If PoE is involved, the inline Power Panel passes through the power to the PoE device so it is on while being monitored. It also can display the power consumed by the PoE device (in watts).','P18358.jpg','P18358a.jpg','P18358a.jpg','0.00','169.00','0.00','0.00','0','0','0.6','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('504','295','115 3131','Pro-tone Wire Locator Kit W/ Flashlight Tip And Spkr','Tools &amp; Testers>Cable Tracing/Tone Generators','y','0','120','0','',' ','The ProTone wire locator includes a tone generator that can connect to network, phone and other cables, and a tracer that detects and identifies both the generated signals and 60Hz AC waveforms as wel','The ProTone wire locator includes a tone generator that can connect to network, phone and other cables, and a tracer that detects and identifies both the generated signals and 60Hz AC waveforms as well. Use them together to identify specific wires in bundles or cable runs, or to determine whether a power line is hot or not without contacting it. Thanks to attached alligator clips, the tone generator can be used for all wire types, but it has plugs for specifically testing telephone and network lines too. Includes case and 9V battery.','P28998.jpg','P28998a.jpg','P28998a.jpg','0.00','77.95','0.00','0.00','0','0','0.8','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('505','307','115 3132','Power Panel Tone Star, Toner/probe Kit','Tools &amp; Testers>Network Testers','y','0','120','0','',' ','Ethernet cables aren&#39;t just for data anymore... Power-over-Ethernet (PoE) sends up to 48 volts of power through CAT5/6 patch cables. Test cables for PoE voltage with the Power Panel and the Tone Star','Ethernet cables aren&#39;t just for data anymore... Power-over-Ethernet (PoE) sends up to 48 volts of power through CAT5/6 patch cables. Test cables for PoE voltage with the Power Panel and the Tone Star before you connect network devices. The Power Panel tester reports any discovery voltage and can test a PoE injector for full power. It also gives you information about what type of devices are connected, speed of data connections, and Ethernet pair wiring. This inline version of the Power Panel also gathers additional information when it is connected in between 2 network devices. Instead of just seeing individual device speeds, it shows see what the negotiated data rate. If PoE is involved, the inline Power Panel passes through the power to the PoE device so it is on while being monitored. It also can display the power consumed by the PoE device (in watts). This kit also includes the Tone Star tracer that detects both generated tones and 60Hz AC waveforms. It includes a bright white LED for poking around in dark places and a variable-volume speaker. Kit includes nylon case, RJ-45 to coax adapter, and RJ-12/aligator clip adapter and 2 9V batteries. Please note, tone detection requires tone generator, sold separately.','P28999.jpg','P28999a.jpg','P28999a.jpg','0.00','169.00','0.00','0.00','0','0','1','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
