 ('532','307','115 3630','Lanroamer Pro Tester W/ 1 Remote, Tp600','Tools &amp; Testers>Network Testers','y','0','480','0','','analyzer,tester,test-um,testum,tone,generator,test,lanrover,tp600','The LanRoamerPRO Tester/Analyzer is a high performance length measurement CAT 5 tester that identifies multiple faults clearly without interpretation, has one-ended testing with pre-test for fast resu','The LanRoamerPRO Tester/Analyzer is a high performance length measurement CAT 5 tester that identifies multiple faults clearly without interpretation, has one-ended testing with pre-test for fast results and clear wiremapping displayed on 2-line, 16 character LCD. The LanRoamerPRO includes features such as auto-on /auto-off, a tone generator mode for use with tone tracers and a low battery indicator. It tests for shorts, opens, miswires, reversals and split pairs. Requires 1 9V battery, not included.','P3813.jpg','P3813a.jpg','P3813a.jpg','0.00','172.00','0.00','0.00','0','0','0.32','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('533','307','115 3663','Test-um Validator Network/cabling Tester','Tools &amp; Testers>Network Testers','y','0','480','0','','tester,adapter tester kit','Certify your network installations with your own Validator Network/Cabling Certifier, from Test-Um, Validator can maximize your voice/data/video installationís efficiency by identifying cable inadequa','Certify your network installations with your own Validator Network/Cabling Certifier, from Test-Um, Validator can maximize your voice/data/video installationís efficiency by identifying cable inadequacies such as installation problems, kinks, loops, terminations, dry shorts or miswires. Using the included Plan-Um software, you can layout your networkís requirements in a matter of minutes, then define cable types and runs. Once the cables are in place, test each run, and print the results in an easy-to-read report.','P8901.jpg','P8901a.jpg','P8901a.jpg','0.00','1265.00','0.00','0.00','0','0','8.1','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('534','307','115 3664','Test-um Validator-nt, Active Network Tester','Tools &amp; Testers>Network Testers','y','0','480','0','','tester,adapter tester kit','Certify your network installations with your own Validator Network/Cabling Certifier, from Test-Um, Validator can maximize your voice/data/video installations efficiency by identifying cable inadequac','Certify your network installations with your own Validator Network/Cabling Certifier, from Test-Um, Validator can maximize your voice/data/video installations efficiency by identifying cable inadequacies such as installation problems, kinks, loops, terminations, dry shorts or miswires. Using the included Plan-Um software, you can layout your networks requirements in a matter of minutes, then define cable types and runs. Once the cables are in place, test each run, and print the results in an easy-to-read report. The new Validator-NT has all the testing and certifying capabilities of the Validator, but also includes new active network tests for diagnosing problems on live networks. Use it to identify network devices such as hubs, switches, NICs and routers on your network and verify connectivity (manual IP or via DHCP) to the Internet by pinging up to seven different IP addresses simultaneously. In addition, the kit includes a set of 8 wiremap remotes. Requires PC running Windows 2000/XP with 512MB RAM.','P11912.jpg','P11912a.jpg','P11912a.jpg','0.00','1622.00','0.00','0.00','0','0','8','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
