 ('1180','63','131 0835','PS2 Keyboard To USB Adapter','Cables &amp; Adapters>Adapters &amp; Couplers>PS/2 Adapters','y','0','1','0','','adapter,converter,usb to ps2,ps2,usb,cable converter,cable adapter,adaptor','Dust off your favorite old-school keyboard and connect to your new system with the USB to PS/2 Adapter. This adapter allows you to connect any PS/2 keyboard to any USB port.','Dust off your favorite old-school keyboard and connect to your new system with the USB to PS/2 Adapter. This adapter allows you to connect any PS/2 keyboard to any USB port.','P4850.jpg','P4850a.jpg','P4850a.jpg','0.00','5.38','0.00','0.00','0','0','0.12','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('1181','343','131 0837','Tritton USB 2.0 SVGA Adapter','Cables &amp; Adapters>Adapters &amp; Couplers>USB Adapters','y','0','20','0','','adaptor,usb vga,usb video,usb monitor','Frustrated by the limited size of your Windows desktop workspace? Now you can add another monitor to your PC or notebook with this simple-to-install SVGA adapter. The adapter simply plugs into a USB 2','Frustrated by the limited size of your Windows desktop workspace? Now you can add another monitor to your PC or notebook with this simple-to-install SVGA adapter. The adapter simply plugs into a USB 2.0 port, and it works with both CRT and LCD monitors as well as projectors. You can view large spreadsheets, multitask more effectively, or do multiple screen displays and presentations. The possibilities are endless! Includes software on CD-ROM. Requires Microsoft Windows 2000/XP/Vista. Actual resolution dependent on operating system and monitor type.','P7462.jpg','P7462a.jpg','P7462a.jpg','0.00','68.54','0.00','0.00','0','0','0.52','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('1182','324','131 0838','Tritton See2 Xtreme, External USB 2.0 Dvi Adapter','Digital/Multimedia Products>Digital A/V Solutions>Video Converters','y','0','20','0','','see2,xtreme,usb,video,dvi,adapter,splitter','Want to add another monitor to your computer but the video card is maxed out? Plug the SEE2 Xtreme video adapter into a USB 2.0 port to attach an additional DVI or VGA monitor. It&#39;s an external video','Want to add another monitor to your computer but the video card is maxed out? Plug the SEE2 Xtreme video adapter into a USB 2.0 port to attach an additional DVI or VGA monitor. It&#39;s an external video card, capable of driving resolutions up to 2048x1280 and supporting widescreen resolutions. Use it to extend your desktop area or to mirror your primary display for demonstrations. Up to six SEE2 Xtreme adapters can be used on one computer, provided you have a USB 2.0 port for each. Includes DVI-to-VGA adapter, USB cable and software on CD-ROM. Requires Microsoft Windows 2000/32-bit XP/32-bit Vista. Please note, 64-bit versions of Windows are not supported.','P24818.jpg','P24818a.jpg','P24818a.jpg','0.00','88.07','0.00','0.00','0','0','0.7','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('1183','343','131 0840','USB Mouse To PS2 Port Adapter','Cables &amp; Adapters>Adapters &amp; Couplers>USB Adapters','y','0','18','0','','adapter,converter,usb to ps2,ps2,usb,cable converter,cable adapter,adaptor','Connect a USB keyboard or mouse to the PS/2 ports on your computer with these simple, compact adapters. Color-coded for easy installation. Please note that this adapter only works with USB keyboards a','Connect a USB keyboard or mouse to the PS/2 ports on your computer with these simple, compact adapters. Color-coded for easy installation. Please note that this adapter only works with USB keyboards and mice that are wired for use in a PS/2 keyboard port. If your USB keyboard or mouse did not include a cable converter, this adapter will probably not work with it.','P4201.jpg','P4201a.jpg','P4201a.jpg','0.00','1.26','0.00','0.00','0','0','0.06','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
