 ('1252','289','132 0418','Keykatcher Magnum 4mb W/ Date And Time Stamping','Security Products>Computer Security','y','0','160','0','','keykatcher,keycatcher,key catcher,key katcher','Monitor computer activity without software! Protect your children from the ever-present dangers on the Internet and monitor unauthorized use of your computer with the KEYKatcher. KEYKatcher is a small','Monitor computer activity without software! Protect your children from the ever-present dangers on the Internet and monitor unauthorized use of your computer with the KEYKatcher. KEYKatcher is a small hardware device that installs between your keyboard cable and motherboard and records every keystroke made on the keyboard. Keystrokes are recorded to memory in the KEYKatcher as a text file which can be viewed with most any wordprocessor. This 4MB version records approximately 2,500 typed pages of text. 4MB Magnum version requires CR1025 coin cell battery (included) to maintain time and date stamp data. Does not work with USB keyboards.','P14041.jpg','P14041a.jpg','P14041a.jpg','0.00','99.00','0.00','0.00','0','0','0.15','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
