 ('1343','202','138 0185','Mini Keyboard And Mouse For Kids, Green, USB + PS2','Input Devices>Keyboards &amp; Keypads>USB Keyboard','y','0','30','0','','mice,keyboard,kids,mini keyboard','Your kids will love our mini-keyboard and mini-mouse ensemble in cool pastel colors. The keyboard is one-third smaller than a standard PC keyboard and has ergonomically arranged keys that form a subtl','Your kids will love our mini-keyboard and mini-mouse ensemble in cool pastel colors. The keyboard is one-third smaller than a standard PC keyboard and has ergonomically arranged keys that form a subtle A-shape for greater comfort and typing ease. An optical mini-mouse accompanies the kid friendly keyboard and fits comfortably in the palm of a child&#39;s hand. This mini keyboard and mouse combo includes Typing Fun game software to help children learn to type. Requires Microsoft Windows 95+.','P4935.jpg','P4935a.jpg','P4935a.jpg','0.00','21.04','0.00','0.00','0','0','2','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('1344','203','138 0198','USB Compact Tenkey Pad','Input Devices>Keyboards &amp; Keypads>USB Keypad','y','0','21','0','','tenkey,keypad,usb keypad,numeric keypad','The USB Compact TENKEY pad is great for notebooks that may not have a tenkey pad or for simply moving your tenkey pad to the other side of your keyboard. The 27 1/2 cord allows you to place the pad w','The USB Compact TENKEY pad is great for notebooks that may not have a tenkey pad or for simply moving your tenkey pad to the other side of your keyboard. The 27 1/2 cord allows you to place the pad where its most comfortable for you, and its rubber anti-slip feet keep it in securely place.','P7432.jpg','P7432a.jpg','P7432a.jpg','0.00','11.49','0.00','0.00','0','0','0.21','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('1345','203','138 0201','Vantec USB Tenkey Pad With 2-port USB Hub','Input Devices>Keyboards &amp; Keypads>USB Keypad','y','0','13','0','','keypad,usb keypad,tenkey pad,2 port usb hub,numeric keypad','This tenkey pad includes 4 hot keys and 2 USB ports, so not only can you speed up your tenkey entry, you can also attach other devices to your computer through the convenient ports. It&#39;s lightweight,','This tenkey pad includes 4 hot keys and 2 USB ports, so not only can you speed up your tenkey entry, you can also attach other devices to your computer through the convenient ports. It&#39;s lightweight, hot-swappable and doesn&#39;t use any batteries, making it perfect for travel. Includes software on a miniCD. Requires Microsoft Windows 98SE/Me/2000/XP/Vista.','P14499.jpg','P14499a.jpg','P14499a.jpg','0.00','17.12','0.00','0.00','0','0','0.65','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('1346','203','138 0204','Kinesis Low Force USB Tenkey Pad W/ USB Hub, Black','Input Devices>Keyboards &amp; Keypads>USB Keypad','y','0','190','0','',' ','It only takes a feathery touch to operate the Kinesis low-force keypad... adding to both your comfort and its operating life. The keypad allows flexibility in positioning the keypad to the right or le','It only takes a feathery touch to operate the Kinesis low-force keypad... adding to both your comfort and its operating life. The keypad allows flexibility in positioning the keypad to the right or left of the keyboard. It&#39;s perfect for narrow keyboards or in conjunction with a laptop. The 2-port USB hub enables you to easily connect other input devices such as mice without having to access USB ports on your computer.','P26698.jpg','P26698a.jpg','P26698a.jpg','0.00','54.00','0.00','0.00','0','0','0.75','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('1347','203','138 0206','Goldtouch Tenkey Pad, USB, Blk','Input Devices>Keyboards &amp; Keypads>USB Keypad','y','0','34','0','',' ','Make numerical entry faster and more comfortable with a tenkey pad that can be positioned near either hand. The Goldtouch numerical keypad includes alternate inputs that are commonly used in Microsoft','Make numerical entry faster and more comfortable with a tenkey pad that can be positioned near either hand. The Goldtouch numerical keypad includes alternate inputs that are commonly used in Microsoft Excel or Microsoft Calculator for fast formula computation. Soft switches have a life expectancy of around 20 million key presses. Requires Microsoft Windows 98SE+ or Mac OS 9+.','P27379.jpg','P27379a.jpg','P27379a.jpg','0.00','47.49','0.00','0.00','0','0','0.75','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
