 ('1349','202','138 0213','109-key USB Glow Type Keyboard','Input Devices>Keyboards &amp; Keypads>USB Keyboard','y','0','192','0','','keyboard,glowing keyboard','Ideal for working environments that may get dirty or even wet, this flexible silicone-based keyboard can handle most any spill. Just spray any common cleaning product on it and wipe it clean. The keyb','Ideal for working environments that may get dirty or even wet, this flexible silicone-based keyboard can handle most any spill. Just spray any common cleaning product on it and wipe it clean. The keyboard combines durability with a soft comfortable feel and it rolls up for easy storage and portability. Requires Microsoft Windows 98/Me/2000/XP. Includes USB to PS/2 adapter.','P15421.jpg','P15421a.jpg','P15421a.jpg','0.00','30.41','0.00','0.00','0','0','1.2','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
