 ('1353','202','138 0261','I-rocks MAC X-slim Keyboard, White','Input Devices>Keyboards &amp; Keypads>USB Keyboard','y','0','16','0','','white,irock,mac,xslim,x-slim,keyboard,white','With a stylish chrome trim, this low-profile keyboard makes an excellent addition to Macintosh computers. Designed for endurance, the unique X-structure key mechanisms are each rated for over 10 mil','With a stylish chrome trim, this low-profile keyboard makes an excellent addition to Macintosh computers. Designed for endurance, the unique X-structure key mechanisms are each rated for over 10 million key depressions. Requires MacOS v10.1+ or Windows 98SE+.','P21198.jpg','P21198a.jpg','P21198a.jpg','0.00','20.44','0.00','0.00','0','0','2.35','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
