 ('1355','202','138 0341','Black Mechanical Keyboard, PS2 And USB','Input Devices>Keyboards &amp; Keypads>USB Keyboard','y','0','28','0','','black keyboard,mechanical keyboard','There&#39;s just something nice about the feel of a mechanical switch keyboard. The tiny snap you feel through your fingertips and the subtle click you hear confirms each keystroke. It&#39;s instant tactile a','There&#39;s just something nice about the feel of a mechanical switch keyboard. The tiny snap you feel through your fingertips and the subtle click you hear confirms each keystroke. It&#39;s instant tactile and audible feedback for your keyboarding. Includes USB to PS/2 adapter. Reqiures Microsoft Windows 98SE/Me/2000/XP.','P14078.jpg','P14078a.jpg','P14078a.jpg','0.00','41.67','0.00','0.00','0','0','3.35','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
