 ('1357','200','138 0356','Smart Fabric Keyboard, Bluetooth','Input Devices>Keyboards &amp; Keypads>Bluetooth Keyboard','y','0','196','0','','pda keyboard,keyboard,phone keyboard,laptop keyboard,moble keyboard,pda keyboards,keyboards,phone keyboards,laptop keyboards,moble keyboards,pdas keyboard,phones keyboard,laptops keyboard,mobles keyboard,blackberry keyboard,bluetooth fabric keyboard,bluet','Made of a soft, durable and pressure-sensitive fabric, this Bluetooth keyboard can be rolled up to the size of a TV remote. While it feels like soft denim, the keyboard is very responsive. Use it wire','Made of a soft, durable and pressure-sensitive fabric, this Bluetooth keyboard can be rolled up to the size of a TV remote. While it feels like soft denim, the keyboard is very responsive. Use it wirelessly with Bluetooth-equipped PDAs, such as a Pocket PC or BlackBerry. Includes nylon bag, phone stand and drivers on CD-ROM. Requires 2 AAA batteries, included. Includes drivers for Symbian S60 v2.0 and 2.1, Symbian UIQ v2.0 and 2.1 or Windows Mobile 2003.','P12337.jpg','P12337a.jpg','P12337a.jpg','0.00','73.81','0.00','0.00','0','0','0.55','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
