 ('1404','430','141 0168','Wagan 150watt Pure Sine Wave Power Inverter','Mobile Computing &amp; Travel Products>Travel Power Converters','y','0','207','0','','sine wave invterter','Great for audio and research equipment that is particularly sensitive to background noise, the Wagan Pure Sine Wave inverters provide clean sine wave power so you can run delicate electronics on the r','Great for audio and research equipment that is particularly sensitive to background noise, the Wagan Pure Sine Wave inverters provide clean sine wave power so you can run delicate electronics on the road. While most inverters produce modified-sinewave output, Wagan Pure Sine Wave inverters generate clean waveforms, just like normal household AC power. Choose between 150W (300W peak) and 300W (600W peak) models.','P11197.jpg','P11197a.jpg','P11197a.jpg','0.00','100.65','0.00','0.00','0','0','2.1','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
