 ('1409','44','141 0208','Gps Receiver For Bluetooth Cellphone, Pda And PC','Mobile Computing &amp; Travel Products>Cell/PDA Products>Hands Free Devices','y','0','208','0','','gps,locator,bluetooth,gps,receiver,pda,pc,notebook,laptop,cell,phone,receiver,bluetooth,cellphone,gps,receiver','Add navigation capabilities to your Bluetooth-enabled PDA or smartphone with this keychain GPS receiver. This portable tracker can receive signals from up to 20 GPS satellites, providing triangulation','Add navigation capabilities to your Bluetooth-enabled PDA or smartphone with this keychain GPS receiver. This portable tracker can receive signals from up to 20 GPS satellites, providing triangulation accuracy within 30 feet of your location. Clip it to your keychain or backpack... Bluetooth connectivity means it works as long as it&#39;s within 30 feet of your PDA. Includes USB and automotive chargers. Requires Bluetooth-compatible phone, PDA or PC with SPP profile and third-party GPS software, not included.','P19178.jpg','P19178a.jpg','P19178a.jpg','0.00','80.19','0.00','0.00','0','0','0.1','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('1410','430','141 0209','110v To 12vdc Wall Adapter W/ USB Port','Mobile Computing &amp; Travel Products>Travel Power Converters','y','0','207','0','','12v converter,adapter,100v,12v,adapter','Use your 12V DC car chargers at home with this AC to DC converter. It includes a 12V DC socket and a USB port to charge 5V devices simultaneously. You can use it internationally, too, as it can accept','Use your 12V DC car chargers at home with this AC to DC converter. It includes a 12V DC socket and a USB port to charge 5V devices simultaneously. You can use it internationally, too, as it can accept up to 240V AC (you would need a socket adapter, available separately).','P21058.jpg','P21058a.jpg','P21058a.jpg','0.00','10.51','0.00','0.00','0','0','0.24','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('1411','222','141 0213','Wagan Twin USB/dc Cupholder Adapter','Mobile Computing &amp; Travel Products>Auto Travel Aids','y','0','207','0','','dc adapter,auto,travel,usb,cupholder','Use two 12V DC car chargers simultaneously with this DC socket multiplier that fits into a cup holder. It includes 2 USB ports to charge 5V devices as well. Keep your GPS running while your recharge y','Use two 12V DC car chargers simultaneously with this DC socket multiplier that fits into a cup holder. It includes 2 USB ports to charge 5V devices as well. Keep your GPS running while your recharge your cell phone, MP3 player or PDA. A battery level indicator warns you if you&#39;re pulling down too much electricity from your vehicle&#39;s battery.','P22659.jpg','P22659a.jpg','P22659a.jpg','0.00','10.95','0.00','0.00','0','0','0.5','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('1412','387','141 0215','9 Volt Lithium Battery, Ultralife 5x Longer Life','Digital/Multimedia Products>Batteries &amp; Battery Packs','y','0','209','0','','battery,9v battery,lithium,lithium battery','Put one of these batteries in your ionization-type smoke alarm and you can relax for the next ten years! This ultra long life lithium 9V battery outlasts all other 9V batteries. It is outstanding for','Put one of these batteries in your ionization-type smoke alarm and you can relax for the next ten years! This ultra long life lithium 9V battery outlasts all other 9V batteries. It is outstanding for smoke alarms, baby monitors, carbon monoxide alarms, garage door openers, security systems, clock radios, any 9V application at all.','P4043.jpg','P4043a.jpg','P4043a.jpg','0.00','5.87','0.00','0.00','0','0','0.15','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('1413','430','141 0218','100w Smart AC Inverter W/ USB And 12v Dc Sockets','Mobile Computing &amp; Travel Products>Travel Power Converters','y','0','207','0','','ac,inverter,12v,110v,inverter','This AC inverter converts your vehicle&#39;s 12V DC lighter socket into a 120V AC power source! It provides the right amount of wattage for laptops, battery and phone chargers, radios and music players an','This AC inverter converts your vehicle&#39;s 12V DC lighter socket into a 120V AC power source! It provides the right amount of wattage for laptops, battery and phone chargers, radios and music players and DVD players. A USB type&#39;A&#39;socket lets you charge MP3 players or cell phones that can recharge from USB power. Safety features include a low battery alarm, automatic low battery shutdown and overload protection. Long car trips can be a lot fun with an AC inverter!','P20318.jpg','P20318a.jpg','P20318a.jpg','0.00','26.57','0.00','0.00','0','0','0.55','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('1414','430','141 0219','150w Smart AC Inverter W/ USB Slot And Holder','Mobile Computing &amp; Travel Products>Travel Power Converters','y','0','207','0','','150w,ac,inverter,auto,ac','This rugged 150W inverter is designed to fit in a cup holder in your car. Use it to power your laptop or other electronics while you&#39;re on the road. The inverter includes a pocket for a cell phone or','This rugged 150W inverter is designed to fit in a cup holder in your car. Use it to power your laptop or other electronics while you&#39;re on the road. The inverter includes a pocket for a cell phone or MP3 player and a 5V DC USB charging port.','P20319.jpg','P20319a.jpg','P20319a.jpg','0.00','32.93','0.00','0.00','0','0','0.95','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('1415','430','141 0222','Twin USB Port 12v Dc Auto Adapter','Mobile Computing &amp; Travel Products>Travel Power Converters','y','0','154','0','',' ','This 12V DC to USB adapter can give you USB power in your car, boat or RV, wherever you have a 12V DC power socket. It provides 2 USB power-only 5-volt ports, each delivering 500mA. It&#39;s the perfect t','This 12V DC to USB adapter can give you USB power in your car, boat or RV, wherever you have a 12V DC power socket. It provides 2 USB power-only 5-volt ports, each delivering 500mA. It&#39;s the perfect travel companion for PDA, Pocket PC, and cellphone users who depend on USB chargers!','P30158.jpg','P30158a.jpg','P30158a.jpg','0.00','7.36','0.00','0.00','0','0','0.1','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y');
insert into `z_products` values('1416','165','141 0246','Compushade Laptop Visor','Office Products>Desk Accessories','y','0','212','0','','Laptop,notebook,visor,shade,screen,visor,shade','Laptop screens can be very difficult to see when used outdoors or in brightly lit rooms. The CompuShade laptop hood solves this problem by dramatically reducing glare. The shade is easy to attach with','Laptop screens can be very difficult to see when used outdoors or in brightly lit rooms. The CompuShade laptop hood solves this problem by dramatically reducing glare. The shade is easy to attach with the included adhesive-backed hook-and-loop fastener strips. It is designed to fit notebooks between 8 3/4 - 16 1/4 wide and folds flat on the back of your laptop for travel. Laptop not included.','P25003.jpg','P25003a.jpg','P25003a.jpg','0.00','20.55','0.00','0.00','0','0','0.55','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('1417','427','141 0249','Cool Lift Portable Notebook Cooling Pad','Mobile Computing &amp; Travel Products>Notebook Stands/Coolers','y','0','6','0','','notebook,mobile office,cooling pad,notebook pad,portable cooling pad','The heat generated from today&#39;s notebooks can place an enormous strain on the circuitry and batteries in your notebook. The Cool Lift raises your notebook up for better air circulation, and sets it on','The heat generated from today&#39;s notebooks can place an enormous strain on the circuitry and batteries in your notebook. The Cool Lift raises your notebook up for better air circulation, and sets it on a gentle angle for more ergonomic keyboard use.','P6264.jpg','P6264a.jpg','P6264a.jpg','0.00','7.62','0.00','0.00','0','0','0.25','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
