 ('1419','289','141 0281','3m Notebook Privacy Filter, Fits 15.4 In. Widescreen','Security Products>Computer Security','y','0','135','0','','privacy filter,notebook filter,notebook privacy filter,laptop filter,laptop privacy','3M&#39;s microlouver privacy filter limits the viewing angle of your laptop&#39;s LCD. While you&#39;ll be able to see the screen just fine from directly in front of it, the LCD will appear dark when viewed from','3M&#39;s microlouver privacy filter limits the viewing angle of your laptop&#39;s LCD. While you&#39;ll be able to see the screen just fine from directly in front of it, the LCD will appear dark when viewed from the side. The filter can be easily removed, as it slides into self-adhesive guides you apply to your screen. Laptop not included. To determine needed filter size, use the diagonal measurement of your LCD&#39;s viewable area.','P16087.jpg','P16087a.jpg','P16087a.jpg','0.00','49.74','0.00','0.00','0','0','0.2','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
