 ('1423','56','141 0338','Energizer 15 Minute Battery Charger, Ch15mncp-4','Digital/Multimedia Products>Chargers','y','0','214','0','','energizer,battery,battery charger,15 minute charger','Completely recharge your nickel-metal hydride (NiMH) batteries in just 15 minutes with Energizer&#39;s high-speed AA and AAA charger. Specially designed for Energizer&#39;s high-capacity (2200mAh) NiMH batter','Completely recharge your nickel-metal hydride (NiMH) batteries in just 15 minutes with Energizer&#39;s high-speed AA and AAA charger. Specially designed for Energizer&#39;s high-capacity (2200mAh) NiMH batteries, the charger uses advanced circuitry to provide individual cell channel charging and a trickle maintenance charge to keep batteries at full capacity. Includes AC adapter and 4 Energizer rechargeable batteries.','P10077.jpg','P10077a.jpg','P10077a.jpg','0.00','33.06','0.00','0.00','0','0','1.22','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
