 ('1475','289','141 0830','CD Destroyer','Security Products>Computer Security','y','0','231','0','','destroy,security,cd shred,unreadable,cd destroyer,data security','You shred sensitive documents for security, but what do you do with CDs that contain sensitive data? It&#39;s dangerous to break them, but you can&#39;t just throw them away. The CD Destroyer is the answer. W','You shred sensitive documents for security, but what do you do with CDs that contain sensitive data? It&#39;s dangerous to break them, but you can&#39;t just throw them away. The CD Destroyer is the answer. With two solid steel knurled rollers, the CD Destroyer permanently destroys both the top and bottom surfaces of CDs, DVDs and other CD-size discs rendering the data-bearing surfaces unreadable. Your sensitive data cannot be read and you don&#39;t have to break discs.','P4351.jpg','P4351a.jpg','P4351a.jpg','0.00','41.26','0.00','0.00','0','0','5.3','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('1476','459','141 0864','Sensor Plug','Security Products>Home &amp; Office Security','y','0','483','0','','motion detector,motion sensor','Stop stumbling around in the dark trying to turn on a light by clapping your hands. The Sensor Plug simply plugs into a wall socket and when it detects motion, it turns on any electrical device that','Stop stumbling around in the dark trying to turn on a light by clapping your hands. The Sensor Plug simply plugs into a wall socket and when it detects motion, it turns on any electrical device that is plugged into it: lamp, radio or fan even your TV. It&#39;s ideal for home, garage or office for safety and as a burglary deterrent.','P7635.jpg','P7635a.jpg','P7635a.jpg','0.00','11.47','0.00','0.00','0','0','0.36','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('1477','222','141 0877','Dash-mat Universal Mobile Device Dash Mount','Mobile Computing &amp; Travel Products>Auto Travel Aids','y','0','224','0','','dash,mount,device,holder','With a high-friction anti-skid bottom and almost 2 pounds of weight distributed around its base, the Dash-Mat keeps your in-car electronics securely on your dashboard. It&#39;s perfect for vehicles with','With a high-friction anti-skid bottom and almost 2 pounds of weight distributed around its base, the Dash-Mat keeps your in-car electronics securely on your dashboard. It&#39;s perfect for vehicles with steeply inclined windshields or unusually shaped dashboards. The Dash-Mat has an adjustable clamp with spring-loaded arms that open up to 3 3/4.  When you leave your vehicle simply move your Dash-Mat mounted electronics out of sight. Your electronic devices will be out of the sun, won&#39;t tempt would-be thieves and there&#39;s no tell-tale suction cup mark on your windshield.','P24820.jpg','P24820a.jpg','P24820a.jpg','0.00','29.95','0.00','0.00','0','0','1.95','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
