 ('1563','299','142 1002','AA Mini Maglite 1 Watt LED Upgrade With Iq Switch','Tools &amp; Testers>LED Flashlights','y','0','109','0','','aa mini,maglite,led convertion,mag convertion','This kit includes both the Luxeon(R) 1-Watt upgrade for AA Mini MagLite flashlights and the compatible 5-mode IQ Switch. Utilizing an amazingly powerful Luxeon 1-Watt white LED bulb, this upgra','This kit includes both the Luxeon(R) 1-Watt upgrade for AA Mini MagLite flashlights and the compatible 5-mode IQ Switch. Utilizing an amazingly powerful Luxeon 1-Watt white LED bulb, this upgrade for AA Mini MagLite flashlights not only increases luminescent output, it also extends battery life! Rated for nearly six years of continuous use, the 1-Watt upgrade can save you money on both replacement batteries and bulbs. The IQ Switch converts an ordinary AA Mini MagLite into a smart flashlight! It allows you to select a brightness level of 25%, 50% or 100%, or a fast or slow strobe mode. It will automatically shut off the flashlight if left on continuously for 15 minutes, and a tiny red LED in the tail cap blinks every few seconds so that you can find it in the dark.','P14407.jpg','P14407a.jpg','P14407a.jpg','0.00','16.31','0.00','0.00','0','0','0.1','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('1564','299','142 1003','Nite Ize 1 Watt LED Upgrade For C And D Flashlights','Tools &amp; Testers>LED Flashlights','y','0','109','0','','niteize,1watt,watt,led,upgrade,converter','This 1 Watt LED lamp replaces the incandescent bulb found in your C- or D-sized Mag-Lite flashlight. The bright LED is extremely efficient, giving your Mag-Lite extended battery life! This bulb is com','This 1 Watt LED lamp replaces the incandescent bulb found in your C- or D-sized Mag-Lite flashlight. The bright LED is extremely efficient, giving your Mag-Lite extended battery life! This bulb is compatible with 2- to 6-battery models and is rated for 50,000 hours of use.','P22102.jpg','P22102a.jpg','P22102a.jpg','0.00','12.26','0.00','0.00','0','0','0.05','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('1565','420','142 1010','Digital Antenna 38db Wireless Cellular Amp Kit','Mobile Computing &amp; Travel Products>Cell/PDA Products>Boosters &amp; Repeaters','y','0','277','0','','cell phone,cell,cellular phone,moble phone,moble cell phone,moble,cell amp,cell amplifier,phone amp,cell booster,amplifier,booster,cell phone signal booster,cellphone signal booster,cell phone booster,cellphone booster','Our powerful amplifier/repeater boosts your cell phone transmission and reception for greater coverage and clearer conversations with no physical connection to your cell phone. You&#39;ll get signal stren','Our powerful amplifier/repeater boosts your cell phone transmission and reception for greater coverage and clearer conversations with no physical connection to your cell phone. You&#39;ll get signal strength increases up to 40 dB gain. How does it work? The inside antenna wirelessly connects to your cell phone and amplifies to amplify and repeat its transmissions to a cell tower via the outside antenna. Incoming signals are also boosted before repeated to your phone. System Kit includes Amplifier/Repeater, Indoor Antenna, 20 9dB Gain Outdoor Antenna with Mounting Bracket, 30&#39;Coaxial Cable, 12VDC and 110AC Power Adapter','P9294.jpg','P9294a.jpg','P9294a.jpg','0.00','449.00','0.00','0.00','0','0','2','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('1566','420','142 1015','Digital Antenna 40db 3 Watt Mobile Amp/Repeater','Mobile Computing &amp; Travel Products>Cell/PDA Products>Boosters &amp; Repeaters','y','0','277','0','','cell phone,cell,cellular phone,mobile phone,moble cell phone,moble,cell amp,cell amplifier,phone amp,cell booster,amplifier,booster,cell phone signal booster,cellphone signal booster,cell phone booster,cellphone booster','Experience greater cell phone power, range and reliability in your car, truck, SUV or van with Digital Antenna&#39;s award winning, wireless PowerMax vehicle cellular booster. The PowerMax 4KMR-10A boosts','Experience greater cell phone power, range and reliability in your car, truck, SUV or van with Digital Antenna&#39;s award winning, wireless PowerMax vehicle cellular booster. The PowerMax 4KMR-10A boosts the signal strength of your cell phone or air card to 3 watts and increases range up to 20+ miles without a physical connection to your cell phone. The result is clean and clear voice quality with maximum data throughput on all carriers except Nextel or iDEN. How does it work? The inside antenna wirelessly connects to your cell phone and amplifies to amplify and repeat its transmissions to a cell tower via the outside antenna. Incoming signals are also boosted before repeated to your phone. This version of the cell booster is designed for cars and trucks. Vehicle System Kit includes: 40dB Amplifier/Repeater, Interior Antenna, Exterior Antenna, Mounting Hardware, and 12VDC Power Adapter.','P9295.jpg','P9295a.jpg','P9295a.jpg','0.00','336.24','0.00','0.00','0','0','1','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('1567','420','142 1016','Digital Antenna 60db Wireless Cell Amp And Repeater','Mobile Computing &amp; Travel Products>Cell/PDA Products>Boosters &amp; Repeaters','y','0','277','0','','cell amp,cell amplifier,phone amp,cell booster,amplifier,booster,cell phone signal booster,cellphone signal booster,cell phone booster,cellphone booster','Our powerful amplifier/repeater boosts your cell phone transmission and reception for greater coverage and clearer conversations with no physical connection to your cell phone. You&#39;ll get signal stren','Our powerful amplifier/repeater boosts your cell phone transmission and reception for greater coverage and clearer conversations with no physical connection to your cell phone. You&#39;ll get signal strength increases up to 60 dB gain. How does it work? The inside antenna wirelessly connects to your cell phone and amplifies to amplify and repeat its transmissions to a cell tower via the outside antenna. Incoming signals are also boosted before repeated to your phone. This high-powered version of the cell booster is designed for multiple rooms in a home, office, RV over 40 ft., yacht or sailboat. A minimum of 40 feet and a substantial wall is required between the two antennas. Small building kit includes amplifier/repeater, interior omni-directional antenna, exterior antenna, mounting hardware, 50&#39;low-loss RF cable and 12VDC power adapter.','P14115.jpg','P14115a.jpg','P14115a.jpg','0.00','559.00','0.00','0.00','0','0','6.3','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
