 ('1571','420','142 1030','Digital Antenna 70db Wireless Cell Amp And Repeater','Mobile Computing &amp; Travel Products>Cell/PDA Products>Boosters &amp; Repeaters','y','0','277','0','','70db,antenna,wireless,cell amp,amplifier,repeater','Get more bars with the most powerful repeater system on the market. The PowerMax 4KSBR-50M 70dB gain wireless repeater system boosts the signal strength of your cell phones or air cards to 3 watts, gr','Get more bars with the most powerful repeater system on the market. The PowerMax 4KSBR-50M 70dB gain wireless repeater system boosts the signal strength of your cell phones or air cards to 3 watts, greatly improves transmit and receive signals and can be used in a variety of locations. How does it work? The inside antenna wirelessly connects to your cell phone and amplifies to amplify and repeat its transmissions to a cell tower via the outside antenna. Incoming signals are also boosted before repeated to your phone. This System Kit Includes: 70DB Amplifier/Repeater, 18 external 9dB gain omni-directional antenna, Internal 9 dB gain directional antenna, 50&#39;Cable for external antenna, 15&#39;Cable for internal antenna, mounting hardware, 12VDC and 120V AC adapter.','P20758.jpg','P20758a.jpg','P20758a.jpg','0.00','559.00','0.00','0.00','0','0','6.3','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('1572','420','142 1035','Dual Band Cell Phone Signal Booster, Personal','Mobile Computing &amp; Travel Products>Cell/PDA Products>Boosters &amp; Repeaters','y','0','279','0','','signal,booster,dual,band,cell,phone,signal,booster','The zBoost Cell Phone Signal Booster uses a powerful amplifier to improve connections to distant cell towers. Mount the connecting antenna near a window where a weak signal can be found, and then plac','The zBoost Cell Phone Signal Booster uses a powerful amplifier to improve connections to distant cell towers. Mount the connecting antenna near a window where a weak signal can be found, and then place the local antenna where you commonly make your calls. The zBoost amplifier works with almost all carriers and all cell applications, including voice, messages, downloads or data cards. Includes antennas, 20 feet of antenna cable and AC adapter. Not compatible with iDEN or Nextel networks. Phone not included.','P21678.jpg','P21678a.jpg','P21678a.jpg','0.00','144.62','0.00','0.00','0','0','1.15','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('1573','420','142 1036','Dual Band Cell Phone Signal Booster, Office&home','Mobile Computing &amp; Travel Products>Cell/PDA Products>Boosters &amp; Repeaters','y','0','279','0','','office,home,dual,band,cell,phone,booster,signal,booster,office,home','The zBoost Cell Phone Signal Booster uses a powerful amplifier to improve connections to distant cell towers. Mount the connecting antenna near a window where a weak signal can be found, and then plac','The zBoost Cell Phone Signal Booster uses a powerful amplifier to improve connections to distant cell towers. Mount the connecting antenna near a window where a weak signal can be found, and then place the local antenna where you commonly make your calls. The zBoost amplifier works with almost all carriers and all cell applications, including voice, messages, downloads or data cards. Includes antennas, 50 feet of antenna cable, mounting hardware and AC adapter. Not compatible with iDEN or Nextel networks. Phones not included.','P21679.jpg','P21679a.jpg','P21679a.jpg','0.00','288.85','0.00','0.00','0','0','3.3','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y');
insert into `z_products` values('1574','420','142 1037','Multi-band Directional Cellular And Wifi Antenna','Mobile Computing &amp; Travel Products>Cell/PDA Products>Boosters &amp; Repeaters','y','0','277','0','','directional,cell,phone,cellphone,wifi,wi-fi,amplifier,antenna','Boost the directional power of your cell phone amplifier with this 10dBi gain outdoor Yagi antenna. Aim the black cone towards the nearest compatible tower and you&#39;ll experience stronger signals (more','Boost the directional power of your cell phone amplifier with this 10dBi gain outdoor Yagi antenna. Aim the black cone towards the nearest compatible tower and you&#39;ll experience stronger signals (more bars) than with an omni-directional antenna. (Since the antenna is directional, cell towers outside the 80-degree cone will have weaker signals.) The antenna is tuned to three bandwidths, and therefore can be used for all cellular frequencies, including North America&#39;s 850 and 1900 MHz bands, Europe and Asia&#39;s standard 900 and 1800 MHz bands, WCDMA at 2.1 GHz, Nextel at 800 MHz, and the 2.5 GHz Wi-Fi band. Compatible with all Digital Antenna PowerMax amplifiers and repeaters. Includes pole-mounting hardware.','P24518.jpg','P24518a.jpg','P24518a.jpg','0.00','135.90','0.00','0.00','0','0','3.4','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
