 ('1851','379','163 0104','Ams 3-in-2 Sata To Sata Backplane Module','Computer Components>Drives &amp; Storage>External Enclosures','y','0','43','0','','sata drive enclosure,drive enclosure,serial ata enclosure','Place three 3.5 SATA drives into two 5.25 drive bays using the Venus multi-SATA drive internal enclosure. This backplane module allows you to swap SATA drives frequently without stress to the cables','Place three 3.5 SATA drives into two 5.25 drive bays using the Venus multi-SATA drive internal enclosure. This backplane module allows you to swap SATA drives frequently without stress to the cables or controller card. Built from heat-dissipating aluminum, the modular racks also include a 60mm cooling fan. Includes SATA data cables, keys and mounting screws. Requires 3.5 SATA drives and RAID controller card, not included, and Microsoft Windows 98SE/Me/2000/XP/Vista.','P14692.jpg','P14692a.jpg','P14692a.jpg','0.00','79.10','0.00','0.00','0','0','3','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
