 ('1854','24','163 0111','Thermaltake 430w Dual Fan ATX Power Supply','Computer Components>Cases &amp; Components>Power Supplies','y','0','3','0','','pc power supply,power supply,atx supply,430w supply,430w ps','Give your components the power they need and keep your case cooler with Thermaltake&#39;s dual-fan 430 watt power supply. With PCI-e and SATA connectors, it&#39;s ready for new technologies but can also work','Give your components the power they need and keep your case cooler with Thermaltake&#39;s dual-fan 430 watt power supply. With PCI-e and SATA connectors, it&#39;s ready for new technologies but can also work with older 20-pin motherboards too. Black cable sleeving helps improve airflow and the fans produce a mere 19dBA of noise at normal speeds. Includes 6&#39;power cord and mounting screws.','P14719.jpg','P14719a.jpg','P14719a.jpg','0.00','37.49','0.00','0.00','0','0','4.5','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('1855','432','163 0113','D-link 2-bay Network Storage Enclosure','Networking>Network Access Storage (NAS)','y','0','317','0','','network storage,network sata drive enclosure,net storage enclosure','Create a network file server using the D-Link network storage enclosure and 2 of your own 3.5 SATA drives. Gigabit-ready, the enclosure connects directly to 10, 100 or 1000mbps Ethernet networks can','Create a network file server using the D-Link network storage enclosure and 2 of your own 3.5 SATA drives. Gigabit-ready, the enclosure connects directly to 10, 100 or 1000mbps Ethernet networks can share files to any PC or Mac on the network. It also includes an FTP server for delivering to and receiving files from the Internet. Keep files everyone uses--like audio or video downloads--on the network drive so that you can leave your PC off and save power. Includes CAT5 cable, AC adapter and software on CD-ROM. Requires 1 or 2 3.5 SATA hard drives. Included backup software requires Microsoft Windows 2000/XP.','P15001.jpg','P15001a.jpg','P15001a.jpg','0.00','189.00','0.00','0.00','0','0','5.35','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y');
insert into `z_products` values('1856','379','163 0117','3.5in Sata HDD Encl., USB/esata, Card R/w, Black','Computer Components>Drives &amp; Storage>External Enclosures','y','0','157','0','','drive enclosure,sata hdd enclosure,esata,sata hdd','Install a fast SATA drive up to 500GB in this multifunction enclosure that includes a convenient media card reader and 2-port USB hub. With aluminum heat sinks incorporated into its modern design, the','Install a fast SATA drive up to 500GB in this multifunction enclosure that includes a convenient media card reader and 2-port USB hub. With aluminum heat sinks incorporated into its modern design, the XRev enclosure can help keep your drive cooler for a longer life. The eSATA connection allows for data transfers up to 3Gbps. Includes eSATA cable, USB cable, AC adapter and software on MiniCD. Requires 3.5 SATA hard drive and either Microsoft Windows 2000/XP/Vista, Mac OS 10.1+ or Linux kernel 2.4+ (included backup software is compatible with Windows only). Note: USB 2.0 port connection is required for card reader and USB 2.0 hub functions.','P15622.jpg','P15622a.jpg','P15622a.jpg','0.00','52.82','0.00','0.00','0','0','2.95','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('1857','379','163 0118','Ez Swap Ex 2.5in Int/ext IDE HDD Enclosure','Computer Components>Drives &amp; Storage>External Enclosures','y','0','13','0','','hard drive enclosure,2.5 hard drive enclosure','Not just a mobile enclosure for 2.5 hard drives, the EZ-Swap includes slots that fit into your desktop computer for easy docking. On the road, you can access your drive with a single USB 2.0 cable. W','Not just a mobile enclosure for 2.5 hard drives, the EZ-Swap includes slots that fit into your desktop computer for easy docking. On the road, you can access your drive with a single USB 2.0 cable. When back home, you can just slide the drive into the dock and it connects to your computer immediately through a SATA drive connector. Includes 5.25 bay adapter, USB data and power cables, internal SATA cable, nylon travel pouch, Molex to FDD power adapter, mounting screws. Requires 2.5 IDE hard drive, not included. Dock requires available bay, SATA drive connection, and FDD or Molex power connector. External use requires USB connection and Microsoft Windows 98SE/ME/2000/XP/Vista or Mac OS 8.6+.','P15659.jpg','P15659a.jpg','P15659a.jpg','0.00','32.49','0.00','0.00','0','0','2','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('1858','379','163 0119','Ez Swap Ex 2.5in Int/ext Sata HDD Enclosure','Computer Components>Drives &amp; Storage>External Enclosures','y','0','13','0','','hard drive enclosure,2.5 hard drive enclosure','Not just a mobile enclosure for 2.5 hard drives, the EZ-Swap includes slots that fit into your desktop computer for easy docking. On the road, you can access your drive with a single USB 2.0 cable. W','Not just a mobile enclosure for 2.5 hard drives, the EZ-Swap includes slots that fit into your desktop computer for easy docking. On the road, you can access your drive with a single USB 2.0 cable. When back home, you can just slide the drive into the dock and it connects to your computer immediately through a SATA drive connector. Includes 5.25 bay adapter, USB data and power cables, internal SATA cable, nylon travel pouch, Molex to FDD power adapter, mounting screws. Requires 2.5 SATA hard drive, not included. Dock requires available bay, SATA drive connection, and FDD or Molex power connector. External use requires USB connection and Microsoft Windows 98SE/ME/2000/XP/Vista or Mac OS 8.6+.','P15660.jpg','P15660a.jpg','P15660a.jpg','0.00','33.65','0.00','0.00','0','0','2','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
