 ('1869','194','163 0209','Cradlepoint Mobile Broadband Router','Networking>Wireless Networking (WiFi)>Wireless Routers','y','0','324','0','','broadband,mobile,portable,wifi,wireless,router','The Cradlepoint mobile broadband router connects multiple computers to the Internet, utilizing only a single broadband EV-DO or HSDPA device. It functions as an access point, communicating with local','The Cradlepoint mobile broadband router connects multiple computers to the Internet, utilizing only a single broadband EV-DO or HSDPA device. It functions as an access point, communicating with local computers over 802.11b/g/n* wireless and to the Internet via your cellular 3G handset or ExpressCard. It allows your desktop PCs to use your cellular device, or it can create a Wi-Fi hot spot where fixed broadband connections are unavailable. Cellular data coverage varies by area; consult your carrier for availability. Includes Ethernet adapter and AC adapter. Requires active EV-DO or HSDPA ExpressCard or USB-connecting handset. *802.11n draft speeds','P23898.jpg','P23898a.jpg','P23898a.jpg','0.00','249.00','0.00','0.00','0','0','2.2','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
