 ('1872','379','163 0219','Vantec Nexstar 3i External 3.5in Sata HDD Encl','Computer Components>Drives &amp; Storage>External Enclosures','y','0','13','0','','nexstar,3I,external,sata,hard,drive,hdd,enclosure','Vantec&#39;s NexStar 3i enclosure is designed to self-regulate its power consumption, improving efficiency and potentially extending the life of the installed hard drive. Three power management modes--idl','Vantec&#39;s NexStar 3i enclosure is designed to self-regulate its power consumption, improving efficiency and potentially extending the life of the installed hard drive. Three power management modes--idle, standby, and power down--can be custom set to balance between data needs and power savings. In addition, the NexStar&#39;s aluminum casing helps cool your drive. Includes power management software on CD-ROM. Requires 3.5 SATA hard drive, not included.','P24098.jpg','P24098a.jpg','P24098a.jpg','0.00','40.80','0.00','0.00','0','0','2.3','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('1873','380','163 0228','Fire-safe Waterproof Hard Drive, 160gb','Computer Components>Drives &amp; Storage>External Hard Drives','y','0','180','0','',' ','Encased in the patented SentrySafe concrete-based shell, this hard drive is designed to survive for 30 minutes at 1,550 degrees Fahrenheit. It also can be completely submerged with no threat of drive','Encased in the patented SentrySafe concrete-based shell, this hard drive is designed to survive for 30 minutes at 1,550 degrees Fahrenheit. It also can be completely submerged with no threat of drive damage. Fires and floods do happen, so it&#39;s important that your most valuable data are protected. In addition to the physical protection, Sentry provides free data recovery services and will replace a fire- or water-damaged SentrySafe drive. Includes USB cable and software on CD-ROM. Requires 2 USB ports and Microsoft Windows XP+ or Mac OS 10.4.7+.','P25558.jpg','P25558a.jpg','P25558a.jpg','0.00','272.00','0.00','0.00','0','0','9.9','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
