 ('1875','379','163 0230','Fire-safe Waterproof Data Storage Chest, USB 2.0','Computer Components>Drives &amp; Storage>External Enclosures','y','0','180','0','',' ','Protect an external USB hard drive in a lockable safe that&#39;s both fire- and water-proof... while still retaining access to the drive&#39;s data. The SentrySafe Data Storage Chest includes a pass-through U','Protect an external USB hard drive in a lockable safe that&#39;s both fire- and water-proof... while still retaining access to the drive&#39;s data. The SentrySafe Data Storage Chest includes a pass-through USB port so that you can keep a protected drive connected to your computer. The safe&#39;s concrete-based lining is ETL-verified to protect contents against total submersion or against 30 minutes at 1,550 degrees Fahrenheit. Ten double-sided hanging pockets for CDs and DVDs are also included. Usable with USB 2.0 powered devices only; does not support externally powered devices.','P25658.jpg','P25658a.jpg','P25658a.jpg','0.00','139.00','0.00','0.00','0','0','20.15','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
