 ('1879','24','163 0250','500w Purepower ATX 12v 2.0 Power Supply','Computer Components>Cases &amp; Components>Power Supplies','y','0','3','0','','500w,500 watt,purepower,atx,power,supply,pc,power supply','Designed for use with AMD Athlon64 and Pentium4 Prescott boards, Thermaltake&#39;s 500W power supply keeps things cool with a minimum of noise. With PCI-e and SATA connectors, it&#39;s ready for new technolog','Designed for use with AMD Athlon64 and Pentium4 Prescott boards, Thermaltake&#39;s 500W power supply keeps things cool with a minimum of noise. With PCI-e and SATA connectors, it&#39;s ready for new technologies but can also work with older 20-pin motherboards too. Black cable sleeving helps improve airflow and the fan produces a mere 19dBA of noise at normal speeds. Includes 6&#39;power cord and mounting screws.','P18045.jpg','P18045a.jpg','P18045a.jpg','0.00','63.18','0.00','0.00','0','0','4.8','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('1880','379','163 0258','Ams 5 Bay 3.5in Sata To Esata Ext HDD Encl','Computer Components>Drives &amp; Storage>External Enclosures','y','0','43','0','',' ','Combine up to five 3.5 SATA drives in one enclosure... then configure them to meet your storage needs. You can choose from several RAID schemes for varying degrees of speed, redundancy and capacity.','Combine up to five 3.5 SATA drives in one enclosure... then configure them to meet your storage needs. You can choose from several RAID schemes for varying degrees of speed, redundancy and capacity. The enclosure can handle 5 SATA drives up to 1 terabyte each, yielding a maximum capacity of 5TB. The included Silicon Image PCI Express RAID controller card provides data transfers up to 3.0GBps. Includes PCI Express 2-port eSATA card, eSATA cord and software on CD-ROM.','P28759.jpg','P28759a.jpg','P28759a.jpg','0.00','189.00','0.00','0.00','0','0','11.1','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('1881','379','163 0259','Ams 2 Bay 3.5in Sata To USB 2.0/esata Ext HDD Encl','Computer Components>Drives &amp; Storage>External Enclosures','y','0','43','0','',' ','Keep your important data secure in a dual drive enclosure that uses onboard RAID to continuously backup your files. With fast USB access or super-fast eSATA access, the Venus eS2 works well with data-','Keep your important data secure in a dual drive enclosure that uses onboard RAID to continuously backup your files. With fast USB access or super-fast eSATA access, the Venus eS2 works well with data-heavy operations like 3D animation, video editing, audio streaming or system backup. Easy to set up, the eS2 can handle drives up to a terabyte in capacity. Includes eSATA cable, USB 2.0 cable and AC adapter. Requires Microsoft Windows 2000/XP/Vista or Mac OS 10.4+ and two 3.5 SATA drives of equal capacity, not included.','P28758.jpg','P28758a.jpg','P28758a.jpg','0.00','92.30','0.00','0.00','0','0','5.75','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('1882','383','163 0271','Seagate Savvio 15k 36gb 2.5in Sas HDD, Oem','Computer Components>Drives &amp; Storage>Laptop Hard Drives','y','0','318','0','','savvio,36gb,15k,2.5,hdd,hard,drive','The Savvio 15K 2.5-inch drive provides amazing performance and reliability while ensuring ultra-low power consumption. The Savvio 15K drive ranks amongst the world&#39;s best for performance per U, perfor','The Savvio 15K 2.5-inch drive provides amazing performance and reliability while ensuring ultra-low power consumption. The Savvio 15K drive ranks amongst the world&#39;s best for performance per U, performance per gigabyte, and performance per watt. The Savvio 15K drive offers the advanced SAS interface. Chosen by HP for their record-breaking performance benchmarks, the Savvio drive outperforms 3.5-inch 15,000rpm drives and consumes around 30 percent less power.','P24299.jpg','P24299a.jpg','P24299a.jpg','0.00','269.00','0.00','0.00','0','0','0.6','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('1883','382','163 0292','Seagate Es.2, 500gb 3.5in Sas HDD, Oem','Computer Components>Drives &amp; Storage>Internal Hard Drives','y','0','318','0','','2.5,2.5in,500,500gb,momentus,7200rpm,500 gig,500gig,internal,sata,hd,hdd,hard drive,harddrive,internal hard drive','The Barracuda(R) ES2 Serial Attached SCSI (SAS) drives are perfect for high-capacity, 7200rpm enterprise storage applications where GB cost and watts per GB are primary considerations. They offers ene','The Barracuda(R) ES2 Serial Attached SCSI (SAS) drives are perfect for high-capacity, 7200rpm enterprise storage applications where GB cost and watts per GB are primary considerations. They offers energy-saving PowerTrim features, internal data integrity protection, superior rotational vibration tolerance and a SATA 3.0Gbps interface. The Seagate(R) Barracuda(R) ES.2 drive uses second-generation Seagate perpendicular recording technology to provide up to one terabyte of storage in a single, 4-platter hard drive. This 7200rpm drive with best-in-class reliability and rotational vibration tolerance was developed for 24x7 availability in high-density, Tier 2 storage applications. The drives integrated workload management feature aids in drive cooling during periods of prolonged activity. The integrated PowerTrim technology optimizes power consumption during operation and idle without any host interaction or performance loss. The Barracuda ES.2 drive comes with in-drive data integrity protection guaranteed through Seagate IOEDC/IOECC technology.','P24292.jpg','P24292a.jpg','P24292a.jpg','0.00','174.00','0.00','0.00','0','0','1.5','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
