 ('2005','307','180 0488','Smartronix Linkcheck Ethernet Tester','Tools &amp; Testers>Network Testers','y','0','125','0','','enet tester,ethernet tester,linkcheck tester','The LinkCheck tests an RJ-45 jack for the presence of an Ethernet connection. With the push of a button, it indicates connection status and speed (10 or 100 Mbps) through 3 LEDs. Requires 1 CR2032 ba','The LinkCheck tests an RJ-45 jack for the presence of an Ethernet connection. With the push of a button, it indicates connection status and speed (10 or 100 Mbps) through 3 LEDs. Requires 1 CR2032 battery, included. Please note, not compatible with MDIX switches or gigabit (1000 Mbps) installations.','P13837.jpg','P13837a.jpg','P13837a.jpg','0.00','36.15','0.00','0.00','0','0','0.05','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('2006','307','180 0489','Smartronix Ethernet Adapter For Linkcheck 180 0488','Tools &amp; Testers>Network Testers','y','0','125','0','','ethernet,network,adapter,180 0488','The Ethernet extender can be used in conjunction with the Smartronix LinkCheck or other network testers to check awkward or hard to reach Ethernet ports. The extender&#39;s flexible design allows the Link','The Ethernet extender can be used in conjunction with the Smartronix LinkCheck or other network testers to check awkward or hard to reach Ethernet ports. The extender&#39;s flexible design allows the LinkCheck LEDs to remain visible while being used with a variety of Ethernet port configurations and locations.','P21001.jpg','P21001a.jpg','P21001a.jpg','0.00','4.34','0.00','0.00','0','0','0.05','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
