 ('2173','44','190 0429','Hands Free Dragon Class One Bluetooth Headset, Sil','Mobile Computing &amp; Travel Products>Cell/PDA Products>Hands Free Devices','y','0','221','0','','bluetooth,dragon,class,one,bluetooth,headset','The Dragon is an impressive Class I Bluetooth headset with amazing audio quality and a strong battery that provides up to 8 hours of talk time between charges. The double-mic design significantly redu','The Dragon is an impressive Class I Bluetooth headset with amazing audio quality and a strong battery that provides up to 8 hours of talk time between charges. The double-mic design significantly reduces background noise for clear conversations. Two Dragon headsets can be paired together for direct headset-to-headset communications within 275 feet. Includes left and right ear hooks, USB power cord, AC adapter, DC auto adapter, carrying case and a charging cable for CellPod (sold separately as 141 0436). *Requires Class I Bluetooth phone for maximum range potential.','P19998.jpg','P19998a.jpg','P19998a.jpg','0.00','67.59','0.00','0.00','0','0','0.9','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('2174','371','190 0431','Lightsnake USB Stereo Recording Cable, 10ft','Cables &amp; Adapters>USB 2.0 Cables','y','0','349','0','','lightsnake,usb,stereo,recording,cable','Transfer and record analog audio on-the-fly with the digitizing LightSnake USB cable. It can connect your PC to a tape deck, record player, mixing console or any audio component with RCA (phono) jacks','Transfer and record analog audio on-the-fly with the digitizing LightSnake USB cable. It can connect your PC to a tape deck, record player, mixing console or any audio component with RCA (phono) jacks. Its embedded 16-bit analog-to-digital converter enables 48/44.1 KHz recordings with extremely low audio loss. A monitor jack lets you listen in on your recording in progress while volume controls are on the cable itself. Ready to use with most USB computers right out of the box, the LightSnake cable can also be enhanced with third-party open source software. Includes RCA to 3.5mm adapter cable, earphones, 2 RCA F/F gender changers and drivers on a MiniCD. Requires Microsoft Windows 98SE+ or Mac OS v.9.1+.','P21138.jpg','P21138a.jpg','P21138a.jpg','0.00','39.99','0.00','0.00','0','0','0.6','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
