 ('2218','44','190 0575','Blueant Supertooth 3 Hands-free Bluetooth Spkr/phn','Mobile Computing &amp; Travel Products>Cell/PDA Products>Hands Free Devices','y','0','356','0','',' ','Here&#39;s a hands-free speakerphone that is truly hand-free! The BlueAnt Supertooth 3 attaches to your vehicle&#39;s sun visor, and uses voice caller ID to announce callers. Just say OK to accept the call!','Here&#39;s a hands-free speakerphone that is truly hand-free! The BlueAnt Supertooth 3 attaches to your vehicle&#39;s sun visor, and uses voice caller ID to announce callers. Just say OK to accept the call! Since it&#39;s built with a rechargeable battery, you can clip the SuperTooth II to your car&#39;s sun visor or use wherever you go. The ultra-sensitive microphone and digital noise-cancellation features allow for crystal clear communications with any Bluetooth-equipped cell phone. Includes 12V DC auto charger and AC adapter. Requires Bluetooth phone, not included.','P28339.jpg','P28339a.jpg','P28339a.jpg','0.00','99.95','0.00','0.00','0','0','1','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
