 ('2224','324','190 0800','Rf Link 5.8 Ghz Audio/video Transmitter/receiver','Digital/Multimedia Products>Digital A/V Solutions>Video Converters','y','0','139','0','','5.8G,5.8GHz','The RF-Link wireless transmitter sends audio/video from one room in your house to another... without running wires! You can connect the transmitter to your cable box, DVD player, television or any oth','The RF-Link wireless transmitter sends audio/video from one room in your house to another... without running wires! You can connect the transmitter to your cable box, DVD player, television or any other A/V source that outputs an A/V signal and then watch that transmission on a TV somewhere else in your home. Most other A/V transmitters use the crowded 2.4GHz band and suffer from interference caused by cordless phones, microwave ovens and Wi-Fi or Bluetooth RF signals. By utilizing the 5.8GHz range, your transmitted TV and audio signals will be clearer and cleaner. The system includes an additional IR receiver/transmitter so you can control the A/V source you&#39;re watching from your remote location with your regular remote control.','P9764.jpg','P9764a.jpg','P9764a.jpg','0.00','115.84','0.00','0.00','0','0','3.3','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('2225','31','190 0801','I2i Stream Wireless Audio Broadcaster And Receiver','Digital/Multimedia Products>Digital A/V Solutions>Audio Processors','y','0','368','0','',' ','Plug the i2i Stream into your iPod(R) or any other MP3 player and transmit your music to your friends... wirelessly! Any i2i Stream unit can be used as a transmitter or a receiver... just press the ch','Plug the i2i Stream into your iPod(R) or any other MP3 player and transmit your music to your friends... wirelessly! Any i2i Stream unit can be used as a transmitter or a receiver... just press the channel button until the units are showing the same color and rock out! The 30-foot transmission range is the only limit to how many receivers can listen in to a single iPod. Includes 4 audio cables, 2 USB charge cables, and 2 lanyards. Requires any 3.5mm audio source and headphones for each listener. USB power required for recharging. Sold as a two-pack. Each listener requires one i2i Stream unit.','P24718.jpg','P24718a.jpg','P24718a.jpg','0.00','99.95','0.00','0.00','0','0','0.7','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('2226','324','190 0804','Rf Link 5.8ghz Audio/video Receiver','Digital/Multimedia Products>Digital A/V Solutions>Video Converters','y','0','139','0','',' ','The RF-Link wireless receiver acquires audio/video from another room in your house... without running wires! This additional receiver works with the transmitter (sold separately) attached to your cabl','The RF-Link wireless receiver acquires audio/video from another room in your house... without running wires! This additional receiver works with the transmitter (sold separately) attached to your cable box, DVD player, television or any other A/V source that outputs an A/V signal. Multiple receivers can all pick up the same video transmission. Includes composite video/audio cable and AC adapter.','P10950.jpg','P10950a.jpg','P10950a.jpg','0.00','67.21','0.00','0.00','0','0','1.35','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('2227','194','202 0113','Intellinet 802.11g Access Point, Poe Support','Networking>Wireless Networking (WiFi)>Wireless Routers','y','0','116','0','','wireless router,4 port router,802.11g,wireless network,access point','Intellinet&#39;s high-powered 802.11b/g wireless access point provides stronger connections for optimum network performance. It also has a built-in power extractor on an Ethernet port, allowing you to use','Intellinet&#39;s high-powered 802.11b/g wireless access point provides stronger connections for optimum network performance. It also has a built-in power extractor on an Ethernet port, allowing you to use a single CAT5 cable (and a PoE injector) to deliver both a data connection and electrical power. Includes antenna, CAT5 cable, stand, wall-mounting kit, AC adapter and software on CD-ROM. PoE use requires 802.3af-compliant power injector at the router end, not included.','P14757.jpg','P14757a.jpg','P14757a.jpg','0.00','86.93','0.00','0.00','0','0','1.9','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('2228','194','202 0115','Cradlepoint Phs Wireless Personal Hotspot Router','Networking>Wireless Networking (WiFi)>Wireless Routers','y','0','324','0','','router,cradlepoint,phs,wireless,personal,hotspot,wifi,router','Cradlepoint&#39;s battery-powered Personal Hotspot lets you set up a Wi-Fi router anywhere you can use a 3G cellular modem... you don&#39;t even need a power outlet! The router can keep multiple 802.11b/g com','Cradlepoint&#39;s battery-powered Personal Hotspot lets you set up a Wi-Fi router anywhere you can use a 3G cellular modem... you don&#39;t even need a power outlet! The router can keep multiple 802.11b/g computers connected to the Internet using a single EVDO device. With full security features and access controls, the Wi-Fi router can be used for field meetings, emergency situations, convention blogging, picnics, camping and more. Includes AC adapter. Requires compatible USB 3G cellular modem, or compatible ExpressCard modem and USB adapter. See the following compatibility list. Verizon Data Devices:  USB720, USB727, AC595U, UM150, V640, V740, KPC680 Verizon Cellular Phones: LG VX7200, VX8000, Motorola V3c RAZR, RIM Blackberry 8703e/8830 Sprint Data Devices: U720, U727, AC595U, EX720, Franklin CDU680 Sprint Cellular Phones: Samsung A920&amp;i830, Sanyo M1&amp;Katana 2, Motorola V3c RAZR, RIM Blackberry 8703e&amp;8830, LG Musiq Alltel Data Devices: KPC680 Some devices will require a firmware update. ExpressCard modems will require a USB adapter. Please note, does not support AC597E ExpressCards.','P20098.jpg','P20098a.jpg','P20098a.jpg','0.00','179.00','0.00','0.00','0','0','1','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
