 ('2231','194','202 0121','Belkin N1 Vision 4-pt Wireless Router','Networking>Wireless Networking (WiFi)>Wireless Routers','y','0','15','0','','belkin,802.11n,4port,4 port,4-port,wireless,router','The N1 Vision router&#39;s easy-to-read LCD tells you everything you need to know about how your wireless network is functioning. It reports broadband speed, bandwidth usage, device usage and all connecte','The N1 Vision router&#39;s easy-to-read LCD tells you everything you need to know about how your wireless network is functioning. It reports broadband speed, bandwidth usage, device usage and all connected users. Compliant with the draft 2.0 of the forthcoming 802.11n wireless standard, it provides up to 300Mbps data transfers or an operating range up to 1,600 feet. Simple setup instructions and built-in software make it easy to get up and running. Includes CAT5 cable and AC adapter. Requires Microsoft Windows 2000/XP/Vista or Mac OS 10.4 for setup. Note: Although Belkin has designed the N1 Vision to be upgradeable to the final 802.11n specification, it may not be possible.','P18559.jpg','P18559a.jpg','P18559a.jpg','0.00','145.00','0.00','0.00','0','0','2.5','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('2232','192','202 0122','Netgear Rangemax Next Wireless-n USB 2.0 Adapter','Networking>Wireless Networking (WiFi)>USB Wireless Adapters','y','0','370','0','','wireless,usb,wireless,rangemax,wireless-n,adapter','NETGEAR introduces the next generation of wireless networking with the RangeMax Next products based on the proposed 802.11n amendment. While not officially ratified, the current draft permits network','NETGEAR introduces the next generation of wireless networking with the RangeMax Next products based on the proposed 802.11n amendment. While not officially ratified, the current draft permits network transmission speeds up to 300Mbps... about 6 times faster than 802.11g. This throughput allows for multiple HD video streams, video conferencing, and heavy multiplayer gaming. Draft 802.11n also increases the range of wireless network products, using multiple antennas to reach twice the distance of the previous generation. Upgrade to 802.11n with NETGEAR&#39;s RangeMax Next USB Adapter, based on the proposed draft of the new amendment. By utilizing multiple micro-antennas, it provides greater speed and range over current 802.11g. Certified to be completely compatible with existing 802.11 products, the adapter works best when used with other NETGEAR RangeMax Next products. Includes USB cable, monitor mount and software on CD-ROM. Requires Microsoft Windows XP/Vista.','P18098.jpg','P18098a.jpg','P18098a.jpg','0.00','77.49','0.00','0.00','0','0','0.5','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('2233','385','202 0126','PCI 4x Sata Ii Ncq Controller Card, Raid 0/1/5/10','Computer Components>I/O &amp; Video Cards>Hard Drive Controllers/Raid Cards','y','0','101','0','','PCI,SATA,PCI raid,controller,raid,card','Configure and control up to 4 internal SATA drives with this PCI RAID card. Designed for SATA 3.0Gbps, it can support 4 independent drives or can combine them in RAID 0, 1, 5 or 1+0 configurations. Ev','Configure and control up to 4 internal SATA drives with this PCI RAID card. Designed for SATA 3.0Gbps, it can support 4 independent drives or can combine them in RAID 0, 1, 5 or 1+0 configurations. Even though SATA runs faster than the PCI interface, the controller card minimizes host overhead and host-to-device latency. It also supports the latest NCQ hard disks, improving efficiency, performance and drive lifespan. Includes drivers on CD-ROM. Requires Microsoft Windows NT/2000/XP/Server 2003 or Linux.','P24858.jpg','P24858a.jpg','P24858a.jpg','0.00','35.68','0.00','0.00','0','0','0.3','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('2234','425','202 0127','Dueladapter, Express Card 34 To PCMCIA Adapter','Mobile Computing &amp; Travel Products>Notebook Add-In Cards','y','0','372','0','','duel adapter,expresscard,express,card,to pcmcia,pc card','The DuelAdapter can accept any PC Card--16-bit or 32-bit--so that you can use it on your newer ExpressCard slot-equipped laptop. Particularly useful for cellular broadband access cards, the DuelAdapte','The DuelAdapter can accept any PC Card--16-bit or 32-bit--so that you can use it on your newer ExpressCard slot-equipped laptop. Particularly useful for cellular broadband access cards, the DuelAdapter also works with all Wi-Fi, A/V, and I/O PC Cards. Includes software on CD-ROM. Requires Microsoft Windows XP/Vista or Mac OS 10.4.8. Note: Vista driver available for download.','P18445.jpg','P18445a.jpg','P18445a.jpg','0.00','107.03','0.00','0.00','0','0','0.8','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('2235','434','202 0128','Tritton Sharenet 4 Port USB Network Hub/switch','Networking>Network Switches','y','0','20','0','','sharenet,network,hub,network,switch','Combining both an Ethernet switch and a USB 2.0 hub, the Tritton ShareNet makes attached USB devices available to computers on your local area network. Share up to 4 USB printers and external drives w','Combining both an Ethernet switch and a USB 2.0 hub, the Tritton ShareNet makes attached USB devices available to computers on your local area network. Share up to 4 USB printers and external drives with any connected PC. The USB ShareNet supports multilanguage, static IP and DHCP networking protocols and supports protected FTP and SMB file access. It also includes a 4-port 10/100Mbps switch for wired Ethernet connections to workstations or upstream networks. Includes Ethernet cable, AC adapter and software on MiniCD. Connecting computers require Microsoft Windows 98SE+.','P24819.jpg','P24819a.jpg','P24819a.jpg','0.00','89.01','0.00','0.00','0','0','1.4','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('2236','194','202 0131','Netgear Wireless-g Router, 4-port','Networking>Wireless Networking (WiFi)>Wireless Routers','y','0','370','0','','netgear,wireless,router,wireless-g,router,4port,4-port,router','NETGEAR&#39;s Wireless-G Router (WGR614) delivers a simple secure way to add wireless connection to your network at a great value. It makes sharing your cable/DSL connection with other PCs a snap. The WGR','NETGEAR&#39;s Wireless-G Router (WGR614) delivers a simple secure way to add wireless connection to your network at a great value. It makes sharing your cable/DSL connection with other PCs a snap. The WGR614 features double firewall protection to help shield the network from intrusions with two security methods. And, NETGEAR&#39;s Smart Wizard installation software makes setup easy.','P18801.jpg','P18801a.jpg','P18801a.jpg','0.00','45.96','0.00','0.00','0','0','1.55','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('2237','250','202 0133','Netgear Rangemax Next Wireless-n PCI Adapter','Computer Components>I/O &amp; Video Cards>Network I/O Cards (NIC)','y','0','370','0','','wireless-n,rangemax,wireless,pci,adapter,802.11n','Get your desktop PC up to 802.11n speeds with NETGEAR&#39;s RangeMax NEXT PCI adapter. Providing up to 6 times the speed of 802.11g devices, this Wi-Fi-certified adapter delivers tomorrow&#39;s performance to','Get your desktop PC up to 802.11n speeds with NETGEAR&#39;s RangeMax NEXT PCI adapter. Providing up to 6 times the speed of 802.11g devices, this Wi-Fi-certified adapter delivers tomorrow&#39;s performance today. Completely compatible with existing 802.11b/g networks, it works best when used with other NETGEAR RangeMax NEXT products. NETGEAR introduces the next generation of wireless networking with the RangeMax Next products based on the proposed 802.11n amendment. While not officially ratified, the current draft permits network transmission speeds up to 300Mbps... about 6 times faster than 802.11g. This throughput allows for multiple HD video streams, video conferencing, and heavy multiplayer gaming. Draft 802.11n also increases the range of wireless network products, using multiple antennas to reach twice the distance of the previous generation. Requires Microsoft Windows 2000 SP4/XP/Vista and available PCI slot.','P18799.jpg','P18799a.jpg','P18799a.jpg','0.00','78.49','0.00','0.00','0','0','1','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('2238','194','202 0134','Netgear Rangemax Wireless Router','Networking>Wireless Networking (WiFi)>Wireless Routers','y','0','370','0','','netgear,rangemax,range max,wireless,router,wifi,wi fi,router','The RangeMax router constantly adjusts signals to maximize your Wi-Fi connections. When connected to a broadband modem, the router can turn your entire house into an Internet hot spot. The RangeMax ro','The RangeMax router constantly adjusts signals to maximize your Wi-Fi connections. When connected to a broadband modem, the router can turn your entire house into an Internet hot spot. The RangeMax router includes multiple security features to protect from snoopers and also features parental controls such as Web filtering and use limits. It also can manage your wired Ethernet network with a 4-port 10/100 switch. NETGEAR&#39;s RangeMax MIMO (Multiple-In, Multiple-Out) technology provides Wi-Fi transfer rates up to 108Mbps at 10 times the range over 802.11g. The base access points actively use 7 internal antennas to overcome interference and physical barriers in your home. The RangeMax router and access point work best when used with corresponding RangeMax adapters, but are compatible with--even able to boost the performance of--standard 802.11b/g devices.','P18802.jpg','P18802a.jpg','P18802a.jpg','0.00','78.49','0.00','0.00','0','0','1','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('2239','434','202 0135','Netgear Dsl/cable 4-port 10/100 Router','Networking>Network Switches','y','0','370','0','','netgear,net gear,network,web,safe,router,dsl,cable,4port,4-port,4 port,router','The Web Safe Router is perfect for sharing one broadband connection to several computers on your home network. The router features double firewall protection that helps shield the network with two sec','The Web Safe Router is perfect for sharing one broadband connection to several computers on your home network. The router features double firewall protection that helps shield the network with two security methods, Network Address Translation (NAT) and Stateful Packet Inspection (SPI). Installation is a snap, thanks to a unique setup CD that automatically detects and configures all necessary settings. Requires broadband (cable, DSL) Internet service and modem, not included.','P18798.jpg','P18798a.jpg','P18798a.jpg','0.00','41.40','0.00','0.00','0','0','1.35','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('2240','433','202 0136','Silex 10/100 Ethernet Serial Device Server','Networking>Network Print/Device Servers','y','0','373','0','','ethernet,network,10/100mbit,serial,device,server','Connect serial devices--such as barcode printers, scales, medical instrumentation--to your network with a silex serial device server. Access and manage the connected device over an 10/100Mbps Ethernet','Connect serial devices--such as barcode printers, scales, medical instrumentation--to your network with a silex serial device server. Access and manage the connected device over an 10/100Mbps Ethernet network. The included software emulates a standard Windows COM port, allowing existing applications to run without modification. Comprehensive TCP/IP protocol stacks and extensive management tools make it easy to connect multiple serial device servers to your network. Includes AC adapter and software on CD-ROM. Requires Microsoft Windows 98SE/Me/2000/XP.','P20358.jpg','P20358a.jpg','P20358a.jpg','0.00','128.15','0.00','0.00','0','0','1.95','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y');
insert into `z_products` values('2241','433','202 0137','Silex Pocketpro 100s, 10/100 Parallel Print Server','Networking>Network Print/Device Servers','y','0','373','0','','print server,mini,server,parallel,print,server','The silex PocketPro 100S is a high-performance compact print server that plugs directly into the parallel port of any parallel printer. It supports and senses both 10 and 100Mbps network connections.','The silex PocketPro 100S is a high-performance compact print server that plugs directly into the parallel port of any parallel printer. It supports and senses both 10 and 100Mbps network connections. Easy-to-use, the PocketPro is suitable for all popular computer and network operating systems. While ready to use right out of the box, the PocketPro includes extensive utility software and on-board diagnostics for advanced configuration.  The PocketPro is easy to manage with comprehensive management utilities, and it is also compatible with industry standards like HP JetAdmin. Its Open Management Architecture provides the ability to monitor printers at any management level with ease and versatility, no matter what your network. The PocketPro management capabilities includes Silex ExtendView Utilities--Utilities for extensive and easy-to-use configuration and management capabilities. An advantage of ExtendView is its ability to configure and upgrade multiple print servers simultaneously. ExtendView also displays system, network and printer status information via SNMP traps. Designed for TCP/IP, NDS (snaps into Novell NWAdmin), NetWare and UNIX (Linux 2.0.34, Solaris 2.6, SunOS 4.1.3, HPUX 10.20) NetworkAlert Utilities assist in managing network printers by alerting you of printer problems via SNMP traps. Integrates into ExtendView for advanced diagnostic and configuration information. Compatibility with any SNMP-based network management software (for example, HP OpenView, IBM NetView and Sun SunNet Manager) Private MIB LAN Administration Tool support XAdmin32 and XAdmin compatible with legacy silex print server administration utilities WebXAdmin server configuration and management.HP JetAdmin and Web JetAdmin. Novell ManageWise command line interface accessible via TELNET and NetWare If you require high levels of security, the PocketPro is one of the best solutions for secure network printing. It is one of the few print servers that supports the 802.1X authentication protocol, including EAP-TLS, EAP-TTLS, EAP-FAST, PEAP, and LEAP. It also lets you encrypt your printing jobs using Triple DES, AES, or Twofish via a Windows-compatible port monitor. In addition, the SX-2933 provides IP access control list security, which allows you to restrict access to the printer based on the IP address of the sending computer. The PocketPro can increase productivity by shortening print waiting times. IT managers can avoid buying a faster printer by fully utilizing their existing printer speeds. When it comes to printing graphics documents, with a throughput of nearly one megabyte per second, the PocketPro 100S can handle the toughest jobs in the shortest amount of time. The SX-2933 also supports numerous features for configuration flexibility, ease of use, and diagnostic LEDs to indicate power-on, link, activity. Text-to-PostScript conversion on a per-service basis Programmable character string conversion and Communications Protocol or can be forced into binary mode).On-line HELP with sophisticated diagnostics, including protocol trace capability and crash dump. Flash memory allows for easy upgrades via TCP/IP Windows Update Utility, XAdmin, tftp master or slave mode, BOOTP, NetWare, and DEC MOP.','P20359.jpg','P20359a.jpg','P20359a.jpg','0.00','154.54','0.00','0.00','0','0','1.3','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('2242','433','202 0139','Silex 802.11b/g Serial Device Server','Networking>Network Print/Device Servers','y','0','373','0','','11b,11g,serial,device,server','Connect serial devices--such as barcode printers, scales, medical instrumentation--to your network with a silex serial device server. Access and manage the connected device over either an 10/100Mbps E','Connect serial devices--such as barcode printers, scales, medical instrumentation--to your network with a silex serial device server. Access and manage the connected device over either an 10/100Mbps Ethernet network or a wireless 802.11b/g network. The included software emulates a standard Windows COM port, allowing existing applications to run without modification. Comprehensive TCP/IP protocol stacks and extensive management tools make it easy to connect multiple serial device servers to your network. Includes AC adapter and software on CD-ROM. Requires Microsoft Windows 98SE/Me/2000/XP.','P20398.jpg','P20398a.jpg','P20398a.jpg','0.00','229.00','0.00','0.00','0','0','2','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('2243','436','202 0140','Silex Ipv4 To Ipv6 Ethernet Converter','Networking>POE &amp; Transceivers','y','0','373','0','','ipV4,ipV6,ethernet,converter','If your organization is preparing for the oncoming IPv4 crunch, you might already have IPv6 devices installed in your network. The silex IPv6 converter ensures that your older IPv4 devices will be com','If your organization is preparing for the oncoming IPv4 crunch, you might already have IPv6 devices installed in your network. The silex IPv6 converter ensures that your older IPv4 devices will be compatible with your current and future TCP/IP network. Set up to 1,000 IPv4 devices to communicate to a mixed or pure IPv6 network. Includes AC adapter.','P20438.jpg','P20438a.jpg','P20438a.jpg','0.00','154.00','0.00','0.00','0','0','0.7','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('2244','193','202 0153','2.4ghz Square Grid Parabolic Antenna, 24dbi','Networking>Wireless Networking (WiFi)>Wireless Antennas','y','0','376','0','','wifi antenna,wi-fi antenna,wireless network antenna,wireless antenna','This outdoor long-range antenna is perfect for extending a Wi-Fi signal between two distant buildings. The 24dBi gain combined with the square-grid design gives this antenna an astonishing 6.2 mile ra','This outdoor long-range antenna is perfect for extending a Wi-Fi signal between two distant buildings. The 24dBi gain combined with the square-grid design gives this antenna an astonishing 6.2 mile range! It features a durable steel construction that provides excellent weather and wind resistance. Includes mounting hardware for attaching to a pole or building. Requires antenna cable with N-type male connector. For outdoor use only. Operation may not be legal in all jurisdictions.','P24508.jpg','P24508a.jpg','P24508a.jpg','0.00','54.70','0.00','0.00','0','0','10.5','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('2245','193','202 0156','2.4ghz 5 DBi Antenna Mage Base, Rp Sma M','Networking>Wireless Networking (WiFi)>Wireless Antennas','y','0','376','0','','wireless,router,2.4ghz,gain,antenna','Increase the range and reliability of your wireless router or access card with a 5dBi gain antenna designed for the 2.4GHz frequency range. The magnetic base allows you to easily affix the antenna to','Increase the range and reliability of your wireless router or access card with a 5dBi gain antenna designed for the 2.4GHz frequency range. The magnetic base allows you to easily affix the antenna to any ferrous surface, so it is particular useful when used on the road. The RSMA connector works with many access points and cards, and adapters (not included) allow it to work with more. Operation may not be legal in all jurisdictions.','P24511.jpg','P24511a.jpg','P24511a.jpg','0.00','12.71','0.00','0.00','0','0','0.5','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('2246','276','202 0158','Visiontek Radeon HD 4870 512mb PCI-e Video Card','Computer Components>I/O &amp; Video Cards>Video Cards','y','0','487','0','',' ','With 956 million transistors and support for top-of-the line HDMI displays, the Radeon HD 4870 delivers high-end cinematic graphics performance at a mid-level price. Able to crank out intense high-fra','With 956 million transistors and support for top-of-the line HDMI displays, the Radeon HD 4870 delivers high-end cinematic graphics performance at a mid-level price. Able to crank out intense high-frame rate video for dual digital displays (up to 2560x1600 each), it sets the standard for HD gaming or video playback. It supports HDMI along with DVI, VGA, composite, component and S-video. For ultimate power, use a second HD 4870 card and an ATI CrossFireX-ready motherboard. Includes CrossFireX bridge, double Molex to PCI-e power adapter, DVI to VGA adapter, DVI to HDMI adapter, S-video to composite adapter and S-video to component adapter. Requires PCIe-based PC with available x16 graphics slot, 500W power supply with two 75W 6-pin PCIe connectors and 1GB RAM.','P28698.jpg','P28698a.jpg','P28698a.jpg','0.00','209.00','0.00','0.00','0','0','2.7','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('2247','343','202 0167','Ziotek Universal 5-in-1 USB And CAT5e Cable Kit','Cables &amp; Adapters>Adapters &amp; Couplers>USB Adapters','y','0','2','0','','usb adapter kit,networking adapter kit,cable kit,network kit,connector kit','Instead of four USB cables and a network cable, just carry a single 5-in-1 QuickConnect cable! You can swap the tips of the cable to morph it into nearly any USB cable... and also a CAT5e cable for gi','Instead of four USB cables and a network cable, just carry a single 5-in-1 QuickConnect cable! You can swap the tips of the cable to morph it into nearly any USB cable... and also a CAT5e cable for gigabit Ethernet! Connect your computer to a hub, a printer, disk drive, camera, PDA and more; or connect your PDA or smart phone to other USB On-The-Go devices. A bonus 18 cable supplements the main 6 ft. cable for even more connection options.','P13597.jpg','P13597a.jpg','P13597a.jpg','0.00','13.77','0.00','0.00','0','0','1','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('2248','343','202 0181','Gigabit USB2.0 To Ethernet Adapter','Cables &amp; Adapters>Adapters &amp; Couplers>USB Adapters','y','0','17','0','','gigibit,ethernet adapter,network adapter','Connect your desktop or laptop computer to your Gigabit Ethernet network through a USB 2.0 port. There&#39;s no need to puchase a gigabit network card or use a PC Card slot. Just plug the adapter to an ex','Connect your desktop or laptop computer to your Gigabit Ethernet network through a USB 2.0 port. There&#39;s no need to puchase a gigabit network card or use a PC Card slot. Just plug the adapter to an existing USB 2.0 port and get connected! Requires P3 800MHz or faster PC with Microsoft Windows Me/2000/XP/Vista; backwardly compatible with USB 1.0/1.1 but data transfer speeds will be reduced.','P12715.jpg','P12715a.jpg','P12715a.jpg','0.00','35.44','0.00','0.00','0','0','0.2','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('2249','371','202 0196','USB 2.0 Host To Host Link Adapter, Uc250','Cables &amp; Adapters>USB 2.0 Cables','y','0','17','0','','usb,usb cable,usb adapter','The USB 2.0 host-to-host link adapter is your solution for peer-to-peer file sharing via USB port. This USB 2.0 adapter offers up to 40 times the speed of similar USB 1.1 products and is suitable for','The USB 2.0 host-to-host link adapter is your solution for peer-to-peer file sharing via USB port. This USB 2.0 adapter offers up to 40 times the speed of similar USB 1.1 products and is suitable for small- and home-office users, mobile PC and most PC environments. Includes PC-Linq file transfer software that resembles the Windows Explorer interface, for easy file creation and drag- and-drop file transfer.','P5016.jpg','P5016a.jpg','P5016a.jpg','0.00','16.91','0.00','0.00','0','0','0.4','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('2250','371','202 0199','USB 2.0 Host To Host Link Adapter, For Vista/xp','Cables &amp; Adapters>USB 2.0 Cables','y','0','17','0','','usb,host to host,link adapter,vista/a/xp','Specifically designed for Microsoft Windows Vista, this link adapter lets you migrate files and settings between an existing XP/Vista PC and a Vista machine. Utilizing the Windows Easy Transfer featur','Specifically designed for Microsoft Windows Vista, this link adapter lets you migrate files and settings between an existing XP/Vista PC and a Vista machine. Utilizing the Windows Easy Transfer feature in Vista, it lets you transfer user accounts, files and program settings without having to transfer files to intermediary storage devices. Requires Microsoft Windows Vista on one PC and either XP or Vista on the other. Includes software on CD-ROM.','P21419.jpg','P21419a.jpg','P21419a.jpg','0.00','16.50','0.00','0.00','0','0','0.25','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('2251','371','202 0200','Belkin Windows Vista USB File Transfer Cable, 8ft.','Cables &amp; Adapters>USB 2.0 Cables','y','0','15','0','','Vista,usb,file,transfer,cable','Specifically designed for Microsoft Windows Vista, this link adapter lets you migrate files and settings between an existing XP/Vista PC and a new Vista machine. Utilizing the new Windows Easy Transfe','Specifically designed for Microsoft Windows Vista, this link adapter lets you migrate files and settings between an existing XP/Vista PC and a new Vista machine. Utilizing the new Windows Easy Transfer feature in Vista, it lets you transfer user accounts, files and program settings without having to transfer files to intermediary storage devices. Requires Microsoft Windows Vista. Includes software on CD-ROM.','P23880.jpg','P23880a.jpg','P23880a.jpg','0.00','35.49','0.00','0.00','0','0','0.4','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('2252','341','202 0258','Ide To Serial Ata Converter W/ Cables','Cables &amp; Adapters>Adapters &amp; Couplers>IDE/ATA/SATA Adapters','y','0','2','0','','serial,ata,sata,serial ata adapter,adapter,hd adapter','Convert older ATA/ATAPI (IDE) hard drives to the newer Serial ATA (SATA) interface standard with this simple adapter. Includes 18 SATA data cable and 4-pin Molex power cable. Please note that','Convert older ATA/ATAPI (IDE) hard drives to the newer Serial ATA (SATA) interface standard with this simple adapter. Includes 18 SATA data cable and 4-pin Molex power cable. Please note that this adapter does not support IDE CD or DVD drives. It is also not compatible with Intel-based systems (such as Dell and Compaq) that use the ICH5 or ICH6/6R SATA controller.','P4668.jpg','P4668a.jpg','P4668a.jpg','0.00','18.75','0.00','0.00','0','0','0.28','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
