 ('2266','442','202 5271','Connectgear 24 Port 10/100 Fast Ethernet Switch','Networking>Rack Mount Products>Rack Mount Switches','y','0','9','0','','rack,mount,24,port,network,10/100,switch','ConnectGear&#39;s 24-port 100BASET-TX Ethernet switch is thin enough to mount in just a single unit on a 19-inch rack. It supports auto negotiation and MDI/MDI-X on all ports to allow both 10Mbps and 100M','ConnectGear&#39;s 24-port 100BASET-TX Ethernet switch is thin enough to mount in just a single unit on a 19-inch rack. It supports auto negotiation and MDI/MDI-X on all ports to allow both 10Mbps and 100Mbps devices to co-exist on the same network without the need for special cables. Includes mounting hardware and power cord. Requires Ethernet cables, not included.','P25021.jpg','P25021a.jpg','P25021a.jpg','0.00','85.08','0.00','0.00','0','0','5.7','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('2267','88','202 5277','Network Pair Splitter, 10/100, 2-pack','Cables &amp; Adapters>Adapters &amp; Couplers>Network Line Splitters','y','0','1','0','','line splitter,100base splitter,rj45 splitter,2025275,202 5275','Our popular Y splitters let you connect 2 computers to 2 switch ports on your switch or hub through a single patch cable. This is accomplished by utilizing two pairs of wires in standard network cable','Our popular Y splitters let you connect 2 computers to 2 switch ports on your switch or hub through a single patch cable. This is accomplished by utilizing two pairs of wires in standard network cable that are unused by 10/100 Ethernet. It&#39;s like doubling a network connection without pulling a new cable! Used in pairs, one adapter combines two data signals at the wall jack; both signals are carried through one network cable and a second adapter separates the signals allowing two connections at your hub or switch.','P6405.jpg','P6405a.jpg','P6405a.jpg','0.00','16.78','0.00','0.00','0','0','0.2','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
