 ('2281','433','202 5442','1 Port USB 10/100 Mbps Print Server','Networking>Network Print/Device Servers','y','0','9','0','','print server,usb print server','This single-port USB print server eliminates the need to route print jobs through desktop PCs; instead, it converts the printer into a standalone device on your local area network. Compatible with mos','This single-port USB print server eliminates the need to route print jobs through desktop PCs; instead, it converts the printer into a standalone device on your local area network. Compatible with most network protocols and operating systems, the server also supports Internet Printing Protocol, allowing you to send print jobs from anywhere on the Internet. Includes AC adapter and software on CD-ROM. Requires USB printer and cable, and Ethernet network RJ-45 cable. Supports Windows NT/98/Me/2000/XP, Mac OS 8.0+, NetWare 3.12+ and UNIX/Linux (LPR).','P13691.jpg','P13691a.jpg','P13691a.jpg','0.00','44.86','0.00','0.00','0','0','1.09','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('2282','433','202 5447','Iogear USB 2.0 Print Server, 1-port Gpsu21','Networking>Network Print/Device Servers','y','0','8','0','','print server,iogear,usb print server','Connect your USB printer to your network through IOGEAR&#39;s palm sized 1-port USB 2.0 Print Server and you can print from any computer on your LAN/WAN. The print server integrates Internet Printing Prot','Connect your USB printer to your network through IOGEAR&#39;s palm sized 1-port USB 2.0 Print Server and you can print from any computer on your LAN/WAN. The print server integrates Internet Printing Protocol (IPP) to even allow users to print over the Internet by specifying the device&#39;s URL. Includes web management features which allow users to configure, monitor and even reset the print server via a web browser. Print jobs can be sent to a printer in another country just as easily as to a printer in the same office. Don&#39;t send a degraded fax image when you can print an original right at the destination! Includes USB 2.0 print server, CAT5 patch cable, AC adapter, installation CD and user&#39;s manual. Requires Microsoft Windows 98SE/Me/2000/XP/2003 or Mac OS 9.22+ or Unix/Linux for configuration.','P13812.jpg','P13812a.jpg','P13812a.jpg','0.00','43.07','0.00','0.00','0','0','1.85','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
