 ('2284','435','202 5641','Hawking Hi-gain Wireless-g PC Card','Networking>Notebook Networking','y','0','371','0','',' ','Featuring an advanced directional 6 dBi high-gain antenna that delivers a strong concentrated signal in a directed beam, the Hawking Technology PC Card can extend your laptop&#39;s wireless operating dist','Featuring an advanced directional 6 dBi high-gain antenna that delivers a strong concentrated signal in a directed beam, the Hawking Technology PC Card can extend your laptop&#39;s wireless operating distance by as much as 200%. Unlike standard omni-directional Cardbus cards, the directional antenna reduces interference from metal components inside the laptop itself, helping to establish a stronger, more reliable Wi-Fi link. When not in use, the antenna flips down for compact transport.','P9762.jpg','P9762a.jpg','P9762a.jpg','0.00','52.49','0.00','0.00','0','0','0.69','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('2285','436','202 5658','D-link Power Over Ethernet Adapter, Dwl-p200','Networking>POE &amp; Transceivers','y','0','317','0','','dlink,d-link,power over net,power net,power adapter','The power-over-Ethernet (PoE) adapter uses a single Ethernet cable to deliver both data and power to remote network devices like Wi-Fi access points and Internet cameras. Sending DC power over the sam','The power-over-Ethernet (PoE) adapter uses a single Ethernet cable to deliver both data and power to remote network devices like Wi-Fi access points and Internet cameras. Sending DC power over the same CAT5 cable as your data, eliminates the need to locate your Ethernet-enabled devices near an electrical outlet or to run long, expensive power extension cords to them. Includes: DWL-P200 Base Unit, DWL-P200 Terminal Unit, 24 CAT5 cable, 2 power cords and AC adapter.','P10322.jpg','P10322a.jpg','P10322a.jpg','0.00','37.07','0.00','0.00','0','0','1.72','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
