 ('2303','194','202 5785','D-link Xtreme N Gigabit Router','Networking>Wireless Networking (WiFi)>Wireless Routers','y','0','317','0','',' ','One of the fastest routers made to date, D-Link&#39;s Xtreme N Gigabit Router supports wireless transfers up to 14 times faster than 802.11g. Although still in draft, the 802.11n standard significantly in','One of the fastest routers made to date, D-Link&#39;s Xtreme N Gigabit Router supports wireless transfers up to 14 times faster than 802.11g. Although still in draft, the 802.11n standard significantly increases wireless speeds, distance and power. You&#39;ll even experience faster transfers when you use this router with your existing 802.11g equipment. This router also includes a 4-port 10/100/1000 gigabit switch for extra-fast wired transfers to PCs or upstream routers. A USB port allows you to connect USB printers or hard drives for sharing across the network. A full host of web-managed security and firewall features make it one of the most secure routers too. Includes 3 antennas, CAT5 cable, AC adapter and CD-ROM with software. Requires ADSL/cable modem, not included. Administration requires Microsoft Windows XP/Vista or Mac OS 10.4+. For optimal performance, use with D-Link Xtreme N wireless adapters.','P29458.jpg','P29458a.jpg','P29458a.jpg','0.00','125.00','0.00','0.00','0','0','2.1','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('2304','250','202 5786','D-link Xtreme N PCI-e Desktop Adapter','Computer Components>I/O &amp; Video Cards>Network I/O Cards (NIC)','y','0','317','0','',' ','Take advantage of future 802.11n capabilities today with D-Link&#39;s Xtreme N PCI-e Adapter, based on the current draft of the new amendment. By utilizing multiple micro-antennas, it provides greater spe','Take advantage of future 802.11n capabilities today with D-Link&#39;s Xtreme N PCI-e Adapter, based on the current draft of the new amendment. By utilizing multiple micro-antennas, it provides greater speed and range over current 802.11g. Certified to be completely compatible with existing 802.11g products, the adapter works best when used with other D-Link Extreme N products.','P29459.jpg','P29459a.jpg','P29459a.jpg','0.00','78.95','0.00','0.00','0','0','0.7','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
