 ('2306','408','204 0102','Logisys 3.5in Bay Card Reader/Writer, Black','Input Devices>Memory Card Readers','y','0','385','0','','card reader,52to1 card reader,flash reader','Enhance your PC with a 4-slot card reader capable of accessing most currently available flash media cards. It fits into a 3.5 drive bay of most desktop computers. A USB 2.0 port provides a convenient','Enhance your PC with a 4-slot card reader capable of accessing most currently available flash media cards. It fits into a 3.5 drive bay of most desktop computers. A USB 2.0 port provides a convenient place to connect a thumb drive. Includes mounting screws and changeable black and beige face plates. Memory cards not included.','P16090.jpg','P16090a.jpg','P16090a.jpg','0.00','9.34','0.00','0.00','0','0','1.5','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('2307','388','204 0108','Modosteady, 3-in-1 Camcorder Stabilizer','Digital/Multimedia Products>Camera &amp; Photo Accessories','y','0','386','0','','3in1,camcorder,stabilizer,stand','As a counterbalance stabilizer the Modosteady will make your camcorder seem to float as you move along to follow the action you&#39;re shooting. It makes your camcorder react slowly to your motion so your','As a counterbalance stabilizer the Modosteady will make your camcorder seem to float as you move along to follow the action you&#39;re shooting. It makes your camcorder react slowly to your motion so your video recording is steady and smooth. As the action speeds up, switch to the shoulder brace and take aim. You&#39;ll get great support, but its easy to follow fast paced action. Finally pull the cap off the end of the handle, the handle splits to become the three legs of a table-top tripod.The bottom rubber foot adjusts to counterbalance the precise center gravity of your camcorder','P20040.jpg','P20040a.jpg','P20040a.jpg','0.00','136.56','0.00','0.00','0','0','1.32','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y');
insert into `z_products` values('2308','11','204 0113','Pqi Micro SD Card With SD Adapter, 2gb','Media>Flash Memory Cards','y','0','388','0','','micro sd,sd,sd memory,sd card,sd memory card,sd flash card,sd flash memory,micro sd memory,micro sd card,micro sd memory card,micro sd flash card,micro sd flash memory','microSD cards were originally called T-Flash and then TransFlash before being standardized as microSD by the SD Card Association (SDA). The microSD card is essentially an SD card, but in a smaller pac','microSD cards were originally called T-Flash and then TransFlash before being standardized as microSD by the SD Card Association (SDA). The microSD card is essentially an SD card, but in a smaller package... about the size of a fingernail. One of the smallest removable flash memory card formats, it can be used to store various types of files, including photos, videos, music, or software.','P15732.jpg','P15732a.jpg','P15732a.jpg','0.00','8.99','0.00','0.00','0','0','0.12','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
