 ('2327','308','204 0502','PC Post Card Tester, Isa/PCI Slot, V.3.2','Tools &amp; Testers>PC Troubleshooting','y','0','394','0','','card tester,pc post,isa/pci tester,pc troubleshooting,pc testing,component testing,technician testing,computer testing','Power down your PC, insert the POST (Power On Self Test) code tester into an ISA or PCI slot and then monitor the LED display as your computer boots up. That&#39;s all there is to it. LEDs will display if','Power down your PC, insert the POST (Power On Self Test) code tester into an ISA or PCI slot and then monitor the LED display as your computer boots up. That&#39;s all there is to it. LEDs will display if and how well your power supply is operating, then a series of codes will appear on the tester display as your computers BIOS performs its self test. Includes tester, remote display with 24 cable and comprehensive POST code table with error descriptions.','P12691.jpg','P12691a.jpg','P12691a.jpg','0.00','20.34','0.00','0.00','0','0','0.35','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('2328','308','204 0503','Micro PC Post Tester, PCI Slot, V5.0','Tools &amp; Testers>PC Troubleshooting','y','0','394','0','','pc troubleshooting,pc testing,component testing,technician testing,computer testing','What do you do when your computer just won&#39;t boot? You could spend hours troubleshooting each component in a long trial and error process. Or you could use a convenient POST code tester and root out t','What do you do when your computer just won&#39;t boot? You could spend hours troubleshooting each component in a long trial and error process. Or you could use a convenient POST code tester and root out the problem right away. Simply plug the card in and power up the machine. Within seconds, a numerical code will be given that refers to a specific hardware issue. Know thy defective components and replace only what you must!','P12692.jpg','P12692a.jpg','P12692a.jpg','0.00','12.71','0.00','0.00','0','0','1.5','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
