 ('2331','137','204 0517','Intellinet Network Ip Camera, Mpeg4, Low-light','Security Products>Surveillance Cameras','y','0','116','0','','ip camera,security camera,surveillance camera,mpeg camera','Pro Series camera delivers MPEG4 streaming at resolutions up to 720x480. Connects to any 10/100Mbps Ethernet network. Supports low-light conditions (minimum 0.1 lux) and includes 3.5mm ports for audio','Pro Series camera delivers MPEG4 streaming at resolutions up to 720x480. Connects to any 10/100Mbps Ethernet network. Supports low-light conditions (minimum 0.1 lux) and includes 3.5mm ports for audio recording or playback. The network IP camera uses an embedded operating system to stream live video to any computer on your network or the Internet. Just type the camera&#39;s IP address in your browser to view live, full-motion video: no additional software to install. Place the camera anywhere you have a network connection. Program the camera to automatically send images or video clips to an FTP site or an e-mail address. Includes mounting stand, serial cable, AC adapter and software on CD-ROM. Requires PC with 9-pin serial port and Microsoft Windows 2000/XP or Mac OS X+ for direct connection. Supports ActiveX and Java browsers.','P14740.jpg','P14740a.jpg','P14740a.jpg','0.00','432.40','0.00','0.00','0','0','2.5','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
