 ('2367','11','204 0753','SD/ To IDE Adapter','Media>Flash Memory Cards','y','0','101','0','','sd,mmc,ide,adapter','The SD to IDE Adapter is designed to enable Secure Digital (or MultiMediaCard) media to be used as a direct replacement for an ATA/ATAPI hard drive. With a low-powered and shock-resistant SD card, you','The SD to IDE Adapter is designed to enable Secure Digital (or MultiMediaCard) media to be used as a direct replacement for an ATA/ATAPI hard drive. With a low-powered and shock-resistant SD card, you can use it in any device that accepts an IDE drive. Once installed, the flash card appears like an ordinary hard drive to any operating system and can even be configured as a boot device. Flash media card not included.','P24839.jpg','P24839a.jpg','P24839a.jpg','0.00','12.48','0.00','0.00','0','0','0.2','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('2368','324','204 0757','Ion Audio Vcr2PC Vhs USB Video Interface','Digital/Multimedia Products>Digital A/V Solutions>Video Converters','y','0','153','0','','vhs,usb,video,converter,interface','Rescue your precious home VHS movies before they degrade or get lost with the VCR 2 PC digital video tape converter. From the makers of the USB Turntable, this VHS player uses a single USB cable to tr','Rescue your precious home VHS movies before they degrade or get lost with the VCR 2 PC digital video tape converter. From the makers of the USB Turntable, this VHS player uses a single USB cable to transfer all of your favorite home videos straight to your PC! The included EZ VHS Converter software lets you burn your videos to DVD, or watch them on your PSP, iPod or laptop computer. Exported MPEG4 videos can even be e-mailed or transferred to your cell phone! The VCR 2 TV also can accept and digitize analog video from other video players, camcorders and more. Includes USB cable and software on CD-ROM. Requires 2.0GHz PC with 7+ GB hard disk space and Microsoft Windows XP/Vista. 64-bit versions of Windows not supported. DVD recording requires appropriate hardware and discs.','P25078.jpg','P25078a.jpg','P25078a.jpg','0.00','162.84','0.00','0.00','0','0','11.45','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('2369','322','204 0759','Mandylion Password Manager, Cradle And Token','Digital/Multimedia Products>USB Gadgets','y','0','409','0','',' ','Today&#39;s passwords need to be so complex, you can&#39;t remember them. The patented Mandylion Password Manager can generate and remember up to 50 cryptographically strong passwords... and it clips to your','Today&#39;s passwords need to be so complex, you can&#39;t remember them. The patented Mandylion Password Manager can generate and remember up to 50 cryptographically strong passwords... and it clips to your key chain. The passwords are stored on the token--not your computer--so nobody can access them when you&#39;re not around. Just connect the token to its cradle when it&#39;s time to enter your passwords. The password generator uses a motion sensor to feed its random character generator. Each token can be customized and pre-configured on behalf of the user or class of users via an intuitive configuration utility. Works with any website, LAN or desktop login.','P25098.jpg','P25098a.jpg','P25098a.jpg','0.00','45.33','0.00','0.00','0','0','0.65','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
