 ('2371','388','204 0762','Extra Quick-release Clip For Gorillapod Slr','Digital/Multimedia Products>Camera &amp; Photo Accessories','y','0','398','0','','quick,release,gorillapod,clip,camera,clip','Quickly swap your Gorillapod SLR (sold separately) between multiple cameras by mounting a quick-release mount onto each.','Quickly swap your Gorillapod SLR (sold separately) between multiple cameras by mounting a quick-release mount onto each.','P19860.jpg','P19860a.jpg','P19860a.jpg','0.00','3.93','0.00','0.00','0','0','0.05','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('2372','388','204 0763','Flash Clip For Gorillapod Slr','Digital/Multimedia Products>Camera &amp; Photo Accessories','y','0','398','0','','quick,release,gorillapod,flash clip,camera,clip','Use the Flash Clip to attach your remote flash to the Gorillapod SLR (sold separately) to get great lighting anywhere.','Use the Flash Clip to attach your remote flash to the Gorillapod SLR (sold separately) to get great lighting anywhere.','P19861.jpg','P19861a.jpg','P19861a.jpg','0.00','3.69','0.00','0.00','0','0','0.05','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('2373','31','204 0766','Ion U-record USB Music Archive System','Digital/Multimedia Products>Digital A/V Solutions>Audio Processors','y','0','153','0','','131-0632,131 0632,131+0632,ion,recorder,record,recorder,music,archive,system','The ION U-Record Music Archiver can be used with any USB-equipped computer to convert analog audio from nearly any source into convenient digital files. You can save your converted audio as MP3 files','The ION U-Record Music Archiver can be used with any USB-equipped computer to convert analog audio from nearly any source into convenient digital files. You can save your converted audio as MP3 files on disk or directly to Apple iTunes(R). The U-Record connects between your PC and an analog audio source like a TV, VCR, tape deck, reel-to-reel, phonograph, radio...even a microphone. Just plug it in and you&#39;re ready to capture your music! Includes digitization software and a USB cable. Requires analog audio source, RCA audio cables and Microsoft Windows XP/Vista or Mac OS 10.4+','P22461.jpg','P22461a.jpg','P22461a.jpg','0.00','43.69','0.00','0.00','0','0','1.15','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('2374','31','204 0768','Ion USB Turntable W/ Ipod Docking','Digital/Multimedia Products>Digital A/V Solutions>Audio Processors','y','0','153','0','','ipod,dock,ion,usb,turntable,ipod,dock','Transfer your vinyl albums&#39;music tracks directly to your iPod(R) with the LPDock turntable! It digitizes 33 and 45 rpm records and saves the music files on your iPod classic, iPod mini or iPod nano.','Transfer your vinyl albums&#39;music tracks directly to your iPod(R) with the LPDock turntable! It digitizes 33 and 45 rpm records and saves the music files on your iPod classic, iPod mini or iPod nano. Edit and clean up the recorded files using the included software. The turntable can also be connected to your home stereo and your Windows or Mac computer. Includes slipmat, 45rpm adapter, USB cable and CD-ROM with software. Requires iPod classic 5G/6G, iPod nano 2G/3G or iPod mini. Computer use requires Microsoft Windows XP/Vista or MacOS 10.3.9+.','P22462.jpg','P22462a.jpg','P22462a.jpg','0.00','229.00','0.00','0.00','0','0','13.05','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('2375','408','204 0771','Pocket 5-in-1 SD//ms/mspro/xd Card Reader','Input Devices>Memory Card Readers','y','0','157','0','',' ','With one card reader, you can access Secure Digital, SDHC, MultiMediaCard, xD-Picture Card, Memory Stick and Memory Stick PRO cards. Not much bigger than a thumb drive, this simple card reader/writer','With one card reader, you can access Secure Digital, SDHC, MultiMediaCard, xD-Picture Card, Memory Stick and Memory Stick PRO cards. Not much bigger than a thumb drive, this simple card reader/writer can be easily packed for travel. Requires Microsoft Windows 98SE+ or Mac OS 8.6+. Accepts SDHC cards up to 16GB.','P27219.jpg','P27219a.jpg','P27219a.jpg','0.00','6.50','0.00','0.00','0','0','0.05','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('2376','11','204 0821','Sandisk Ultra Compactflash (cf) Memory Card, 2gb','Media>Flash Memory Cards','y','0','410','0','','compactflash,compact flash,CF,sandisk,flash card,flash memory,flash memord card,sandisk minisd,ultra ii,2gb flash,cf flash','CompactFlash Memory Card is a small removable memory card standard based on flash memory technology, a non-volatile storage solution that does not require power to retain data indefinitely. CompactFla','CompactFlash Memory Card is a small removable memory card standard based on flash memory technology, a non-volatile storage solution that does not require power to retain data indefinitely. CompactFlash cards, or CF cards, measure 42.8mm x 36.4mm x 3.3mm in dimension and have 50-pins for data transfer and connectivity. CompactFlash memory cards are most commonly employed in applications such as digital still cameras, digital movie cameras, PDAs, embedded computers, handheld GPS systems, MP3 players and other portable devices.','P12131.jpg','P12131a.jpg','P12131a.jpg','0.00','15.49','0.00','0.00','0','0','0.1','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('2377','11','204 0822','Sandisk Ultra Compactflash (cf) Memory Card, 4gb','Media>Flash Memory Cards','y','0','410','0','','compactflash,compact flash,CF,sandisk,flash card,flash memory,flash memord card,sandisk minisd,minisd,4bg flash,sd flash','CompactFlash Memory Card is a small removable memory card standard based on flash memory technology, a non-volatile storage solution that does not require power to retain data indefinitely. CompactFla','CompactFlash Memory Card is a small removable memory card standard based on flash memory technology, a non-volatile storage solution that does not require power to retain data indefinitely. CompactFlash cards, or CF cards, measure 42.8mm x 36.4mm x 3.3mm in dimension and have 50-pins for data transfer and connectivity. CompactFlash memory cards are most commonly employed in applications such as digital still cameras, digital movie cameras, PDAs, embedded computers, handheld GPS systems, MP3 players and other portable devices.','P12132.jpg','P12132a.jpg','P12132a.jpg','0.00','30.03','0.00','0.00','0','0','0.1','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y');
insert into `z_products` values('2378','11','204 0867','Pqi Secure Digital Card, Hi-speed, 60x, 2gb','Media>Flash Memory Cards','y','0','388','0','','2gb,SD,secure Digital,60x,high,speed,flash,memory,card','Tired of running out of room on your digital camera when you need it most? Expand your storage capacity with a Secure Digital card. It&#39;s ideal for high performance digital cameras, MP3 players, PDAs,','Tired of running out of room on your digital camera when you need it most? Expand your storage capacity with a Secure Digital card. It&#39;s ideal for high performance digital cameras, MP3 players, PDAs, GPS units, PCs, and more! Store and transfer everything from photos, music, videos and data in all your favorite SD compatible digital devices.','P19038.jpg','P19038a.jpg','P19038a.jpg','0.00','8.49','0.00','0.00','0','0','0.15','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
