 ('2385','388','204 0900','Photo Studio In-a-box','Digital/Multimedia Products>Camera &amp; Photo Accessories','y','0','412','0','','studio in a box','Take the best photographs of your favorite collectibles with the Photo Studio In-A-Box. The soft light box utilizes a specially woven nylon mesh diffuser, which delivers uniform illumination, eliminat','Take the best photographs of your favorite collectibles with the Photo Studio In-A-Box. The soft light box utilizes a specially woven nylon mesh diffuser, which delivers uniform illumination, eliminating harsh shadows and reflective glare. The 2 studio-quality 2800K tungsten lamps provide even color temperatures and excellent clarity. Includes AC-powered tungsten lamps, aluminum and steel camera stand, dual-sided blue/grey fabric background and convenient carrier. Camera not included.','P13214.jpg','P13214a.jpg','P13214a.jpg','0.00','89.95','0.00','0.00','0','0','6.9','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('2386','388','204 0901','Compact Photo Studio In A Box','Digital/Multimedia Products>Camera &amp; Photo Accessories','y','0','412','0','','photo studio,compact photo studio','The Compact Photo Studio In-A-Box gives you the tools you need to take consistent high-quality table-top photos of heirlooms, collectibles and other small objects. It&#39;s a great way to super charge you','The Compact Photo Studio In-A-Box gives you the tools you need to take consistent high-quality table-top photos of heirlooms, collectibles and other small objects. It&#39;s a great way to super charge your online auctions with consistently great photos or to photograph valuable items for insurance purposes. A specially woven, translucent nylon mesh box diffuses light eliminating harsh shadows and reflective glare. It collapses to 8 diameter to easily fit into the over-the-shoulder carrying case. The two studio-quality 35 watt lamps produce consistent color temperature and excellent clarity. Includes AC-powered lamps, mini camera tripod and convenient carrier. Camera not included.','P16007.jpg','P16007a.jpg','P16007a.jpg','0.00','49.95','0.00','0.00','0','0','3.3','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('2387','388','204 0903','Ng Tundra Manfrotto Monopod','Digital/Multimedia Products>Camera &amp; Photo Accessories','y','0','386','0','','camera tripod,monpod,camera holder, national geographic, nat geo','The National Geographic Tundra Monopod provides steady support for your camera that&#39;s more manueverable than a tripod. It&#39;s particularly well-suited for shooting wildlife, sporting events, or at crow','The National Geographic Tundra Monopod provides steady support for your camera that&#39;s more manueverable than a tripod. It&#39;s particularly well-suited for shooting wildlife, sporting events, or at crowded venues where you might need to set up quick, get your shot and move. The NG Tundra monopod is ideal for digital cameras. It&#39;ll make you feel like a globe-trotting National Geographic photographer. Engineered by Manfrotto.','P13772.jpg','P13772a.jpg','P13772a.jpg','0.00','44.01','0.00','0.00','0','0','1.35','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
