 ('2461','325','245 0771','Iogear Bluetooth 2.0 USB Micro Adapter','Networking>Wireless Networking (WiFi)>Bluetooth Adapters','y','0','8','0','','usb,blue,tooth,adapter','About the size of a grape, the IOGEAR Bluetooth 2.0 USB Micro Adapter connects your computer to Bluetooth devices like cell phones, PDAs, mice and keyboards. Because it&#39;s so small, it can fit in your','About the size of a grape, the IOGEAR Bluetooth 2.0 USB Micro Adapter connects your computer to Bluetooth devices like cell phones, PDAs, mice and keyboards. Because it&#39;s so small, it can fit in your computer without blocking any adjacent USB ports. Its Bluetooth 2.0 + EDR technology provides for transfer rates up to 3 times faster than Bluetooth 1.1 and 1.2 adapters. Supports the following services: generic access (GAP), serial port (SPP), FAX, network access (LAP), dial-up networking (DUN), object push (OPP) headset (HSP), remote control (AVRCP), file transfer (FTP), audio gateway (A2DP), human input devices (HID) and synchronization. Includes software on CD-ROM. Requires Microsoft Windows 2000+ or Mac OS v10.3.9+.','P25640.jpg','P25640a.jpg','P25640a.jpg','0.00','18.59','0.00','0.00','0','0','0.2','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
