 ('2535','325','255 0254','Drone Plug And Play Voip/stereo Bluetooth Adapter','Networking>Wireless Networking (WiFi)>Bluetooth Adapters','y','0','221','0','',' ','The Callpod Drone is a USB Bluetooth adapter for PC and Mac computers, specially designed for use as an audio gateway to Bluetooth devices. With a built-in stereo AD2P profile and eSCO technology to i','The Callpod Drone is a USB Bluetooth adapter for PC and Mac computers, specially designed for use as an audio gateway to Bluetooth devices. With a built-in stereo AD2P profile and eSCO technology to improve sound quality, it&#39;s perfect for combining voice-over-IP applications (VoIP) on your computer with your favorite Bluetooth headset. Class I power gives you extended range, up to 320 ft. with other Class I Bluetooth devices. Requires Microsoft Windows XP/Vista or Mac OS 10.4+.','P29058.jpg','P29058a.jpg','P29058a.jpg','0.00','25.36','0.00','0.00','0','0','0.1','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
 ('2536','222','255 0307','Carchip Pro, W/ Alarm','Mobile Computing &amp; Travel Products>Auto Travel Aids','y','0','469','0','','carchip,car chip pro,car chip','The CarChip Pro plugs into the OBD II connector found on most newer vehicles and records and stores up to 300 hours of performance data including time&amp;date for each trip, distance traveled, speed, b','The CarChip Pro plugs into the OBD II connector found on most newer vehicles and records and stores up to 300 hours of performance data including time&amp;date for each trip, distance traveled, speed, braking and acceleration. Additionally, the car-chip can sound an alarm for excess speed, hard braking or quick acceleration. It records trouble codes and freeze frame sensor readings to aid in engine troubleshooting. Performance logs can be downloaded to your PC. Includes USB cable and software on CD-ROM. Requires Microsoft Windows 98SE/Me/2000/XP/Vista. The OBD II system is installed in most foreign&amp;domestic vehicles built since 1996. For a list of known exceptions, please consult the compatibility chart.','P15962.jpg','P15962a.jpg','P15962a.jpg','0.00','83.09','0.00','0.00','0','0','0.34','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y');
insert into `z_products` values('2537','222','255 0309','Scangauge, Compact 3 In 1 Automotive Computer','Mobile Computing &amp; Travel Products>Auto Travel Aids','y','0','470','0','',' ','Plug the ScanGauge II into your car&#39;s OBDII connector to get real time information on the vitals of your engine, as well as retrieve problem codes when the check engine light goes on. You can also u','Plug the ScanGauge II into your car&#39;s OBDII connector to get real time information on the vitals of your engine, as well as retrieve problem codes when the check engine light goes on. You can also use ScanGauge II to determine your vehicle&#39;s fuel use and fuel economy. Use it to monitor engine temperatures, battery voltages, fuel consumption and more. The trip data can report the average and maximum speeds reached in the last four trips, plus much more. The OBDII connector is in almost all vehicles made after 1996. Not all vehicles provide all the data ScanGauge II can track. Includes OBDII cable and mounting tape.','P32018.jpg','P32018a.jpg','P32018a.jpg','0.00','159.00','0.00','0.00','0','0','0.7','0','0','0','1','y','y','y','y','n','y'),
