 ('112 0116','Smart Strip 10-outlet Surge, Lcg3','http://www.efilliate.com/templates/SearchDetail.asp?ProductID=24512','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_thumb/P24512.jpg','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_images/P24512a.jpg','Office Products>Surge Protectors','The Smart Strip surge protector lowers your energy bills by turning off your computer\'s peripherals when your PC is shut down. Six automatically switched outlets are all turned off when wattage thro','The Smart Strip surge protector lowers your energy bills by turning off your computer\'s peripherals when your PC is shut down. Six automatically switched outlets are all turned off when wattage through the control outlet drops below a user-settable threshold. Over time, this can save you tremendous amounts of electricity (and money), as all those AC adapters cease their idling drain of 4 to 60 watts. The Smart Strip also has 3 constantly hot outlets that maintain a constant current to devices that require it.',' ','Bits Limited','29.22','12','27.41','2.25','1','0'),
 ('112 0121','Smart Strip 10-outlet Surge, Lcg4','http://www.efilliate.com/templates/SearchDetail.asp?ProductID=11310','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_thumb/P11310.jpg','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_images/P11310a.jpg','Office Products>Surge Protectors','The Smart Strip surge protector lowers your energy costs by managing the flow of energy to your PC and its peripherals. Simply plug your PC into the Control Outlet and your peripherals into the Aut','The Smart Strip surge protector lowers your energy costs by managing the flow of energy to your PC and its peripherals. Simply plug your PC into the Control Outlet and your peripherals into the Automatically Switched Outlets. Then when your PC is shutdown, the Smart Strip suspends power to the switched outlets too, making shutdown fast, easy and complete. Three additional Constantly Hot Outlets maintain an idle current to devices, that require it.','smart strip,surge protector,10 outlet,power strip','Bits Limited','30.3','12','28.71','2.25','1','1'),
 ('112 0124','Smart Strip 7-outlet Surge, Scg3','http://www.efilliate.com/templates/SearchDetail.asp?ProductID=29498','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_thumb/P29498.jpg','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_images/P29498a.jpg','Office Products>Surge Protectors','The Smart Strip surge protector lowers your energy bills by turning off your computer\'s peripherals when your PC is shut down. Four automatically switched outlets are all turned off when wattage thr','The Smart Strip surge protector lowers your energy bills by turning off your computer\'s peripherals when your PC is shut down. Four automatically switched outlets are all turned off when wattage through the control outlet drops below a user-settable threshold. Over time, this can save you tremendous amounts of electricity (and money), as all those AC adapters cease their idling drain of 4 to 60 watts. The Smart Strip also has 2 constantly hot outlets that maintain a constant current to devices that require it.',' ','Bits Limited','23.01','12','20.71','1.7','1','1'),
