 ('114 0636','Drive Erazer Data Eraser, 3.5in IDE Drives','http://www.efilliate.com/templates/SearchDetail.asp?ProductID=20458','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_thumb/P20458.jpg','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_images/P20458a.jpg','Tools and Testers>PC Troubleshooting','When you throw a computer file into the recycle bin, Windows marks it as deleted... but the file remains on the disk, hidden in magnetic ones and zeros that a reasonably skilled hacker can easily re','When you throw a computer file into the recycle bin, Windows marks it as deleted... but the file remains on the disk, hidden in magnetic ones and zeros that a reasonably skilled hacker can easily recover. Even formatting a drive can leave readable information. Wiebetech\'s Drive Erazers fill every sector--in every partition--with nothing but zeroes, leaving nothing left to recover. Your completely clean disk can be reused or sold, data- and worry-free. Works with all 3.5 ATA/ATAPI (IDE) hard drives, regardless of format or OS type. Includes AC adapter and ribbon cable.','drive,eraser,data,eraser,hdd,eraser','Wiebetech','99.99','0','0','1.45','0','0'),
 ('114 0637','Drive Erazer Pro Data Eraser, 2.5/3.5in Drives','http://www.efilliate.com/templates/SearchDetail.asp?ProductID=20478','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_thumb/P20478.jpg','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_images/P20478a.jpg','Security Products>Computer Security','When you throw a file into the recycle bin, Windows marks it as deleted... but the file remains on the disk, hidden in magnetic ones and zeros that a mediocre cracker can decipher. Even formatting','When you throw a file into the recycle bin, Windows marks it as deleted... but the file remains on the disk, hidden in magnetic ones and zeros that a mediocre cracker can decipher. Even formatting a drive can leave readable information. Wiebetech\'s Drive Erazers fills every sector--in every partition--with nothing but zeroes, leaving nothing left to recover. Your freshly cleaned disk can be reused or sold data- and worry-free.  The Drive Erazer Pro includes adapters for 2.5 hard drives and SATA drives. It also offers the ability to perform multiple passes. Some studies show that there may be ways of recovering bits of data even after completely overwriting everything on the drive. While the laboratory required to do this would cost millions (if not billions), if you need to convince someone that there\'s absolutely no way data can be recovered, the Pro model with the multi-pass feature is for you. Works with all 2.5 and 3.5 ATA/ATAPI (IDE) and SATA hard drives, regardless of format or OS type. Includes AC adapter and ribbon cable.','data eraser','Wiebetech','199','0','0','1.5','1','1'),
