 ('115 3630','Lanroamer Pro Tester W/ 1 Remote, Tp600','http://www.efilliate.com/templates/SearchDetail.asp?ProductID=3813','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_thumb/P3813.jpg','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_images/P3813a.jpg','Tools and Testers>Network Testers','The LanRoamerPRO Tester/Analyzer is a high performance length measurement CAT 5 tester that identifies multiple faults clearly without interpretation, has one-ended testing with pre-test for fast resu','The LanRoamerPRO Tester/Analyzer is a high performance length measurement CAT 5 tester that identifies multiple faults clearly without interpretation, has one-ended testing with pre-test for fast results and clear wiremapping displayed on 2-line, 16 character LCD. The LanRoamerPRO includes features such as auto-on /auto-off, a tone generator mode for use with tone tracers and a low battery indicator. It tests for shorts, opens, miswires, reversals and split pairs. Requires 1 9V battery, not included.','analyzer,tester,test-um,testum,tone,generator,test,lanrover,tp600','JDSU','172','0','0','0.32','0','0'),
 ('115 3663','Test-um Validator Network/cabling Tester','http://www.efilliate.com/templates/SearchDetail.asp?ProductID=8901','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_thumb/P8901.jpg','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_images/P8901a.jpg','Tools and Testers>Network Testers','Certify your network installations with your own Validator Network/Cabling Certifier, from Test-Um, Validator can maximize your voice/data/video installationís efficiency by identifying cable inadequa','Certify your network installations with your own Validator Network/Cabling Certifier, from Test-Um, Validator can maximize your voice/data/video installationís efficiency by identifying cable inadequacies such as installation problems, kinks, loops, terminations, dry shorts or miswires. Using the included Plan-Um software, you can layout your networkís requirements in a matter of minutes, then define cable types and runs. Once the cables are in place, test each run, and print the results in an easy-to-read report.','tester,adapter tester kit','JDSU','1265','0','0','8.1','0','0'),
 ('115 3664','Test-um Validator-nt, Active Network Tester','http://www.efilliate.com/templates/SearchDetail.asp?ProductID=11912','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_thumb/P11912.jpg','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_images/P11912a.jpg','Tools and Testers>Network Testers','Certify your network installations with your own Validator Network/Cabling Certifier, from Test-Um, Validator can maximize your voice/data/video installations efficiency by identifying cable inadequac','Certify your network installations with your own Validator Network/Cabling Certifier, from Test-Um, Validator can maximize your voice/data/video installations efficiency by identifying cable inadequacies such as installation problems, kinks, loops, terminations, dry shorts or miswires. Using the included Plan-Um software, you can layout your networks requirements in a matter of minutes, then define cable types and runs. Once the cables are in place, test each run, and print the results in an easy-to-read report. The new Validator-NT has all the testing and certifying capabilities of the Validator, but also includes new active network tests for diagnosing problems on live networks. Use it to identify network devices such as hubs, switches, NICs and routers on your network and verify connectivity (manual IP or via DHCP) to the Internet by pinging up to seven different IP addresses simultaneously. In addition, the kit includes a set of 8 wiremap remotes. Requires PC running Windows 2000/XP with 512MB RAM.','tester,adapter tester kit','JDSU','1622','0','0','8','0','0'),
 ('115 3665','Test-um Coax Mapper, Cx200','http://www.efilliate.com/templates/SearchDetail.asp?ProductID=4212','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_thumb/P4212.jpg','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_images/P4212a.jpg','Tools and Testers>Coax and Satellite Testers','This handy tester is designed for CATV and security camera connection and installation. It tests multi-run coax cables terminated with F-connectors from a central source. It has the ability to put a t','This handy tester is designed for CATV and security camera connection and installation. It tests multi-run coax cables terminated with F-connectors from a central source. It has the ability to put a tone signal on a coax cable, as well as find and identify multiple coax cables connected to a coax splitter. With individually-identified test terminators, you can trace up to 4 connections at a time from the main cable box.','test-um,security,bnc,field,tester,kit,test,set,catv,cable,tv,testum,coax,mapper,telephony','JDSU','44.99','0','0','0.5','0','0'),
 ('115 3666','Coax Cable Tester And Identifier','http://www.efilliate.com/templates/SearchDetail.asp?ProductID=17561','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_thumb/P17561.jpg','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_images/P17561a.jpg','Tools and Testers>Cable Tracing/Tone Generators','Connect the powered portion of this compact tester to one end of a coax cable and the identifier cap will light up when attached to the other end of the cable. The pocket tester can check cable integr','Connect the powered portion of this compact tester to one end of a coax cable and the identifier cap will light up when attached to the other end of the cable. The pocket tester can check cable integrity too; the bandit unit lights up when it detects a split (short) in the cable. The three pieces conveniently fit together for storage. Requires 2 AAA batteries, included.','coax,pocket,cable,identifier,tester','LSDI','29.68','0','0','0.15','1','1'),
 ('115 3667','Test-um Wi-net Window, Wireless Net Tester','http://www.efilliate.com/templates/SearchDetail.asp?ProductID=12656','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_thumb/P12656.jpg','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_images/P12656a.jpg','Tools and Testers>Network Testers','Wi-Net Window detects key parameters of the wireless equipment broadcasting in its vicinity. In addition to identifying networks, it also shows signal strengths, encryption conditions, channel transmi','Wi-Net Window detects key parameters of the wireless equipment broadcasting in its vicinity. In addition to identifying networks, it also shows signal strengths, encryption conditions, channel transmissions and more. It can access the DHCP of a network to capture component IDs, confirm IP addresses or to process up to 4 simultaneous ping requests. Wi-Net Window can log all received wireless transmissions in the area for inspection with constant scanning. Requires 4 AA batteries, not included.','tester,adapter tester kit','JDSU','281','0','0','0.85','0','0'),
