 ('115 3674','Test-um Deluxe Resi Kit, Kp312','http://www.efilliate.com/templates/SearchDetail.asp?ProductID=10310','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_thumb/P10310.jpg','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_images/P10310a.jpg','Tools and Testers>Cable Tracing/Tone Generators','This 4-in-1 kit includes everything needed to find, fix and verify network, telephone, audio and coaxial cables in residential installations.  Resi-Tester: can test, locate and identify CATV, t','This 4-in-1 kit includes everything needed to find, fix and verify network, telephone, audio and coaxial cables in residential installations.  Resi-Tester: can test, locate and identify CATV, telephone, audio, security/alarm and network wiring. The large easy-to-read LCD provides concise information showing all the faults connected. The included #1 terminator neatly stores into the body of the tester.  Resi-Toner: is a full-function tone generator designed to test connections on telephone systems and speaker installations. It powers-up the installed telephone lines under actual load conditions with a simulated dial tone to check connectivity and proper wiring configurations without a service connection. Resi-Talker: can perform basic telephone system testing with continuous line polarity indication, amplified line monitoring for volume levels comparable to off hook operation and a modular cord set attachment. Resi-Tracer: is a multi-function signal detector that locates standard generated tone signals as well as dial tone and speaker popping signals. Resi-Tracer trace tones over both live and dark coax cable systems and can be used for a number of special field applications.','net testing,cable testing,telco testing,catv testing','JDSU','475','0','0','3.36','0','0'),
