 ('119 5196','Flexicord CAT5e Patch Cable, 3ft','http://www.efilliate.com/templates/SearchDetail.asp?ProductID=32898','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_thumb/P32898.jpg','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_images/P32898a.jpg','Flexicord (tm) Cable Collection>Flexicord (tm) Networking','Connect your computer to a network port or router with a Flexicord CAT5e patch cable. Flexicord(TM) CAT5e cables, utilizing patent-pending Memory Cord Technology, solve the problem of determining the','Connect your computer to a network port or router with a Flexicord CAT5e patch cable. Flexicord(TM) CAT5e cables, utilizing patent-pending Memory Cord Technology, solve the problem of determining the exact length of the Ethernet cable you need. Shipped as a compact coiled cable, it can be uncoiled to its full length; once extended, it holds its shape and will not recoil. Eliminate the guesswork in determining the exact cable length necessary! A Flexicord cable can be used uncoiled to its maximum length or used as a short, mess-free coiled cable. A convenient cylinder, included with each Flexicord cable, allows you to return the cable to its original coiled shape whenever needed.',' ','Ziotek','5.88','0','0','0.2','1','0');
