 ('131 0837','Tritton USB 2.0 SVGA Adapter','http://www.efilliate.com/templates/SearchDetail.asp?ProductID=7462','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_thumb/P7462.jpg','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_images/P7462a.jpg','Cables and Adapters>Adapters and Couplers>USB Adapters','Frustrated by the limited size of your Windows desktop workspace? Now you can add another monitor to your PC or notebook with this simple-to-install SVGA adapter. The adapter simply plugs into a USB 2','Frustrated by the limited size of your Windows desktop workspace? Now you can add another monitor to your PC or notebook with this simple-to-install SVGA adapter. The adapter simply plugs into a USB 2.0 port, and it works with both CRT and LCD monitors as well as projectors. You can view large spreadsheets, multitask more effectively, or do multiple screen displays and presentations. The possibilities are endless! Includes software on CD-ROM. Requires Microsoft Windows 2000/XP/Vista. Actual resolution dependent on operating system and monitor type.','adaptor,usb vga,usb video,usb monitor','Tritton','68.54','0','0','0.52','1','1'),
