 ('138 0102','Razer Lycosa Gaming Keyboard, Black','http://www.efilliate.com/templates/SearchDetail.asp?ProductID=26658','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_thumb/P26658.jpg','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_images/P26658a.jpg','Input Devices>Keyboards and Keypads>USB Keyboard','Designed specifically for gamers, the sleek Razer Lycosa USB keyboard is super responsive and features anti-ghosting capabilities which capture every keystroke, even if you hit multiple keys at once.','Designed specifically for gamers, the sleek Razer Lycosa USB keyboard is super responsive and features anti-ghosting capabilities which capture every keystroke, even if you hit multiple keys at once. The behind-the-key blue glow can be deactivated or restricted to the all-important WASD keys. Program the keyboard with up to ten sets of macro functions with the included software. A pass-through USB port along with microphone and headphone jacks make this keyboard a complete gaming solution. Includes software CD-ROM. Requires Microsoft Windows XP/Vista (64-bit compatible).',' ','Razer','72.32','0','0','3.4','0','0'),
