 ('138 0425','I-rocks Rf6572bk Wireless RF 2.4 Ghz Keyboard/mous','http://www.efilliate.com/templates/SearchDetail.asp?ProductID=25399','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_thumb/P25399.jpg','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_images/P25399a.jpg','Input Devices>Keyboards and Keypads>Wireless Keyboard','This sharp-looking wireless keyboard and mouse work even better than they look. They use new 2.4GHz technology for extended range and interference-free communications with your computer. Designed to l','This sharp-looking wireless keyboard and mouse work even better than they look. They use new 2.4GHz technology for extended range and interference-free communications with your computer. Designed to last, the keyboard\'s unique X-structure key mechanisms are each rated for over 10 million key strokes. Requires Microsoft Windows 98SE+.','usb,wireless,cordless,mouse,piano,black,usb','I-Rocks','41.09','10','36.98','2.95','1','1'),
 ('138 0427','Saitek Eclipse Ii Illuminated Keyboard, USB','http://www.efilliate.com/templates/SearchDetail.asp?ProductID=13912','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_thumb/P13912.jpg','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_images/P13912a.jpg','Input Devices>Keyboards and Keypads>USB Keyboard','The Saitek Eclipse II keyboard builds on the success of the original backlit Eclipse keyboard, now offering a choice of backlight colours--purple, red and blue--selectable by the user and adjustable v','The Saitek Eclipse II keyboard builds on the success of the original backlit Eclipse keyboard, now offering a choice of backlight colours--purple, red and blue--selectable by the user and adjustable via a dimmer mechanism. The keyboard is solidly constructed from high quality materials and features a weighted base with large-area rubber feet to keep it firmly in place. Best of all, Saitek\'s silent keys with their famous feel provide hours of fatigue-free use. Includes wrist rest. Requires Microsoft Windows 2000/XP/Vista.','illuminated keyboard,usb keyboard','Saitek','51.72','0','0','3.8','1','1'),
 ('138 0429','Kinesis Freestyle Solo Keyboard, USB, Black','http://www.efilliate.com/templates/SearchDetail.asp?ProductID=26638','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_thumb/P26638.jpg','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_images/P26638a.jpg','Ergonomic Products>Ergonomic Keyboards','This high-quality keyboard has been cut in two... on purpose! Each half of the Kinesis Freestyle keyboard can be positioned to where it best fits your hands. The removable hinge keeps the two halves n','This high-quality keyboard has been cut in two... on purpose! Each half of the Kinesis Freestyle keyboard can be positioned to where it best fits your hands. The removable hinge keeps the two halves near each other, but the keyboard can be used without it with up to 9 between the segments. Use it on a desk as is (rubber feet keep halves from sliding) or with an optional stand for elevation. Requires Microsoft Windows 98SE+ or Mac OS 8.6+.',' ','Kinesis','89','0','0','2.65','0','0'),
 ('138 0431','Kinesis Freestyle Incline Accessory Kit, Black','http://www.efilliate.com/templates/SearchDetail.asp?ProductID=26640','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_thumb/P26640.jpg','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_images/P26640a.jpg','Ergonomic Products>Ergonomic Keyboards','The Incline accessory kit works with the Kinesis Freestyle keyboard to add a 10 degree fixed tenting angle. The two halves of the keyboard (sold separately) attach to pivot points on the rear and can','The Incline accessory kit works with the Kinesis Freestyle keyboard to add a 10 degree fixed tenting angle. The two halves of the keyboard (sold separately) attach to pivot points on the rear and can be adjusted as needed to meet your preferred wrist angle. Rubber feet keep the Incline stand from sliding around. Also included are two padded palm rests.',' ','Kinesis','36','0','0','2.15','1','1'),
 ('138 0433','Kinesis Freestyle Vip Accessory Kit, Black','http://www.efilliate.com/templates/SearchDetail.asp?ProductID=26639','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_thumb/P26639.jpg','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_images/P26639a.jpg','Ergonomic Products>Ergonomic Keyboards','The VIP accessory kit provides either 10 or 15 degrees or lateral slope to your Kinesis Freestyle keyboard (sold separately). Also included are padded palm rests that attach to the front of the keyboa','The VIP accessory kit provides either 10 or 15 degrees or lateral slope to your Kinesis Freestyle keyboard (sold separately). Also included are padded palm rests that attach to the front of the keyboard.',' ','Kinesis','36','0','0','1.3','1','1'),
 ('138 0435','Kinesis Advantage Contoured Keyboard, USB, Black','http://www.efilliate.com/templates/SearchDetail.asp?ProductID=26641','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_thumb/P26641.jpg','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_images/P26641a.jpg','Ergonomic Products>Ergonomic Keyboards','With a sculpted shape that makes it simple to reach every key, the Kinesis Advantage Keyboard reduces hand and wrist strain. First introduced in 1992, the Advantage uses concave key wells to help reta','With a sculpted shape that makes it simple to reach every key, the Kinesis Advantage Keyboard reduces hand and wrist strain. First introduced in 1992, the Advantage uses concave key wells to help retain the arms in a natural forward position. The keyboard is completely reprogrammable and can be quickly setup to suit your needs. Requires Microsoft Windows 98SE+ or Mac OS 8.6+. Includes wrist pads, optional key caps, and a key cap puller.',' ','Kinesis','269','0','0','3.6','1','1'),
 ('140 0105','Dynaflex Fitness Ball Chair With Base, Grey','http://www.efilliate.com/templates/SearchDetail.asp?ProductID=28478','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_thumb/P28478.jpg','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_images/P28478a.jpg','Ergonomic Products>Ergonomic Back Support','The patented Sit \'N\' Fit fitness chair provides healthy active sitting while helping to improve your posture. Ergonomically designed to align with your body, it can help relieve tension or stress on','The patented Sit \'N\' Fit fitness chair provides healthy active sitting while helping to improve your posture. Ergonomically designed to align with your body, it can help relieve tension or stress on your back. Active sitting engages your torso muscles and allows you to experience the benefits of movement while remaining seated. Seemingly minor physical activity such as active sitting can burn hundreds of calories a day, helping you stay healthier too. Includes manual inflator.',' ','DynaFlex','79.95','0','0','8.95','1','1'),
