 ('148 0037','Laptop Legs, Gray, 2pack','http://www.efilliate.com/templates/SearchDetail.asp?ProductID=14710','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_thumb/P14710.jpg','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_images/P14710a.jpg','Mobile Computing and Travel Products>Notebook Stands/Coolers','Laptops used to have folding legs to adjust the typing angle and improve the airflow underneath for better cooling. Nowadays, many don\'t... so we commonly rely on laptop stands to replace them. But wh','Laptops used to have folding legs to adjust the typing angle and improve the airflow underneath for better cooling. Nowadays, many don\'t... so we commonly rely on laptop stands to replace them. But why add an entire stand when all you need are the legs? Stick-on Laptop Legs fit all standard laptops, apply easily, and provide either 1 and 1 3/8 of lift. Each leg requires about 2 x 2 of flat surface to adhere the permanent peel-and-stick adhesive. Laptop not included.','laptop legs,notebook legs,stickon legs,laptop feet,notebook feet,rubber feet','Lapworks','9.95','0','0','0.05','1','0'),
