 ('148 0043','Laptop Desk Ultralite, Grey','http://www.efilliate.com/templates/SearchDetail.asp?ProductID=19223','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_thumb/P19223.jpg','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_images/P19223a.jpg','Mobile Computing and Travel Products>Notebook Stands/Coolers','The UltraLite Laptop Desk is both a laptop desk and a tilting desktop stand for smaller laptops. Fold it out and you\'ll have a full 11 x 22 work surface, complete with mousing area. Fold it up and u','The UltraLite Laptop Desk is both a laptop desk and a tilting desktop stand for smaller laptops. Fold it out and you\'ll have a full 11 x 22 work surface, complete with mousing area. Fold it up and use the angle adjuster to elevate the back of your computer up to 15 degrees. Anti-skid pads keep your laptop in place and the undulated surface increases cooling airflow.','148 0041,1480041,148+0041,laptop,notebook,desk,ultralite,desk','Targus','29.95','0','0','0.95','1','1'),
 ('148 0044','Arcticlean 1 And 2, Surface Cleaner, 60ml Kit','http://www.efilliate.com/templates/SearchDetail.asp?ProductID=20978','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_thumb/P20978.jpg','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_images/P20978a.jpg','Tools and Testers>Thermal Compound','ArctiClean is a 2-step cleaning process that removes existing thermal grease or pads and prepares the thermal surface for a fresh application of thermal interface material. The ArctiClean 1 thermal ma','ArctiClean is a 2-step cleaning process that removes existing thermal grease or pads and prepares the thermal surface for a fresh application of thermal interface material. The ArctiClean 1 thermal material remover quickly emulsifies and dissolves thermal grease or pads from CPU or heatsink surfaces. A few drops of ArctiClean 2 thermal surface purifier and some gentle wiping then removes the remaining residue and inhibits flash corrosion on copper or aluminum.','60ml,thermal,grease,remover,artic,clean,surface,cleaner,60ml','Arctic Cooling','5.27','96','4.75','0.35','1','1'),
