 ('148 0049','Kensington Liftoff Portable Notebook Cooling Stand','http://www.efilliate.com/templates/SearchDetail.asp?ProductID=24062','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_thumb/P24062.jpg','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_images/P24062a.jpg','Mobile Computing and Travel Products>Notebook Stands/Coolers','Kensington\'s LiftOff portable notebook stand raises your notebook to promote airflow and reduce heat buildup. It places your computer\'s keyboard at a slight angle to promote comfortable typing and it','Kensington\'s LiftOff portable notebook stand raises your notebook to promote airflow and reduce heat buildup. It places your computer\'s keyboard at a slight angle to promote comfortable typing and it collapses to 5/8 thick to better fit into your computer\'s carrying case. Compatible with up to 17 notebooks.','liftoff,portable,laptop,notebook,cooling,stand','Kensington','14.49','0','0','1.55','1','1'),
 ('148 0050','Chipset Cooler, Cs-145','http://www.efilliate.com/templates/SearchDetail.asp?ProductID=2395','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_thumb/P2395.jpg','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_images/P2395a.jpg','Computer Components>Computer Cooling>Video Card Cooling','Use our universal heatsink and fan chip cooler set for chipset ICs, video card ICs, or any chip that could benefit from reduced operating temperature. Includes a 40mm cooling fan, two aluminum heatsin','Use our universal heatsink and fan chip cooler set for chipset ICs, video card ICs, or any chip that could benefit from reduced operating temperature. Includes a 40mm cooling fan, two aluminum heatsinks, a Molex to 3-pin power adapter, 4 plastic spring clips, 2 pieces of thermal tape and 1.5g of thermal compound.','universal,chip,cooling kit,chipset cooling,cs-145','Alpha Omega','5.48','50','4.93','0.14','0','0'),
