 ('148 0058','Case Fan, 250x250x30mm, Blue Led, 4-pin Molex','http://www.efilliate.com/templates/SearchDetail.asp?ProductID=29719','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_thumb/P29719.jpg','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_images/P29719a.jpg','Computer Components>Cases and Components>Case Fans','This 250mm silent LED case fan is just asking to be installed on a case side panel. With its massive area, this fan can cool an entire motherboard, plus its five LEDs can illuminate your entire case.','This 250mm silent LED case fan is just asking to be installed on a case side panel. With its massive area, this fan can cool an entire motherboard, plus its five LEDs can illuminate your entire case. The fan kicks out 105 cubic feet per minute while making only 19dBA... less noise than most 80mm fans! The included black bezel and grill will cover the hole in the side panel. You can cut it with a pair of Tin Snips and it will still look professional once it is installed.',' ','Rexflo','17.04','0','0','1.28','1','1'),
