 ('148 0060','Arctic Silver 5 Thermal Compound, 3.5grams','http://www.efilliate.com/templates/SearchDetail.asp?ProductID=3380','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_thumb/P3380.jpg','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_images/P3380a.jpg','Tools and Testers>Thermal Compound','Arctic Silver 5 premium thermal compound, with 99.9% pure micronized silver, is specifically designed to maximize the thermal conductivity between today\'s high-powered processors and high-performance','Arctic Silver 5 premium thermal compound, with 99.9% pure micronized silver, is specifically designed to maximize the thermal conductivity between today\'s high-powered processors and high-performance cooling assemblies. Arctic Silver 5 uses three unique shapes and sizes of near-pure silver particles to maximize particle-to-particle contact area and thermal transfer. It can reduce CPU core temperatures by up to 50∞F over standard silicone thermal pastes. Controlled triple phase viscosity allows Arctic Silver 5 to fill, over time, microscopic valleys and gaps in CPU and heatsink surfaces. One 3.5g tube can cover up to 25 CPU cores.','thermal,grease,compound,high,density,thermo,grease,aluminum oxide','Arctic Silver','5.72','0','0','0.04','1','0'),
 ('148 0061','Arctic Silver 5 Thermal Compound, 12 Grams','http://www.efilliate.com/templates/SearchDetail.asp?ProductID=20999','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_thumb/P20999.jpg','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_images/P20999a.jpg','Tools and Testers>Thermal Compound','Arctic Silver 5 premium thermal compound, with 99.9% pure micronized silver, is specifically designed to maximize the thermal conductivity between today\'s high-power processors and high-performance co','Arctic Silver 5 premium thermal compound, with 99.9% pure micronized silver, is specifically designed to maximize the thermal conductivity between today\'s high-power processors and high-performance cooling assemblies. Arctic Silver 5 uses three unique shapes and sizes of near-pure silver particles to maximize particle-to-particle contact area and thermal transfer. It can reduce CPU core temperatures by up to 50∞F over standard silicone thermal pastes. Controlled triple phase viscosity allows Arctic Silver 5 to fill, over time, microscopic valleys and gaps in CPU and heatsink surfaces. One 12g tube can cover up to 85 CPU cores.','thermal,grease,compound,high,density,thermo,grease,aluminum oxide','Arctic Silver','14.18','0','0','0.05','1','1'),
 ('148 0065','Arctic Silver, Silver Thermal Epoxy, 7g','http://www.efilliate.com/templates/SearchDetail.asp?ProductID=3381','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_thumb/P3381.jpg','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_images/P3381a.jpg','Tools and Testers>Thermal Compound','Made with 99.8% pure micronized silver, Arctic Silver Thermal Epoxy conducts heat between the surfaces it bonds. Use this two-step epoxy to attach heat sinks to chips. A permanent adhesive, it is best','Made with 99.8% pure micronized silver, Arctic Silver Thermal Epoxy conducts heat between the surfaces it bonds. Use this two-step epoxy to attach heat sinks to chips. A permanent adhesive, it is best used when electrical conductivity is not a concern. Mixes 7 grams of epoxy. Please note: This is not a thermal compound, this is a permanent epoxy. Not for use between CPUs and CPU heat sinks.','permanent,thermal,grease,compound,high,density,thermo,epoxy','Arctic Cooling','11.06','0','0','0.06','1','1'),
 ('148 0070','Arctic Alumina Ceramic Thermal Compound, 1.75g','http://www.efilliate.com/templates/SearchDetail.asp?ProductID=3382','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_thumb/P3382.jpg','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_images/P3382a.jpg','Tools and Testers>Thermal Compound','Arctic Alumina is a ceramic-based, polysynthetic thermal compound for use with high- performance CPUs and heat sinks or water-cooling solutions. Made with micronized aluminum oxide and boron nitride,','Arctic Alumina is a ceramic-based, polysynthetic thermal compound for use with high- performance CPUs and heat sinks or water-cooling solutions. Made with micronized aluminum oxide and boron nitride, Arctic Alumina uses a layered composite of ceramic particles to maximize thermal transfer.','artic,alumina,ceramic,thermal,paste,compound','Arctic Cooling','3.06','0','0','0.02','1','1'),
