 ('148 0073','Arctic Alumina, Ceramic Thermal Adhesive, 5g','http://www.efilliate.com/templates/SearchDetail.asp?ProductID=3383','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_thumb/P3383.jpg','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_images/P3383a.jpg','Tools and Testers>Thermal Compound','The Arctic Alumina Thermal Adhesive uses a layered composite of aluminum oxide and boron nitride to create a permanent adhesive with remarkable thermal conductivity. A pure electrical insulator, Arcti','The Arctic Alumina Thermal Adhesive uses a layered composite of aluminum oxide and boron nitride to create a permanent adhesive with remarkable thermal conductivity. A pure electrical insulator, Arctic Alumina Adhesive is silicone free and easy to use. Two 2.5 gram tubes mix to about 3cc total adhesive.','thermal,grease,compound,high,density,thermo,grease,aluminum oxide','Arctic Silver','5.98','0','0','0.02','1','0');
insert into `z_reseller` values('148 0076','Copper Memory Heatspreader','http://www.efilliate.com/templates/SearchDetail.asp?ProductID=5617','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_thumb/P5617.jpg','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_images/P5617a.jpg','Computer Components>Computer Cooling>CPU Cooling','Improve RAM performance and avoid system crashes with our Vantec Iceberg DDR Memory Heat Spreader. The heat spreader dissipates heat from your RAM chip by spreading heat over a larger surface area. Th','Improve RAM performance and avoid system crashes with our Vantec Iceberg DDR Memory Heat Spreader. The heat spreader dissipates heat from your RAM chip by spreading heat over a larger surface area. This affordable cooling solution is compatible with all standard SDR, DDR and SDRM, fits most motherboards and helps to provide some stability for you?r overclocked PC.','memory cooler,memory heatspreader,heatspreader','Vantec','4.95','200','4.45','0.3','0','0'),
