 ('148 0094','Neon Crab Memory Cooler','http://www.efilliate.com/templates/SearchDetail.asp?ProductID=10286','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_thumb/P10286.jpg','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_images/P10286a.jpg','Computer Components>Computer Cooling>Memory Cooling','The spring-loaded legs of the Neon Crab clamp onto the memory module bracket in your PC to direct cooling air onto your PC\'s RAM chips. It\'s designed to fit a wide variety of RAM module banks as well','The spring-loaded legs of the Neon Crab clamp onto the memory module bracket in your PC to direct cooling air onto your PC\'s RAM chips. It\'s designed to fit a wide variety of RAM module banks as well as many other components of similar size. The Neon Crab uses two 4,500-rpm fans to keep a steady flow of cooling air moving through your PC. Includes 3-pin to Molex 4-pin adapter.','crab cooler,neon,memory cooler,crab memory cooler','Alpha Omega','12.48','40','11.23','0.26','1','1'),
