 ('163 0123','Venus Gogo 2.5in USB Otg HDD Encl, Silver','http://www.efilliate.com/templates/SearchDetail.asp?ProductID=12731','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_thumb/P12731.jpg','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_images/P12731a.jpg','Computer Components>Drives and Storage>External Enclosures','The Venus GOGO 2.5 drive enclosure uses the new USB OTG (On the Go) specification which allows it to share data between your 2.5 HDD (not included) and other USB mass storage devices without using a','The Venus GOGO 2.5 drive enclosure uses the new USB OTG (On the Go) specification which allows it to share data between your 2.5 HDD (not included) and other USB mass storage devices without using a computer. Connect MP3 players, USB card readers and digital cameras right to the Venus GOGO and back them up with one touch! Supports USB mass storage standard device system format; supports FAT 12/16/32. Works with Windows 98SE (requires drivers), Windows 2000/XP and Mac OS 9.0+.','venus,venus hdd enclosure,drive enclosure,usb drive','AMS','44.02','0','0','1.05','1','1'),
