 ('163 0139','Vantec 2.5/3.5in Sata HDD Dock To USB 2.0/esata','http://www.efilliate.com/templates/SearchDetail.asp?ProductID=22660','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_thumb/P22660.jpg','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_images/P22660a.jpg','Computer Components>Drives and Storage>Hard Drive Accessories','The NexStar Hard Drive Dock makes it utterly simple to connect a bare SATA drive to your computer! Just take a 2.5 or 3.5 drive and drop it into the dock like bread in a toaster. The drive mounts on','The NexStar Hard Drive Dock makes it utterly simple to connect a bare SATA drive to your computer! Just take a 2.5 or 3.5 drive and drop it into the dock like bread in a toaster. The drive mounts on your computer using either USB 2.0 or eSATA. Exchange files between the drive and your PC at up to 3.0Gbps. When you\'re done, just press the eject button! Includes USB cable, eSATA cable, external to internal SATA converter, AC adapter, and drivers on a MiniCD. SATA hard drives not included. Requires computer equipped with USB 2.0 or SATA, and Microsoft Windows 98SE+ or Mac OS 8.6+. Not compatible with ATA/ATAPI (IDE) drives.','hard drive enclosure,hdd,3.5hdd,hdd dock,usb hdd','Vantec','35.22','20','32.67','2.15','1','0');
insert into `z_reseller` values('163 0169','Firewire 3.5 In. External HDD Enclosure','http://www.efilliate.com/templates/SearchDetail.asp?ProductID=7492','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_thumb/P7492.jpg','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_images/P7492a.jpg','Computer Components>Drives and Storage>External Enclosures','This 3.5 HDD external enclosure connects to your computer with either fast USB 2.0 or generally faster IEEE1394 (FireWire). Use Vantec\'s NexStar enclosure to transfer large amounts of data between co','This 3.5 HDD external enclosure connects to your computer with either fast USB 2.0 or generally faster IEEE1394 (FireWire). Use Vantec\'s NexStar enclosure to transfer large amounts of data between computers safely or to create a high-capacity removable storage archive. Includes USB cable, FireWire cable, removable stand, AC adapter and software on CD-ROM. Requires 3.5 ATA/ATAPI (IDE) drive, not included.','portable HD,portable hard drive, external hard drive,external hd,hd,hard drive','Vantec','48.66','10','45.5','2.02','0','0'),
 ('163 0187','Nexstar 3, 3.5in IDE HDD Enclosure, USB 2.0, Red','http://www.efilliate.com/templates/SearchDetail.asp?ProductID=9681','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_thumb/P9681.jpg','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_images/P9681a.jpg','Computer Components>Drives and Storage>External Enclosures','Here\'s one sharp-looking way to protect your 3.5 hard drive! With its mirror-finish, sleek curves and fiery red color, the NexStar 3 stands out from the crowd but its beauty is more than skin deep. A','Here\'s one sharp-looking way to protect your 3.5 hard drive! With its mirror-finish, sleek curves and fiery red color, the NexStar 3 stands out from the crowd but its beauty is more than skin deep. A sturdy drive cage protects your HDD while the aluminum case effectively draws away heat. Chrome details finish off this collision of form and function.',' ','Vantec','35.21','10','32.67','2.85','1','1'),
 ('163 0189','Nexstar 3, 3.5in IDE HDD Enclosure, USB 2.0, Black','http://www.efilliate.com/templates/SearchDetail.asp?ProductID=10470','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_thumb/P10470.jpg','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_images/P10470a.jpg','Computer Components>Drives and Storage>External Enclosures','Here\'s one sharp-looking way to protect your 3.5 hard drive! With its sleek curves and deep black mirror-finish shell, the NexStar 3 stands out from the crowd but its beauty is more than skin deep. A','Here\'s one sharp-looking way to protect your 3.5 hard drive! With its sleek curves and deep black mirror-finish shell, the NexStar 3 stands out from the crowd but its beauty is more than skin deep. A sturdy drive cage protects your HDD while the aluminum case effectively draws away heat. Chrome details finish off this collision of form and function. Includes vertical stand, 4\' USB cord, AC adapter with 10\' of cord and drivers on CD-ROM.','usb enclosure,nexstar 3,nextstar,3.5 enclosure,mobile enclosure','Vantec','35.21','10','32.67','2.85','1','1'),
