 ('163 0201','Nexstar Nas External HDD Encl, Black','http://www.efilliate.com/templates/SearchDetail.asp?ProductID=13032','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_thumb/P13032.jpg','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_images/P13032a.jpg','Networking>Network Access Storage (NAS)','Install a standard ATA/ATAPI (IDE) hard drive into the NexStar LX NAS (network attached storage) hard drive enclosure, and you\'ll be able to store and access movies, music, and photos from your entire','Install a standard ATA/ATAPI (IDE) hard drive into the NexStar LX NAS (network attached storage) hard drive enclosure, and you\'ll be able to store and access movies, music, and photos from your entire network as well as from anywhere on the Internet. With its USB port, the NexStar LX can also be used as a simple enclosure when a network is not available. No matter where you are, the NexStar LX will keep your data within reach. Includes AC adapter and a 5\' USB cable. Requires ATA-6 compatible 3.5 IDE (Parallel ATA) hard drive (up to 750GB capacity). Microsoft Windows 98SE/Me/2000/XP or Mac OS 9.1+ is required for setup.','nexstar,external drive,external hdd,NAS,network attached storage','Vantec','64.98','0','0','2.95','1','1'),
 ('163 0202','Nexstar Nas External HDD Encl, White','http://www.efilliate.com/templates/SearchDetail.asp?ProductID=13033','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_thumb/P13033.jpg','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_images/P13033a.jpg','Networking>Network Access Storage (NAS)','Install a standard ATA/ATAPI (IDE) hard drive into the NexStar LX NAS (network attached storage) hard drive enclosure, and you\'ll be able to store and access movies, music, and photos from your entire','Install a standard ATA/ATAPI (IDE) hard drive into the NexStar LX NAS (network attached storage) hard drive enclosure, and you\'ll be able to store and access movies, music, and photos from your entire network as well as from anywhere on the Internet. With its USB port, the NexStar LX can also be used as a simple enclosure when a network is not available. No matter where you are, the NexStar LX will keep your data within reach. Includes AC adapter and a 5\' USB cable. Requires ATA-6 compatible 3.5 IDE (Parallel ATA) hard drive. Microsoft Windows 98SE/Me/2000/XP or Mac OS 9.1+ is required for setup.','nexstar,external drive,external hdd','Vantec','64.98','0','0','2.95','0','0'),
 ('163 0209','Cradlepoint Mobile Broadband Router','http://www.efilliate.com/templates/SearchDetail.asp?ProductID=23898','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_thumb/P23898.jpg','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_images/P23898a.jpg','Networking>Wireless Networking (WiFi)>Wireless Routers','The Cradlepoint mobile broadband router connects multiple computers to the Internet, utilizing only a single broadband EV-DO or HSDPA device. It functions as an access point, communicating with local','The Cradlepoint mobile broadband router connects multiple computers to the Internet, utilizing only a single broadband EV-DO or HSDPA device. It functions as an access point, communicating with local computers over 802.11b/g/n* wireless and to the Internet via your cellular 3G handset or ExpressCard. It allows your desktop PCs to use your cellular device, or it can create a Wi-Fi hot spot where fixed broadband connections are unavailable. Cellular data coverage varies by area; consult your carrier for availability. Includes Ethernet adapter and AC adapter. Requires active EV-DO or HSDPA ExpressCard or USB-connecting handset. *802.11n draft speeds','broadband,mobile,portable,wifi,wireless,router','Cradlepoint','249','0','0','2.2','1','1'),
