 ('163 0219','Vantec Nexstar 3i External 3.5in Sata HDD Encl','http://www.efilliate.com/templates/SearchDetail.asp?ProductID=24098','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_thumb/P24098.jpg','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_images/P24098a.jpg','Computer Components>Drives and Storage>External Enclosures','Vantec\'s NexStar 3i enclosure is designed to self-regulate its power consumption, improving efficiency and potentially extending the life of the installed hard drive. Three power management modes--idl','Vantec\'s NexStar 3i enclosure is designed to self-regulate its power consumption, improving efficiency and potentially extending the life of the installed hard drive. Three power management modes--idle, standby, and power down--can be custom set to balance between data needs and power savings. In addition, the NexStar\'s aluminum casing helps cool your drive. Includes power management software on CD-ROM. Requires 3.5 SATA hard drive, not included.','nexstar,3I,external,sata,hard,drive,hdd,enclosure','Vantec','40.8','0','0','2.3','1','1'),
 ('163 0228','Fire-safe Waterproof Hard Drive, 160gb','http://www.efilliate.com/templates/SearchDetail.asp?ProductID=25558','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_thumb/P25558.jpg','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_images/P25558a.jpg','Computer Components>Drives and Storage>External Hard Drives','Encased in the patented SentrySafe concrete-based shell, this hard drive is designed to survive for 30 minutes at 1,550 degrees Fahrenheit. It also can be completely submerged with no threat of drive','Encased in the patented SentrySafe concrete-based shell, this hard drive is designed to survive for 30 minutes at 1,550 degrees Fahrenheit. It also can be completely submerged with no threat of drive damage. Fires and floods do happen, so it\'s important that your most valuable data are protected. In addition to the physical protection, Sentry provides free data recovery services and will replace a fire- or water-damaged SentrySafe drive. Includes USB cable and software on CD-ROM. Requires 2 USB ports and Microsoft Windows XP+ or Mac OS 10.4.7+.',' ','SentrySafe','272','0','0','9.9','1','1'),
 ('163 0229','Fire-safe Waterproof Hard Drive, 250gb','http://www.efilliate.com/templates/SearchDetail.asp?ProductID=25579','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_thumb/P25579.jpg','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_images/P25579a.jpg','Computer Components>Drives and Storage>External Hard Drives','Encased in the patented SentrySafe concrete-based shell, this hard drive is designed to survive for 30 minutes at 1,550 degrees Fahrenheit. It also can be completely submerged with no threat of drive','Encased in the patented SentrySafe concrete-based shell, this hard drive is designed to survive for 30 minutes at 1,550 degrees Fahrenheit. It also can be completely submerged with no threat of drive damage. Fires and floods do happen, so it\'s important that your most valuable data are protected. In addition to the physical protection, Sentry provides free data recovery services and will replace a fire- or water-damaged SentrySafe drive. Includes USB cable and software on CD-ROM. Requires 2 USB ports and Microsoft Windows XP+ or Mac OS 10.4.7+.',' ','SentrySafe','329','0','0','9.9','1','1'),
 ('163 0230','Fire-safe Waterproof Data Storage Chest, USB 2.0','http://www.efilliate.com/templates/SearchDetail.asp?ProductID=25658','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_thumb/P25658.jpg','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_images/P25658a.jpg','Computer Components>Drives and Storage>External Enclosures','Protect an external USB hard drive in a lockable safe that\'s both fire- and water-proof... while still retaining access to the drive\'s data. The SentrySafe Data Storage Chest includes a pass-through U','Protect an external USB hard drive in a lockable safe that\'s both fire- and water-proof... while still retaining access to the drive\'s data. The SentrySafe Data Storage Chest includes a pass-through USB port so that you can keep a protected drive connected to your computer. The safe\'s concrete-based lining is ETL-verified to protect contents against total submersion or against 30 minutes at 1,550 degrees Fahrenheit. Ten double-sided hanging pockets for CDs and DVDs are also included. Usable with USB 2.0 powered devices only; does not support externally powered devices.',' ','SentrySafe','139','0','0','20.15','1','1'),
