 ('190 0557','Wireless Stereo Headphones, 900mhz, Black','http://www.efilliate.com/templates/SearchDetail.asp?ProductID=28878','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_thumb/P28878.jpg','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_images/P28878a.jpg','Digital/Multimedia Products>Headphones and Accessories','Enjoy your favorite music through these hands-free wireless stereo headphones that can be used up to 165 feet away from the base station. The high-quality drivers produce very little noise and distort','Enjoy your favorite music through these hands-free wireless stereo headphones that can be used up to 165 feet away from the base station. The high-quality drivers produce very little noise and distortion and the comfortable ear cups are softly padded to block exterior sound. The transmitter base doubles as a charger for the two included NiMH AAA batteries. Includes 1/4 jack adapter, RCA jack adapter, iPhone plug extender and AC adapter.',' ','Audio Unlimited','41.89','6','39.67','2.15','1','1'),
 ('190 0558','Wireless Indoor/outdoor Speakers W/ Remote, Black','http://www.efilliate.com/templates/SearchDetail.asp?ProductID=28879','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_thumb/P28879.jpg','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_images/P28879a.jpg','Digital/Multimedia Products>Speakers','Connect the transmitter to your favorite audio source... stereo, MP3 player, CD player... and it\'ll transmit your music to the battery-powered speaker towers. Enjoy excellent audio quality indoors or','Connect the transmitter to your favorite audio source... stereo, MP3 player, CD player... and it\'ll transmit your music to the battery-powered speaker towers. Enjoy excellent audio quality indoors or out without worry about tripping over cables. The included remote can remotely control the volume level for even more convenience. Works with your iPod(R)/iPhone player or any other audio device. Includes transmitter, remote control, 3 AC adapters, cable adapters. Battery use requires 12 C batteries, not included.',' ','Audio Unlimited','95.08','2','92.17','7.94','1','1'),
