 ('190 0572','Behringer USB Audio Input/output Adapter','http://www.efilliate.com/templates/SearchDetail.asp?ProductID=13836','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_thumb/P13836.jpg','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_images/P13836a.jpg','Digital/Multimedia Products>Digital A/V Solutions>Audio Processors','The Behringer USB audio adapter can send analog signals from audio equipment and instruments to your computer for recording... or it can play digital files from your computer to your stereo system, mi','The Behringer USB audio adapter can send analog signals from audio equipment and instruments to your computer for recording... or it can play digital files from your computer to your stereo system, mixer board or other audio output device. It digitizes audio received over the RCA jacks from nearly any audio source. Then use the analog or SPDIF optical digital output jacks to send audio from your computer to a speaker system or recording deck. Requires 1GHz CPU, 512MB RAM and either Microsoft Windows XP SP2/Vista or Mac OS 10.3.9+. Audio recording and editing software is available for free download at behringer.com. Audio devices shown not included.','audio adapter,usb audio adapter','Behringer','34.99','0','0','0.55','1','1'),
 ('190 0573','Blueant V1 Bluetooth Headset, Voice Cntl Dual Mics','http://www.efilliate.com/templates/SearchDetail.asp?ProductID=28338','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_thumb/P28338.jpg','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_images/P28338a.jpg','Mobile Computing and Travel Products>Cell/PDA Products>Hands Free Devices','Answer or dial calls using your voice alone with a true hands-free Bluetooth headset from BlueAnt. Dual microphones and voice isolation technology provide outstanding noise suppression, wind noise red','Answer or dial calls using your voice alone with a true hands-free Bluetooth headset from BlueAnt. Dual microphones and voice isolation technology provide outstanding noise suppression, wind noise reduction and echo cancellation. Foam tips from Comply help block noise further for use in noisy environments. Includes AC charger, 12V DC car charger, USB charge cable and tie clip. Requires Bluetooth cell phone, not included.',' ','BlueAnt','99.95','0','0','0.55','1','1'),
