 ('190 0575','Blueant Supertooth 3 Hands-free Bluetooth Spkr/phn','http://www.efilliate.com/templates/SearchDetail.asp?ProductID=28339','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_thumb/P28339.jpg','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_images/P28339a.jpg','Mobile Computing and Travel Products>Cell/PDA Products>Hands Free Devices','Here\'s a hands-free speakerphone that is truly hand-free! The BlueAnt Supertooth 3 attaches to your vehicle\'s sun visor, and uses voice caller ID to announce callers. Just say OK to accept the call!','Here\'s a hands-free speakerphone that is truly hand-free! The BlueAnt Supertooth 3 attaches to your vehicle\'s sun visor, and uses voice caller ID to announce callers. Just say OK to accept the call! Since it\'s built with a rechargeable battery, you can clip the SuperTooth II to your car\'s sun visor or use wherever you go. The ultra-sensitive microphone and digital noise-cancellation features allow for crystal clear communications with any Bluetooth-equipped cell phone. Includes 12V DC auto charger and AC adapter. Requires Bluetooth phone, not included.',' ','BlueAnt','99.95','0','0','1','0','0'),
 ('190 0579','Blueant Z9i Bluetooth Headset, Red','http://www.efilliate.com/templates/SearchDetail.asp?ProductID=28359','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_thumb/P28359.jpg','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_images/P28359a.jpg','Mobile Computing and Travel Products>Cell/PDA Products>Hands Free Devices','The BlueAnt Z9 provides world-class noise suppression and echo cancellation, with near-zero voice distortion. Its voice isolation technology utilizes dual microphones and digital signal processing to','The BlueAnt Z9 provides world-class noise suppression and echo cancellation, with near-zero voice distortion. Its voice isolation technology utilizes dual microphones and digital signal processing to remove almost all background noise so your calls always sound clear. The BlueAnt weighs just 10 grams (0.35 oz.) and its Li-Po battery can provide up to 5 1/2 hours of talk time. Includes 2 ear buds, 2 ear clips, AC adapter and USB charge cable. Requires Bluetooth phone, not included.',' ','BlueAnt','84.99','0','0','0.5','1','1'),
 ('190 0581','Blueant Supertooth Light Speakerphone, White','http://www.efilliate.com/templates/SearchDetail.asp?ProductID=28498','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_thumb/P28498.jpg','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_images/P28498a.jpg','Mobile Computing and Travel Products>Cell/PDA Products>Hands Free Devices','BlueAnt\'s sun visor-mounted speakerphone uses sophisticated digital audio technology and is compatible with Bluetooth mobile phones. Its clear voice capture and digital signal processing technologies','BlueAnt\'s sun visor-mounted speakerphone uses sophisticated digital audio technology and is compatible with Bluetooth mobile phones. Its clear voice capture and digital signal processing technologies from Cambridge Silicon Radio provide outstanding audio performance. It separates voice signals from other sounds and applies acoustic echo cancellation and noise suppression to both incoming and outgoing voices. The included rechargeable battery provides up to 15 hours of continuous talk time. Includes double-sided magnetic clip and 12V DC-to-USB and AC-to-USB chargers. Requires Bluetooth 1.2 phone.',' ','BlueAnt','72.75','0','0','1','0','0'),
 ('190 0634','Ipod FM Transmitter And 12v Charger','http://www.efilliate.com/templates/SearchDetail.asp?ProductID=8382','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_thumb/P8382.jpg','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_images/P8382a.jpg','Digital/Multimedia Products>iPod Chargers and Gadgets','Listen to your iPod through your car stereo! Powered by your car\'s 12V cigarette lighter socket, the iPod transmitter uses FM frequencies from 88.1MHz to 107.9MHz. Simply select an open frequency on y','Listen to your iPod through your car stereo! Powered by your car\'s 12V cigarette lighter socket, the iPod transmitter uses FM frequencies from 88.1MHz to 107.9MHz. Simply select an open frequency on your car radio, match that frequency on the transmitter and listen to your iPod playlist right through your car stereo with no headphones. Not compatible with Apple iPhone.','ipod,fm,fm transmitter','Ziotek','30.5','100','27.45','0.18','0','0'),
 ('190 0652','2.5mm Mobile Headset To PC Converter','http://www.efilliate.com/templates/SearchDetail.asp?ProductID=10510','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_thumb/P10510.jpg','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_images/P10510a.jpg','Cables and Adapters>Adapters and Couplers>Audio/Video Adapters','Now you can use your mobile headset and its hands-free lapel or boom mic on your PC with this 2.5mm headset to dual 3.5mm minijack adapter. The adapter plugs into the 3.5mm microphone and headphones j','Now you can use your mobile headset and its hands-free lapel or boom mic on your PC with this 2.5mm headset to dual 3.5mm minijack adapter. The adapter plugs into the 3.5mm microphone and headphones jacks on your soundcard or PC case.','mobile to pc, headset adapter','Express Products','1.45','500','1.3','0.04','1','0'),
 ('190 0656','Smartshare Headphone Splitter W/ Volume Control','http://www.efilliate.com/templates/SearchDetail.asp?ProductID=12409','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_thumb/P12409.jpg','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_images/P12409a.jpg','Cables and Adapters>Adapters and Couplers>Audio/Video Adapters','With the SmartShare headphone splitter two people can listen to one audio source...iPod, MP3 player, CD/DVD player...and each listener can independently control the volume they hear.','With the SmartShare headphone splitter two people can listen to one audio source...iPod, MP3 player, CD/DVD player...and each listener can independently control the volume they hear.','splitter,headphone splitter','Griffin Technology','12.01','48','10.81','0.15','1','1'),
 ('190 0800','Rf Link 5.8 Ghz Audio/video Transmitter/receiver','http://www.efilliate.com/templates/SearchDetail.asp?ProductID=9764','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_thumb/P9764.jpg','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_images/P9764a.jpg','Digital/Multimedia Products>Digital A/V Solutions>Video Converters','The RF-Link wireless transmitter sends audio/video from one room in your house to another... without running wires! You can connect the transmitter to your cable box, DVD player, television or any oth','The RF-Link wireless transmitter sends audio/video from one room in your house to another... without running wires! You can connect the transmitter to your cable box, DVD player, television or any other A/V source that outputs an A/V signal and then watch that transmission on a TV somewhere else in your home. Most other A/V transmitters use the crowded 2.4GHz band and suffer from interference caused by cordless phones, microwave ovens and Wi-Fi or Bluetooth RF signals. By utilizing the 5.8GHz range, your transmitted TV and audio signals will be clearer and cleaner. The system includes an additional IR receiver/transmitter so you can control the A/V source you\'re watching from your remote location with your regular remote control.','5.8G,5.8GHz','RF-Link','115.84','8','110.83','3.3','1','1'),
 ('190 0801','I2i Stream Wireless Audio Broadcaster And Receiver','http://www.efilliate.com/templates/SearchDetail.asp?ProductID=24718','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_thumb/P24718.jpg','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_images/P24718a.jpg','Digital/Multimedia Products>Digital A/V Solutions>Audio Processors','Plug the i2i Stream into your iPod(R) or any other MP3 player and transmit your music to your friends... wirelessly! Any i2i Stream unit can be used as a transmitter or a receiver... just press the ch','Plug the i2i Stream into your iPod(R) or any other MP3 player and transmit your music to your friends... wirelessly! Any i2i Stream unit can be used as a transmitter or a receiver... just press the channel button until the units are showing the same color and rock out! The 30-foot transmission range is the only limit to how many receivers can listen in to a single iPod. Includes 4 audio cables, 2 USB charge cables, and 2 lanyards. Requires any 3.5mm audio source and headphones for each listener. USB power required for recharging. Sold as a two-pack. Each listener requires one i2i Stream unit.',' ','Aerielle','99.95','0','0','0.7','0','0'),
 ('190 0804','Rf Link 5.8ghz Audio/video Receiver','http://www.efilliate.com/templates/SearchDetail.asp?ProductID=10950','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_thumb/P10950.jpg','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_images/P10950a.jpg','Digital/Multimedia Products>Digital A/V Solutions>Video Converters','The RF-Link wireless receiver acquires audio/video from another room in your house... without running wires! This additional receiver works with the transmitter (sold separately) attached to your cabl','The RF-Link wireless receiver acquires audio/video from another room in your house... without running wires! This additional receiver works with the transmitter (sold separately) attached to your cable box, DVD player, television or any other A/V source that outputs an A/V signal. Multiple receivers can all pick up the same video transmission. Includes composite video/audio cable and AC adapter.',' ','RF-Link','67.21','0','0','1.35','1','1'),
 ('202 0113','Intellinet 802.11g Access Point, Poe Support','http://www.efilliate.com/templates/SearchDetail.asp?ProductID=14757','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_thumb/P14757.jpg','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_images/P14757a.jpg','Networking>Wireless Networking (WiFi)>Wireless Routers','Intellinet\'s high-powered 802.11b/g wireless access point provides stronger connections for optimum network performance. It also has a built-in power extractor on an Ethernet port, allowing you to use','Intellinet\'s high-powered 802.11b/g wireless access point provides stronger connections for optimum network performance. It also has a built-in power extractor on an Ethernet port, allowing you to use a single CAT5 cable (and a PoE injector) to deliver both a data connection and electrical power. Includes antenna, CAT5 cable, stand, wall-mounting kit, AC adapter and software on CD-ROM. PoE use requires 802.3af-compliant power injector at the router end, not included.','wireless router,4 port router,802.11g,wireless network,access point','Intellinet','86.93','10','78.9','1.9','1','1');
insert into `z_reseller` values('202 0115','Cradlepoint Phs Wireless Personal Hotspot Router','http://www.efilliate.com/templates/SearchDetail.asp?ProductID=20098','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_thumb/P20098.jpg','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_images/P20098a.jpg','Networking>Wireless Networking (WiFi)>Wireless Routers','Cradlepoint\'s battery-powered Personal Hotspot lets you set up a Wi-Fi router anywhere you can use a 3G cellular modem... you don\'t even need a power outlet! The router can keep multiple 802.11b/g com','Cradlepoint\'s battery-powered Personal Hotspot lets you set up a Wi-Fi router anywhere you can use a 3G cellular modem... you don\'t even need a power outlet! The router can keep multiple 802.11b/g computers connected to the Internet using a single EVDO device. With full security features and access controls, the Wi-Fi router can be used for field meetings, emergency situations, convention blogging, picnics, camping and more. Includes AC adapter. Requires compatible USB 3G cellular modem, or compatible ExpressCard modem and USB adapter. See the following compatibility list. Verizon Data Devices:  USB720, USB727, AC595U, UM150, V640, V740, KPC680  Verizon Cellular Phones:  LG VX7200, VX8000, Motorola V3c RAZR, RIM Blackberry 8703e/8830 Sprint Data Devices:  U720, U727, AC595U, EX720, Franklin CDU680  Sprint Cellular Phones:  Samsung A920 & i830, Sanyo M1 & Katana 2, Motorola V3c RAZR, RIM Blackberry 8703e & 8830, LG Musiq Alltel Data Devices:  KPC680 Some devices will require a firmware update. ExpressCard modems will require a USB adapter. Please note, does not support AC597E ExpressCards.','router,cradlepoint,phs,wireless,personal,hotspot,wifi,router','Cradlepoint','179','0','0','1','1','1'),
 ('202 0118','12-in-1 Expresscard Card Reader','http://www.efilliate.com/templates/SearchDetail.asp?ProductID=15620','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_thumb/P15620.jpg','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_images/P15620a.jpg','Mobile Computing and Travel Products>Notebook Add-In Cards','Here\'s a great way to add an ultracompact flash media reader if your laptop has one of the new ExpressCard 34 slots. You\'ll be able to access many popular media card formats, including Secure Digital,','Here\'s a great way to add an ultracompact flash media reader if your laptop has one of the new ExpressCard 34 slots. You\'ll be able to access many popular media card formats, including Secure Digital, Memory Stick and xD-Picture Card as well as the newer SDHC (Secure Digitial High Capacity) cards used in high-resolution cameras. Requires ExpressCard slot and either Microsoft Windows 2000/XP/Vista or Mac OS X 10.1+. Not compatible with PC Card (CardBus) slots.','expresscard,expresscard reader,card reader,flash card reader','GWC','16.64','100','14.98','0.2','1','1'),
 ('202 0120','10/100 PCI Ethernet Adapter','http://www.efilliate.com/templates/SearchDetail.asp?ProductID=1584','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_thumb/P1584.jpg','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_images/P1584a.jpg','Computer Components>I/O and Video Cards>Network I/O Cards (NIC)','Connect your PC to a 10/100 Ethernet network with this standard and affordable PCI network interface card (NIC).','Connect your PC to a 10/100 Ethernet network with this standard and affordable PCI network interface card (NIC).','ethernet,lan,network,network card,ethernet card,network io,ethernet io,lan card,connectgear,connect gear,conectgear, conect gear','ConnectGear','7.69','40','6.92','0.4','1','1'),
 ('202 0121','Belkin N1 Vision 4-pt Wireless Router','http://www.efilliate.com/templates/SearchDetail.asp?ProductID=18559','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_thumb/P18559.jpg','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_images/P18559a.jpg','Networking>Wireless Networking (WiFi)>Wireless Routers','The N1 Vision router\'s easy-to-read LCD tells you everything you need to know about how your wireless network is functioning. It reports broadband speed, bandwidth usage, device usage and all connecte','The N1 Vision router\'s easy-to-read LCD tells you everything you need to know about how your wireless network is functioning. It reports broadband speed, bandwidth usage, device usage and all connected users. Compliant with the draft 2.0 of the forthcoming 802.11n wireless standard, it provides up to 300Mbps data transfers or an operating range up to 1,600 feet. Simple setup instructions and built-in software make it easy to get up and running. Includes CAT5 cable and AC adapter. Requires Microsoft Windows 2000/XP/Vista or Mac OS 10.4 for setup. Note: Although Belkin has designed the N1 Vision to be upgradeable to the final 802.11n specification, it may not be possible.','belkin,802.11n,4port,4 port,4-port,wireless,router','Belkin','145','0','0','2.5','0','0'),
