and Sun SunNet Manager)  Private MIB LAN Administration Tool support  XAdmin32 and XAdmin compatible with legacy silex print server administration utilities WebXAdmin server configuration and management.HP JetAdmin and Web JetAdmin. Novell ManageWise command line interface accessible via TELNET and NetWare If you require high levels of security, the PocketPro is one of the best solutions for secure network printing. It is one of the few print servers that supports the 802.1X authentication protocol, including EAP-TLS, EAP-TTLS, EAP-FAST, PEAP, and LEAP. It also lets you encrypt your printing jobs using Triple DES, AES, or Twofish via a Windows-compatible port monitor. In addition, the SX-2933 provides IP access control list security, which allows you to restrict access to the printer based on the IP address of the sending computer. The PocketPro can increase productivity by shortening print waiting times. IT managers can avoid buying a faster printer by fully utilizing their existing printer speeds. When it comes to printing graphics documents, with a throughput of nearly one megabyte per second, the PocketPro 100S can handle the toughest jobs in the shortest amount of time. The SX-2933 also supports numerous features for configuration flexibility, ease of use, and diagnostic LEDs to indicate power-on, link, activity. Text-to-PostScript conversion on a per-service basis Programmable character string conversion and Communications Protocol or can be forced into binary mode).On-line HELP with sophisticated diagnostics, including protocol trace capability and crash dump. Flash memory allows for easy upgrades via TCP/IP Windows Update Utility, XAdmin, tftp master or slave mode, BOOTP, NetWare, and DEC MOP.','print server,mini,server,parallel,print,server','Silex','154.54','0','0','1.3','0','0'),
