 ('202 0265','Crossbox USB 2.0 Data Transfer Tool','http://www.efilliate.com/templates/SearchDetail.asp?ProductID=11951','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_thumb/P11951.jpg','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_images/P11951a.jpg','Cables and Adapters>USB 2.0 Cables','This all-in-one device makes transferring files from one PC to another a snap! Simply plug the USB cables between computers and the built-in file transfer software comes right up. You can then drag a','This all-in-one device makes transferring files from one PC to another a snap! Simply plug the USB cables between computers and the built-in file transfer software comes right up. You can then drag and drop files from one computer to the other. Its that easy! Once connected to each PC, CROSSBOX automatically displays both hard drives on the screen enabling the user to quickly locate and copy files to and from each system. Operating at USB 2.0 speeds, CROSSBOX moves files 600 percent faster than standard flash memory-based storage media. CROSSBOX is pocket-sized and has retractable cables allowing it to be easily carried anywhere. Requires Windows 98SE+.','usb file transfer,retractable usb tool','JMTek','41.17','50','37.05','0.2','1','1'),
