 ('202 5706','Wireless Audio/video Sender, VGA And Dvi, 802.11b/g','http://www.efilliate.com/templates/SearchDetail.asp?ProductID=15479','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_thumb/P15479.jpg','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_images/P15479a.jpg','Networking>Wireless Networking (WiFi)>Wireless Routers','The InternetVue 2100 wireless audio/video adapter uses your laptop\'s 802.11g wireless networking capabilities to transmit video to a monitor or projector up to 100 feet away. Simply connect the EchoVi','The InternetVue 2100 wireless audio/video adapter uses your laptop\'s 802.11g wireless networking capabilities to transmit video to a monitor or projector up to 100 feet away. Simply connect the EchoView to your monitor, projector or digital TV. The built-in Ethernet-out port can be connected to the Internet so that a connected laptop can access Web sites too... perfect for presentations. Includes AC adapter, 10 audio patch cable, CAT 5 Ethernet cable, antenna, wall-mounting hardware and software on CD-ROM. Requires Pentium 4 PC (or better) with 802.11g wireless capability and Windows 2000 SP4/XP SP2/Vista. Addlogix\'s InternetVue 2100 is a PC2TV adapter that connects to a display\'s DVI/VGA input and enables a computer to stream video to the display without any cable. InternetVue 2100 is Codec independent. This means video clips such as browser-based streaming movies, YouTube.com clips, digital photo slide shows, PowerPoint presentations can all be watched on TV or other DVI/VGA displays such as projectors. With InternetVue 2100, instead of restricted to the computers screen, digital video can now be enjoyed on the big screen TV. When conducting business presentations, presenters no longer are limited by the cable length from the computer to the projector.','audio sender,video sender,wireless sender','Addlogix','174.83','0','0','1.45','1','1');
