 ('204 0108','Modosteady, 3-in-1 Camcorder Stabilizer','http://www.efilliate.com/templates/SearchDetail.asp?ProductID=20040','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_thumb/P20040.jpg','http://www.efilliate.com/images/prod_images/P20040a.jpg','Digital/Multimedia Products>Camera and Photo Accessories','As a counterbalance stabilizer the Modosteady will make your camcorder seem to float as you move along to follow the action you\'re shooting. It makes your camcorder react slowly to your motion so your','As a counterbalance stabilizer the Modosteady will make your camcorder seem to float as you move along to follow the action you\'re shooting. It makes your camcorder react slowly to your motion so your video recording is steady and smooth. As the action speeds up, switch to the shoulder brace and take aim. You\'ll get great support, but its easy to follow fast paced action. Finally pull the cap off the end of the handle, the handle splits to become the three legs of a table-top tripod.The bottom rubber foot adjusts to counterbalance the precise center gravity of your camcorder','3in1,camcorder,stabilizer,stand','Manfrotto','136.56','0','0','1.32','1','1'),
